/u/281068747?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/3e0d64fca1ed5ebceab9d951a8f22a910770e4ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T05:45:08Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T05:45:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(phase-4): remove Phase-3 cutover workflows and coupled CI archaeology (ADR-0072 W1) (#522)\n\n* chore(phase-4): remove Phase-3 cutover workflows and coupled CI archaeology (ADR-0072 W1)\n\nWorkflows 111 -> 40: 71 Phase-3c cutover / marathon / watch-day /\noperator-recipe workflows deleted (58 L + 2 A + 7 window probes + 4\nTomás-Entscheid defaults), phase-2-validation-gate renamed to\nruntime-acceptance-gates.yml with job display name\n\"runtime acceptance gates\"; seven job display names cleaned of\nTag-N / Sprint / Phase-3b tokens.\n\nCoupled files: tests/ci 84 -> 12, tooling/ci 89 -> 15,\nscripts/phase-3c, scripts/ci/ar-hand-*, docs/ci runbooks,\ndocs/phase-3c, state/ sign-offs, tests/fixtures/phase-3-marathon-bilanz\ndeleted; Phase-3-COMPLETE marker + OTS proof + ratification stamps moved\nto docs/archive/evidence/phase-3/; SBOM/cosign baselines moved to\ntooling/baselines/; live-VM reports to docs/archive/reports/.\n\nci_aggregator.py inventory entry 6 re-pointed; branch-protection\ninventory consolidated into docs/ci/branch-protection-required-checks.md\n(10 live contexts + runtime acceptance gates pending); verifier and\naudit tests updated. Rollback pattern preserved as\ndocs/design-notes/backend-rollback.md. docs/archive/README.md points to\ntag archive/pre-phase-4 (58794eb) for the full pre-cleanup tree.\n\nTests whose sole subject was deleted were removed (tests/phase_3c,\ntests/quality_gates, 27 tests/observability, 16 tests/scripts, 4\nwirelang persona-engine workflow-shape tests, single functions in five\nfiles). pytest wirelang/ green; pytest tests/ has zero new failures\nagainst the 58794eb baseline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): install pytest in live-vm rotation state-machine probe\n\nThe probe workflow ran ``python3 -m pytest`` on a stdlib-only Python\nsetup and failed with ``No module named pytest`` on every run since it\nlanded (2026-05-19). Add the same explicit pytest install step the\nsibling OTS pre-anchor probe already uses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): live-vm rotation probe test-suite step also needs PyYAML\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: required-context workflows fire on every PR (no path filters)\n\nRemove the paths: filters under push/pull_request from the five\nworkflows whose job display names are required status contexts\n(containerfile-digest-pin-gate, cross-substrate-parity-gate,\nwirelang-spec-freeze-seal-probe, cosign-verify-images,\ncosign-keyless-oidc-drift-probe). A path-filtered required context\nnever reports on PRs outside its filter and leaves them pending\nforever. Job display names are unchanged. Rule documented in\ndocs/ci/branch-protection-required-checks.md; the parity-gate test\nnow pins the universal trigger instead of the old path list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c7b03b4486109e7815d581ddc4ece8f8238fad8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/7c7b03b4486109e7815d581ddc4ece8f8238fad8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/3e0d64fca1ed5ebceab9d951a8f22a910770e4ef","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c7b03b4486109e7815d581ddc4ece8f8238fad8\nparent 58794eb95ffe5e3fd0e94484037abd46189ef8fd\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1789105508 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789105508 +0200\n\nchore(phase-4): remove Phase-3 cutover workflows and coupled CI archaeology (ADR-0072 W1) (#522)\n\n* chore(phase-4): remove Phase-3 cutover workflows and coupled CI archaeology (ADR-0072 W1)\n\nWorkflows 111 -> 40: 71 Phase-3c cutover / marathon / watch-day /\noperator-recipe workflows deleted (58 L + 2 A + 7 window probes + 4\nTomás-Entscheid defaults), phase-2-validation-gate renamed to\nruntime-acceptance-gates.yml with job display name\n\"runtime acceptance gates\"; seven job display names cleaned of\nTag-N / Sprint / Phase-3b tokens.\n\nCoupled files: tests/ci 84 -> 12, tooling/ci 89 -> 15,\nscripts/phase-3c, scripts/ci/ar-hand-*, docs/ci runbooks,\ndocs/phase-3c, state/ sign-offs, tests/fixtures/phase-3-marathon-bilanz\ndeleted; Phase-3-COMPLETE marker + OTS proof + ratification stamps moved\nto docs/archive/evidence/phase-3/; SBOM/cosign baselines moved to\ntooling/baselines/; live-VM reports to docs/archive/reports/.\n\nci_aggregator.py inventory entry 6 re-pointed; branch-protection\ninventory consolidated into docs/ci/branch-protection-required-checks.md\n(10 live contexts + runtime acceptance gates pending); verifier and\naudit tests updated. Rollback pattern preserved as\ndocs/design-notes/backend-rollback.md. docs/archive/README.md points to\ntag archive/pre-phase-4 (58794eb) for the full pre-cleanup tree.\n\nTests whose sole subject was deleted were removed (tests/phase_3c,\ntests/quality_gates, 27 tests/observability, 16 tests/scripts, 4\nwirelang persona-engine workflow-shape tests, single functions in five\nfiles). pytest wirelang/ green; pytest tests/ has zero new failures\nagainst the 58794eb baseline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): install pytest in live-vm rotation state-machine probe\n\nThe probe workflow ran ``python3 -m pytest`` on a stdlib-only Python\nsetup and failed with ``No module named pytest`` on every run since it\nlanded (2026-05-19). Add the same explicit pytest install step the\nsibling OTS pre-anchor probe already uses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): live-vm rotation probe test-suite step also needs PyYAML\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: required-context workflows fire on every PR (no path filters)\n\nRemove the paths: filters under push/pull_request from the five\nworkflows whose job display names are required status contexts\n(containerfile-digest-pin-gate, cross-substrate-parity-gate,\nwirelang-spec-freeze-seal-probe, cosign-verify-images,\ncosign-keyless-oidc-drift-probe). A path-filtered required context\nnever reports on PRs outside its filter and leaves them pending\nforever. Job display names are unchanged. Rule documented in\ndocs/ci/branch-protection-required-checks.md; the parity-gate test\nnow pins the universal trigger instead of the old path list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo5VkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzx8QAIC5sAALyCe+05tAicNXO5Hi\nAmNpg9xSgnh3cJbOxkUv3EWrqZR6tCgYgz3v7pVi0dMMe4UmFYQV+dcph7HFpzBT\niCng4FQ5K0nbfT+YZjhoILCuKode