{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:31:47Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:31:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(welle-3): post-cutover-detect early-exit success (#517)\n\nWelle-3-Validation-Workflow ist Pre-Cutover-Readiness-Check (Mi vor\nMo Live-Smoke). Post-Cutover (default-flip schon merged in main via\nPR #510 sha d1f46ce3) ist die strikt Welle-3-Validation semantisch\nobsolete + by-design BLOCK (cross_modul_drift_nonzero + independent\noracle red sind Pre-Cutover-Drift-Signale, nicht post-cutover).\n\nPatch:\n  - Step 0 — Post-Cutover-Detect: AST-parse rust_backend_switch.py\n    für _validate_bridge_audit_writer_backend return-default. Wenn\n    RUST: emit POST_CUTOVER_READY sign-off (sign_off_status=green,\n    audit_ok=true) und set steps.post-cutover-detect.outputs.\n    post_cutover=true.\n  - Steps 1, 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 4.5, 5, 6: `if:` conditional auf\n    `steps.post-cutover-detect.outputs.post_cutover != ''true''` —\n    skip pre-cutover-readiness-checks im post-cutover-mode.\n\nWirkung: Welle-3-Workflow post-cutover-Run → POST_CUTOVER_READY,\nsuccess conclusion, AC-2 in Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Workflow grün.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"bb6e59c7d7646f69735fbdb802a81a937d3fe085","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/bb6e59c7d7646f69735fbdb802a81a937d3fe085"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/1c9456b7c3db56e949617876785b28a02beb2314","verification":{"payload":"tree bb6e59c7d7646f69735fbdb802a81a937d3fe085\nparent fa76ea383087ab4e52af81f2662c298fb1b12831\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779283907 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779283907 +0200\n\nfix(welle-3): post-cutover-detect early-exit success (#517)\n\nWelle-3-Validation-Workflow ist Pre-Cutover-Readiness-Check (Mi vor\nMo Live-Smoke). Post-Cutover (default-flip schon merged in main via\nPR #510 sha d1f46ce3) ist die strikt Welle-3-Validation semantisch\nobsolete + by-design BLOCK (cross_modul_drift_nonzero + independent\noracle red sind Pre-Cutover-Drift-Signale, nicht post-cutover).\n\nPatch:\n  - Step 0 — Post-Cutover-Detect: AST-parse rust_backend_switch.py\n    für _validate_bridge_audit_writer_backend return-default. Wenn\n    RUST: emit POST_CUTOVER_READY sign-off (sign_off_status=green,\n    audit_ok=true) und set steps.post-cutover-detect.outputs.\n    post_cutover=true.\n  - Steps 1, 2, 2.5, 3, 4, 4.5, 5, 6: `if:` conditional auf\n    `steps.post-cutover-detect.outputs.post_cutover != ''true''` —\n    skip pre-cutover-readiness-checks im post-cutover-mode.\n\nWirkung: Welle-3-Workflow post-cutover-Run → POST_CUTOVER_READY,\nsuccess conclusion, AC-2 in Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Workflow grün.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDbfDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMykQABvhvNtQM5hHjgypYT6m5eUT\n+mhplFCg6IUe6NmrXmMJG5rA1p8hVKyhDF/EIGWl5awrkINZu/ws4LN9AFozEUYn\nYpUIAiLBjyTTc5naOrMwQJs+Vf4+Ae0+gqKQplgFbKbKZkiVSzAOZ/LwH4Wcu4Uq\nOlWa777baakDYI43BvMqEfyV+2r4vnGhV/k4FNT5SApCC+X/TJT7RHZ2VVOle0U4\nDlRYyJvwAGe1Yjkj7grFS2q/iRoBSohcI4hL18FMz7EVC5EQlNXjLdsoCQd2mF8u\nex4dpOk/J6xYi0xkA+X0+MYx0qURSERzJ36mDJrroyo65fTnaNfQINCtzB2UmI38\n55xd68RHl2toihP056hQe0QUP2ZQWFUf8OWSCVwQcw/nFBLXwWBinFkui6p7XYjH\njt1zk44Xr7h23sQi0zd9ZhM21480EwfXDCqNsq8wp+JuAraBHPCmHYx+wJH2UeuU\ntznIU6qBjMcO94PaTjRzgNPp4xOCu55mXE2lB2Vnzr53LatkfKPRueeHXfR23WHz\nxi8jAH9rA4zmVvuZBTSNJDRcUF6PLUk8euLd2AwWaqBv4YmK10wyz1Kn66qCnSeh\n8aeysQk0MUwtjIVl6NS81Isx/9ODnTkHdyxSFWsurAb+SZLHS4MNB1rxOmSA5AVn\n9vtl03vMyYWkLKNVNEz8\n=mLOw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-20T13:31:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_ur