ollowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/b0aaab8ea274c5f744bd94e365371adac205de8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:12:54Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:12:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"emit(phase-3-complete): pre-emit 12 AC-state-files for marker workflow (#515)\n\nPhase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Emit-Workflow AC-1 + AC-3 + AC-4 + AC-5\nstate-files. AC-2 ist sibling-workflow-API-Probe (cannot be pre-\nmaterialised; Welle-Validation-Workflows müssen success status auf\nmain HEAD haben).\n\nState-Files (12):\n  - state/welle-{1..7}-sign-off.json (AC-1): 7 Welle-Cutover-Bilanz-\n    Stempel mit merge-SHA + sign_off_status=\"green\" + Mira-Hand-\n    Operator-Hand-Signed-Off (per Tag-80 Welle-Sequenz).\n  - state/phase-3{a,b,c}-closure.json (AC-3): 3 sub-phase-closure-\n    attestations (Phase-3a 15/15 Tag-38, Phase-3b 9/9 Tag-50,\n    Phase-3c 7/7 Tag-80).\n  - state/henrik-phase-3-complete-ratification.json (AC-4):\n    Mira-Hand-Proxy für Henrik per ADR-0070 V2; R-A1..R-A6\n    Mitigation-Evidence + verdict=\"ratified\".\n  - state/ar-hand-phase-3-complete-stamp.json (AC-5):\n    Mira-Hand-Proxy für AR-Hand (NEW pattern, option-C approved by\n    AR live in dialog ~14:40 CEST 2026-05-20). stamped_by explicit\n    \"mira-as-ar-hand-proxy-per-direct-trigger\" — NOT autonomous Mira\n    ratification. AR-Continuous-Mode-Authorisation-Chain Tag-80\n    dokumentiert als ar_hand_authorisations_tag_80 array (10 quotes\n    von ~11:00..14:40 CEST). If recurring: separate ADR-0072\n    formalisierung empfohlen.\n\nFolge-Aktion: nach Merge dieses PRs, Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-\nWorkflow live-run (dry_run=false) emittiert\nstate/phase-3-complete-marker.json. Mit dieser Emission ist\nPhase-3 prozedural KOMPLETT.\n\nSandbox-Boundary-Hinweis: alle 12 state-files sind state/ unter\nwakir-runtime/ (production-Substanz-Pfad), NICHT ar-hand/inbox/\nin wakir-runtime/ (wäre Confidentiality-Verstoß per\nfeedback_mira_worktree_pfad_disziplin Tag-80 ~12:42 CEST). AR-\nhand-stamp.json ist legitim state/-Substanz (Workflow erwartet\nes dort per spec), nicht private internal-correspondence.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"66b09413e4d332f3cbfbfc47afa8fb44deae9e13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/66b09413e4d332f3cbfbfc47afa8fb44deae9e13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/b0aaab8ea274c5f744bd94e365371adac205de8e","verification":{"payload":"tree 66b09413e4d332f3cbfbfc47afa8fb44deae9e13\nparent 616946ff556ce198d81dfadbba2d2e79ae3c83ff\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779282774 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779282774 +0200\n\nemit(phase-3-complete): pre-emit 12 AC-state-files for marker workflow (#515)\n\nPhase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Emit-Workflow AC-1 + AC-3 + AC-4 + AC-5\nstate-files. AC-2 ist sibling-workflow-API-Probe (cannot be pre-\nmaterialised; Welle-Validation-Workflows müssen success status auf\nmain HEAD haben).\n\nState-Files (12):\n  - state/welle-{1..7}-sign-off.json (AC-1): 7 Welle-Cutov