ine/boot-self-test.py\n    RUST_DEFAULT_DOMAINS_POST_CUTOVER += \"recovery\" (7/7 KOMPLETT)\n\nLokal: 7/7 recovery-Tests + boot-self-test grün (7 rust-default\ndomains mit graceful-fallback toleriert).\n\nCutover-Sequenz-Bilanz Tag-80:\n  Welle-1 v907_verify        merged 084d083c\n  Welle-2 svid_workload_id   merged ee912fc7\n  Welle-3 bridge_audit_writer merged d1f46ce3\n  Welle-4 state_backing      merged ff7d5c3c (rust_natskv)\n  Welle-5 fsm                merged 36cd9065\n  Welle-6 subscribe_loop     merged 0d5e305f\n  Welle-7 recovery           THIS PR (514)\n\nNach #514-Merge: Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Emit-Substrate kann\ngetriggert werden (Tag-76 PR #484 Marker-Glob-Pattern\nphase-3-complete-marker-*.json). Phase 5 OTS-Live-Toggle danach.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\n* cutover(welle-7): fix 2 remaining recovery tests post-flip\n\n- test_rust_backend_switch.py test_empty_string_env_defaults_to_python →\n  defaults_to_rust_with_graceful_python_fallback\n- test_boot_self_test_tag47.py test_boot_fingerprint_changes_on_env_flip:\n  flip recovery to explicit \"python\" statt \"rust\" (default is now rust,\n  so \"rust\" flip is a no-op for fingerprint)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"2f8c8302d15dfe0c21de89b74f42248ab4d357df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/2f8c8302d15dfe0c21de89b74f42248ab4d357df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/616946ff556ce198d81dfadbba2d2e79ae3c83ff","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f8c8302d15dfe0c21de89b74f42248ab4d357df\nparent 0d5e305f868a6d986efaae06831158db9ca51252\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779281709 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779281709 +0200\n\ncutover(welle-7): flip recovery default backend python → rust — LETZTE WELLE (#514)\n\n* cutover(welle-7): flip recovery default backend python → rust