_switch.py\n    _validate_state_backing_backend: default PYTHON → RUST_NATSKV\n  - wirelang/tests/persona_engine/test_rust_backend_switch.py\n    state_backing-unset-test angepasst (requested=rust_natskv)\n  - scripts/persona-engine/boot-self-test.py\n    RUST_DEFAULT_DOMAINS_POST_CUTOVER += \"state_backing\"\n\nEngine-Test test_engine_and_cli.py nicht touched: state_backing\nist lazy-resolved inside _select_state_backing (per comment),\nnicht als attribute asserted.\n\nLokal: 13/13 state_backing-Tests + boot-self-test grün.\n\nWelle-5 (fsm) folgt nächste.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"b00a8b9da12716d730e1e925b364a8ced3907c80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/b00a8b9da12716d730e1e925b364a8ced3907c80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/ff7d5c3cb689cdce82f6c32c43dad6046cf0da70","verification":{"payload":"tree b00a8b9da12716d730e1e925b364a8ced3907c80\nparent d1f46ce377f0a9b9f8d3fdaeb656a90f81b1e9c8\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779280505 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779280505 +0200\n\ncutover(welle-4): flip state_backing default backend python → rust_natskv (tag-80) (#511)\n\nPhase 3c Welle-4 Cutover per ADR-0065 + ADR-0066, analog Welle-1..3.\n\nEigenheit Welle-4: StateBackingBackend hat ZWEI rust-Varianten\n(RUST_INMEMORY + RUST_NATSKV). Per Tag-33 Mini-Welle cosign-policy-\ncomment (\"NATS-KV Persona-State-Backing\") ist NATS-KV das\nproduction-target. RUST_INMEMORY bleibt opt-in für dev/test.\n\nPatches:\n  - wirelang/persona_engine/rust_backend_switch.py\n    _validate_state_backing_backend: default PYTHON → RUST_NATSKV\n  - wirelang/tests/persona_engine/test_rust_backend_switch.py\n    state_backing-unset-test angepasst (requested=rust_natskv)\n  - scripts/persona-engine/boot-self-test.py\n    RUST_DEFAULT_DOMAINS_POST_CUTOVER += \"state_backing\"\n\nEngine-Test test_en