pi.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/084d083cf05843b2dc6a3be64cd249427585c640/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T12:03:59Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T12:03:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"cutover(welle-1): flip v907_verify default backend python → rust (tag-80) (#508)\n\n* cutover(welle-1): flip v907_verify default backend python → rust (tag-80)\n\nPhase 3c Welle-1 Cutover per ADR-0065 + ADR-0066.\n\nWelle-1-Validation v4 (Run 26160817746) grün:\n  - ready_for_live_smoke: true\n  - aggregate gate-aggregator: yellow_tolerated\n    (Gate-1+2+3+5 green, Gate-4 sole-yellow per ADR-0065\n    §Trigger-Bedingung-4)\n  - cutover-dry-run: ok (band GREEN, 12 boots, score 1.0)\n  - persona-boot rust: ok\n  - bridge-audit-roundtrip: ok\n\nSubstanz-Patch:\n  - wirelang/persona_engine/rust_backend_switch.py\n    _validate_v907_verify_backend: default-return PYTHON → RUST\n    Graceful-fallback-Pfad (binary_missing → python) bleibt intakt;\n    Sandbox-CI ohne rust-binary fällt weiterhin auf python zurück\n    mit fallback_reason=\"binary_missing\" + bin_path=DEFAULT_RUST_*.\n\n  - wirelang/tests/persona_engine/test_rust_backend_switch.py\n    3 v907-Tests angepasst:\n      * V1 test_v907_verify_unset_defaults_to_python →\n        ..._defaults_to_rust_with_graceful_python_fallback\n        (assertions: requested=rust, chosen=python, fallback_reason=\n        \"binary_missing\", bin_path=DEFAULT_RUST_V907_VERIFY_BIN)\n      * V7 test_v907_verify_empty_string_env_defaults_to_python →\n        ..._defaults_to_rust_with_graceful_python_fallback\n      * test_v907_verify_per_decision_logging_writes_sink\n        log-line assertion: requested=rust (chosen=python via fallback)\n    V2..V6 (explicit-Pfad-Tests) bleiben unverändert.\n\nLokal-Pytest: 17/17 v907_verify-Tests grün.\n\nProduction-Posture post-Merge:\n  - Operator-Host mit installiertem wakir-persona-engine-v907-verify-\n    Binary: chosen=rust (production-default-flip aktiv).\n  - Sandbox-CI ohne binary: chosen=python (graceful fallback),\n    decision-log-Eintrag mit fallback_reason=binary_missing.\n\nWelle-2..7 folgen sequenziell (svid_workload_identity, bridge_audit_\nwriter, state_backing, fsm, subscribe_loop, recovery_workflow).\n\nRefs ADR-0065 Welle-1, ADR-0066 Phase-3c-Cutover-Plan,\ndocs/operations/phase-3c-welle-1-runbook.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\n* cutover(welle-1): tolerate v907_verify binary_missing fallback in boot self-test\n\nWelle-1-Code-Flip macht ``v907_verify`` rust-default. Auf Sandbox-CI\nohne rust-Binary fällt der Resolver gracefully auf python zurück\nmit fallback_reason=\"binary_missing\". Das ist die documentierte\npost-cutover-Decision-Record, NICHT ein drift.\n\n``check_stage_1_no_fallback_on_clean_env`` hatte hartgepinnt\n``fallback_reason is None`` für alle 10 Decisions — was Pre-Cutover\nkorrekt war, post-Welle-1 aber nicht mehr.\n\nPatch: Set ``RUST_DEFAULT_DOMAINS_POST_CUTOVER`` als growing-frozenset.\nWelle-1 adds \"v907_verify\". Welle-2..7 expanden je um eine domain\n(svid_workload_identity, bridge_audit_writer, state_backing, fsm,\nsubscribe_loop, recovery). Pro Welle-Cutover-PR wird das Set\num genau eine domain expanded.\n\nBoot-self-test lokal: all checks PASS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"e3ad564c19d8595325974b7ac5dd020588a85a99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/e3ad564c19d8595325974b7ac5dd020588a85a99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/084d083cf05843b2dc6a3be64cd249427585c640","verification":{"payload":"tree e3ad564c19d8595325974b7ac5dd020588a85a99\nparent 0857e24d3cd50604e1fe0c0b4d03445c49b4dff6\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779278639 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779278639 +0200\n\ncutover(welle-1): flip v907_verify default backend python → rust (tag-80) (#508)\n\n* cutover(welle-1): flip v907_verify default backend python → rust (tag-80)\n\nPhase 3c Welle-1 Cutover per ADR-0065 + ADR-0066.\n\nWelle-1-Validation v4 (Run 26160817746) grün:\n  - ready_for_live_smoke: true\n  - aggregate gate-aggregator: yellow_tolerated\n    (Gate-1+2+3+5 green, Gate-4 sole-yellow per ADR-0065\n    §Trigger-Bedingung-4)\n  - cutover-dry-run: ok (band GREEN, 12 boots, score 1.0)\n  - persona-boot rust: ok\n  - bridge-audit-roundtrip: ok\n\nSubstanz-Patch:\n  - wirelang/persona_engine/rust_backend_switch.py\n    _validate_v907_verify_backend: default-return PYTHON → RUST\n    Graceful-fallback-Pfad (binary_missing → python) bleibt intakt;\n    Sandbox-CI ohne rust-binary fällt weiterhin auf python zurück\n    mit fallback_reason=\"binary_missing\" + bin_path=DEFAULT_RUST_*.\n\n  - wirelang/tests/persona_engine/test_rust_backend_switch.py\n    3 v907-Tests angepasst:\n      * V1 test_v907_verify_unset_defaults_to_python →\n        ..._defaults_to_rust_with_graceful_python_fallback\n        (assertions: requested=rust, chosen=python, fallback_reason=\n        \"binary_missing\", bin_path=DEFAULT_RUST_V907_VERIFY_BIN)\n      * V7 test_v907_verify_empty_string_env_defaults_to_python →\n        ..._defaults_to_rust_with_graceful_python_fallback\n      * test_v907_verify_per_decision_logging_writes_sink\n        log-line assertion: requested=rust (chosen=python via fallback)\n    V2..V6 (explicit-Pfad-Tests) bleiben unverändert.\n\nLokal-Pytest: 17/17 v907_verify-Tests grün.\n\nProduction-Posture post-Merge:\n  - Operator-Host mit installiertem wakir-persona-engine-v907-verify-\n    Binary: chosen=rust (production-default-flip aktiv).\n  - Sandbox-CI ohne binary: chosen=python (graceful fallback),\n    decision-log-Eintrag mit fallback_reason=binary_missing.\n\nWelle-2..7 folgen sequenziell (svid_workload_identity, bridge_audit_\nwriter, state_backing, fsm, subscribe_loop, recovery_workflow).\n\nRefs ADR-0065 Welle-1, ADR-0066 Phase-3c-Cutover-Plan,\ndocs/operations/phase-3c-welle-1-runbook.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\n* cutover(welle-1): tolerate v907_verify binary_missing fallback in boot self-test\n\nWelle-1-Code-Flip macht ``v907_verify`` rust-default. Auf Sandbox-CI\nohne rust-Binary fällt der Resolver gracefully auf python zurück\nmit fallback_reason=\"binary_missing\". Das ist die documentierte\npost-cutover-Decision-Record, NICHT ein drift.\n\n``check_stage_1_no_fallback_on_clean_env`` hatte hartgepinnt\n``fallback_reason is None`` für alle 10 Decisions — was Pre-Cutover\nkorrekt war, post-Welle-1 aber nicht mehr.\n\nPatch: Set ``RUST_DEFAULT_DOMAINS_POST_CUTOVER`` als growing-frozenset.\nWelle-1 adds \"v907_verify\". Welle-2..7 expanden je um eine domain\n(svid_workload_identity, bridge_audit_writer, state_backing, fsm,\nsubscribe_loop, recovery). Pro Welle-Cutover-PR wird das Set\num genau eine domain expanded.\n\nBoot-self-test lokal: all checks PASS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDaMvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX9oQAK/rM3rapGUsue36ZcmmNXV8\nOf8Iz0vFiRhTKFLiJKsgHPLGjisCdEgJcHr/bbfcUbM/wRPVtZLj1/ePwouzsrig\n4NBbeLSOC2TeLCYSKra6nQ5VjPV8WSN6LzlPYqMRLNekc/NDqsI3xXe3hIiyTLfF\nHljLf5BAVzYPP68NbVTMRfYDiD6OA/ezT01UrAoR1RtEuEPMtDRXOHyiKg+ZXBje\nC2s7cUT1mdLXjM9D9igH