4cd249427585c640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/084d083cf05843b2dc6a3be64cd249427585c640"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281068747?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/0857e24d3cd50604e1fe0c0b4d03445c49b4dff6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:54:01Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:54:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ops(welle-validation): set+e around aggregator to capture non-zero RC (#507)\n\nGitHub Actions default shell is bash -eo pipefail. Aggregator\nreturns RC=1 für \"yellow tolerated\" cases (e.g. Gate-4\nobservability-baseline yellow), aber pipefail terminated den Step\nsofort bevor `RC=$?` und `echo \"rc=${RC}\"` ausgeführt wurden →\ngate-aggregator.outputs.rc bleibt empty → render-step liest\nGATE_RC env = empty → _rc() returnt -1-Sentinel → step_1_trigger_gates\nexit_code = -1, status = red.\n\nFix: `set +e` ... `set -e` wrap um den python-Aufruf, damit `RC=$?`\nund output-line in JEDEM Fall ausgeführt werden. Wird in alle 7\nWelle-Validation-Workflows appliziert.\n\nEffekt: yellow-toleranz-Pfad für Gate-4 wieder funktional. Welle-1..7\nValidation kann grün laufen wenn nur Gate-4 yellow (sole-yellow per\nADR-0065 §Trigger-Bedingung-4).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"9dece966adcc69355c374a6bf61a96ce2818e225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/9dece966adcc69355c374a6bf61a96ce2818e225"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/0857e24d3cd50604e1fe0c0b4d03445c49b4dff6","verification":{"payload":"tree 9dece966adcc69355c374a6bf61a96ce2818e225\nparent c3a4b939666c0c788b007609c5d7b58b19fd3d07\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779278041 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779278041 +0200\n\nops(welle-validation): set+e around aggregator to capture non-zero RC (#507)\n\nGitHub Actions default shell is bash -eo pipefail. Aggregator\nreturns RC=1 für \"yellow tolerated\" cases (e.g. Gate-4\nobservability-baseline yellow), aber pipefail terminated den Step\nsofort bevor `RC=$?` und `echo \"rc=${RC}\"` ausgeführt wurden →\ngate-aggregator.outputs.rc bleibt empty → render-step liest\nGATE_RC env = empty → _rc() returnt -1-Sentinel → step_1_trigger_gates\nexit_code = -1, status = red.\n\nFix: `set +e` ... `set -e` wrap um den python-Aufruf, damit `RC=$?`\nund output-line in JEDEM Fall ausgeführt werden. Wird in alle 7\nWelle-Validation-Workflows appliziert.\n\nEffekt: yellow-toleranz-Pfad für Gate-4 wieder funktional. Welle-1..7\nValidation kann grün laufen wenn nur Gate-4 yellow (sole-yellow per\nADR-0065 §Trigger-Bedingung-4).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDaDZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATlwQAE8Pue10ka9mXVfLqf//vXaS