bridge-audit-replay + migrate-version) auf 15 binaries expandiert ist.\n\nPatches:\n  - scripts/phase-3c-trigger-gate-aggregator.py\n    DEFAULT_TARGET_BINARY_COUNT = 7 → 15\n  - tests/scripts/test_phase_3c_trigger_gate_aggregator.py\n    assert DEFAULT_TARGET_BINARY_COUNT == 7 → == 15\n  - 7 Workflows phase-3c-welle-{1..7}-validation.yml\n    target-binary-count default \"7\" → \"15\"\n\nPHASE_3B_RESOLVER_NAMES (Gate-1) stays at 7 — those are the ENV-switch\nresolvers (recovery, state_backing, fsm, v907_verify, bridge_diff,\nsubscribe_loop, anchor_emitter), eine strict subset des 15-Inventory.\n\nFolge-Wirkung: Welle-1..7 Validation-Workflows können grün laufen\nauf Tag-80-Stand.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"57765e7a2d0a42b10bb7a3412eed80ec249fedd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/57765e7a2d0a42b10bb7a3412eed80ec249fedd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/c3a4b939666c0c788b007609c5d7b58b19fd3d07","verification":{"payload":"tree 57765e7a2d0a42b10bb7a3412eed80ec249fedd4\nparent 5eea77dc2348d4faa8e95df945719aa60ba96847\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779277823 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779277823 +0200\n\nops(aggregator): bump DEFAULT_TARGET_BINARY_COUNT from 7 to 15 (tag-80) (#506)\n\nWelle-1 validation red wegen Gate-2/3 ``expected_count: 7,\nfound_count: 15``. Aggregator-Konstante seit Tag-24 unverändert,\nwährend Inventory längst Tag-33 (4 Welle-Single-Binaries) + Tag-37\n(bridge-audit-writer) + Tag-38 (svid-workload-identity) + Tag-45\n(bridge-audit-replay + migrate-version) auf 15 binaries expandiert ist.\n\nPatches:\n  - scripts/phase-3c-trigger-gate-aggregator.py\n    DEFAULT_TARGET_BINARY_COUNT = 7 → 15\n  - tests/scripts/test_phase_3c_trigger_gate_aggregator.py\n    assert DEFAULT_TARGET_BINARY_COUNT == 7 → == 15\n  - 7 Workflows phase-3c-welle-{1..7}-validation.yml\n    target-binary-count default \"7\" → \"15\"\n\nPHASE_3B_RESOLVER_NAMES (Gate-1) stays at 7 — those are the ENV-switch\nresolvers (recovery, state_backing, fsm, v907_verify, bridge_diff,\nsubscribe_loop, anchor_emitter), eine strict subset des 15-Inventory.\n\nFolge-Wirkung: Welle-1..7 Validation-Workflows können grün laufen\nauf Tag-80-Stand.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDZ//CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtx8QAEKfwyyQ5cEIo2/nM3rfwANC\npqZJvO6jRb8EVjqocF1oAYXyegm5jzXHw9eLOmgHVHAPajWZXyDzLOuT1y0XEoTD\nY2lHLwWmERx2j5EHaukbHvFoZ6TrbSby1swYtAHiarfW5IGx9od2SZWKx0fgLTBF\n/y7sv9JopKIPBu+rmWyG80ME5oV5g/isVf86ZgelQ0gRXIrwxUGfL055vR25Msm+\nieJIABUJd0mWMrbczehOWZHPqvTYovuI8WEr133LuOszCTm9C2W7WJvYfuogO68I\nL/sPoHqEXzQN7p335rCACOc8M15M/Tjpa7QnpMdJuZmQTsUDJXfa5/J4iXME/xm9\nvI8okgRgkS4C41nAOBK9RwxEtU0oJmIhA8+lTa3cELojOe3aZRaMQnIr9BVYbaad\nh4felg7tIo5nztwPKkF8CHGXuH2jpORakgnvtTmCFAjd+f5JCPddi+KT4Wi68EX4\n2MZYvFEA0kKHBs+bjHKGIYMeQ+1c3Rd5I7LlpEUkof7EfZXiHLHHDC5VOfq1CAzz\n3lNUbrA/i/ZqZm3UJtN67fa88PxX3+LLrN5uQ122tQYuPW+R4dh1iy+hOu9KA2uE\nqFU1x1t2q2K2pYvwfKXDfUR1yT6jX9vUMdTF8NZigeshUN2pH8XcbFUYcl3/is2s\nuBoW3of3L2bhp2O7+R+4\n=ALox\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-20T11:50:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","r