5df945719aa60ba96847/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:46:02Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:46:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ops(welle-validation): install pyyaml in 7 welle-validation + observability workflows (#504)\n\nWelle-1 validation-Workflow Run 26159513006 ist red wegen Gate-2\n(cosign-policy-binary-inventory) → ``yaml-unparseable-or-missing-\nbinaries-key``. Root cause: scripts/phase-3c-trigger-gate-\naggregator.py imports pyyaml; pyyaml fehlt im pip-install-Step\nder Welle-Validation-Workflows.\n\nYAML selbst ist valid + hat 15 binaries (lokal verified).\n\nFix: pip install line in 8 Workflows (Welle-1..7 + observability\ndaily snapshot) erweitert um ``\"pyyaml>=6.0\"``.\n\nPre-Welle-1-Flip-Substrate-Fix. Ohne diesen Fix wäre die Welle-\nValidation-Workflow auf jedem Run red, was die Welle-Cutover-\nSequenz blockiert.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"046bb7eb3db3c53d3f4810113cbec79d68fa8e5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/046bb7eb3db3c53d3f4810113cbec79d68fa8e5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/5eea77dc2348d4faa8e95df945719aa60ba96847","verification":{"payload":"tree 046bb7eb3db3c53d3f4810113cbec79d68fa8e5a\nparent 07698484ee1ca926f9c7bf30b3ed46a5de7476da\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779277562 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779277562 +0200\n\nops(welle-validation): install pyyaml in 7 welle-validation + observability workflows (#504)\n\nWelle-1 validation-Workflow Run 26159513006 ist red wegen Gate-2\n(cosign-policy-binary-inventory) → ``yaml-unparseable-or-missing-\nbinaries-key``. Root cause: scripts/phase-3c-trigger-gate-\naggregator.py imports pyyaml; pyyaml fehlt im pip-install-Step\nder Welle-Validation-Workflows.\n\nYAML selbst ist val