ren\n2 cosign-verify jobs (cosign-verify-spire, digest-verify-python)\nprüfen, ob sie auch das wrapper-Issue haben oder ob nur wakir-\nprovisioner betroffen ist (vermutlich nur wakir-provisioner — die\nanderen 2 sind keyless-signed upstream + werden möglicherweise als\nIndex gesigned).\n\nRefs PR #503 (TOMAS-Pin-Resolution-PR), Build-Run 26157737055.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDZaXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8R8QAFMfnBXiq46sNdkn1bwtdXon\nhVewlFSCoCb0Zd4qWtVAhXSJ1uGreMH4KGz0qwZTYnqNZA65fQgh4m7YKsBWsXPO\nI9a/88FDTCEfFIubXeBd+Cwqh6VVxR13IghIwc1XPuE1yLv4qGkK1SkKbDX+j8+c\npx3sMm4UrkMdjjvQFw/QWmxrIhcE2HjDRao8MAww/9w0KPoICxhXAbch8xMH2H99\n4KcepwZ/fCAj/cY1FHGDdgsfNR9Bgm8UdjJJntaG26DKrdTbF09jbj2D5BVt8tyt\nG0i3eijTTVCXt585pAKPhZZlJxfZN/9NA/gWcybPms8QdqSZPszonl5khJzLs8tF\nWwp8E38WDwIt4lIJKpK/hGHxPQdiNTWCW611PbsL/ihRm1kPGZ2nCJgGhyWISb97\n+K2zhwpr4pdYIZLQGre4nO98MpQgQ5ygdepNUMFll1bGbbkfxNh9KiUnBYJ/sfgE\n7wk8y/iyuHPYeefqdEUgUnt4WRJg3xxDHIgXak/SruW2flql3VhIP47c3rS38bZx\nPfI8AmNihDU1AhSQA7FFkvmWGLP/slOi29DrftnTuHv6h2XEL9Y8qOGHWsENQmJX\ns3EBKIvvS3FjcbZ7btVsOpYw9ozCaVHegvJczr5TzrxPAR9+bYfxth0xsdWVFC/Q\nVr7iTC9EsuHBI+chNhdY\n=jgjW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-20T11:10:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commit/37f91c633211d06b12990b1fef104e9be1fff7af","node_id":"C_kwDOSVv36NoAKDM3ZjkxYzYzMzIxMWQwNmIxMjk5MGIxZmVmMTA0ZTliZTFmZmY3YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commit/a3a410077e3228991a1f52f8b348bf6c1e5f2cdc","sha":"a3a410077e3228991a1f52f8b348bf6c1e5f2cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/a3a410077e3228991a1f52f8b348bf6c1e5f2cdc"}],"sha":"37f91c633211d06b12990b1fef104e9be1fff7af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/37f91c633211d06b12990b1fef104e9be1fff7af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281068747?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/a3a410077e3228991a1f52f8b348bf6c1e5f2cdc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T10:34:45Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T10:34:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ops(g5): switch readiness-check from legacy --quadlet-installer to --quadlet-glob (#501)\n\nPhase 2.A Pre-Step — G5 cross-substrate-parity-gate Migration-Drift-Fix.\n\nTag-55 (Kai) hat das Tooling von Single-File ``--quadlet-installer``\nauf ``--quadlet-glob`` umgestellt, damit die 4 Welle-4..7 dedicated\nSingle-Binary-Installer-Quadlets (wakir-rust-cli-welle{4..7}.container)\nmitgelesen werden. Das Workflow-yml verwendete aber weiter\n``--quadlet-installer quadlet/wakir-rust-cli.container``, der nur das\nCarrier-Quadlet liest (11 Binaries, nicht 15).\n\nWirkung: G5 sah 11/15 Binaries und meldete BLOCKED mit\n``only-in-policy: [''fsm-welle5'', ''recovery-welle7'', ''state-backing-\nwelle4'', ''subscribe-loop-welle6'']`` — obwohl die 4 Welle-Quadlets\ndiese Binaries via canonical in-image-Path bereits korrekt deklarieren.\n\nFix: ``--quadlet-installer`` durch ``--quadlet-glob\n\"quadlet/wakir-rust-cli*.container\"`` ersetzt — picks up alle 5\nQuadlets via glob (Carrier + 4 Welle).\n\nReproduktion lokal vor Fix:\n\n    $ python3 cosign-strict-mode-readiness-check.py ... \\\n        --quadlet-installer quadlet/wakir-rust-cli.container\n    → aggregate_verdict: BLOCKED (G5 BLOCKED)\n\n    $ python3 cosign-strict-mode-readiness-check.py ... \\\n        --quadlet-glob \"quadlet/wakir-rust-cli*.container\"\n    → expected: aggregate_verdict: GREEN (G5 GREEN)\n\nPre-Cutover-Item §G5-Substrat-Fix für Cutover-T0 Strict-Flip-Window.\n\nRefs Tag-55-Closeout (Kai), Tag-80 Cutover Phase 2.A Substrat-Drift.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"2fb3976748cdbfffe43e19864016dbcf05b22371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runt