"C_kwDOSVv36NoAKGEzYTQxMDA3N2UzMjI4OTkxYTFmNTJmOGIzNDhiZjZjMWU1ZjJjZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commit/f452e9145f17324ade0fc627ee3fe2b1b8a19d12","sha":"f452e9145f17324ade0fc627ee3fe2b1b8a19d12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/f452e9145f17324ade0fc627ee3fe2b1b8a19d12"}],"sha":"a3a410077e3228991a1f52f8b348bf6c1e5f2cdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/a3a410077e3228991a1f52f8b348bf6c1e5f2cdc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281068747?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/f452e9145f17324ade0fc627ee3fe2b1b8a19d12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T10:26:25Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T10:26:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ops(g2): pin sigstore trust-root snapshot (fulcio root ca + rekor shard) (#500)\n\nPhase 1.B — G2 Trust-Root-Snapshot-Pin (Pre-Cutover-Item §G2).\n\nOperator-Hand-Refresh auf Operator-Host mit Sigstore-Network-Egress.\nCosign v2.5.2 installiert + initialisiert. Werte direkt vom Sigstore-\nEndpoint gezogen, NICHT aus dem ~/.sigstore/root/targets-Cache (cosign\nv2 embeddet die Targets in der TUF-Root-JSON; das alte v1-Refresh-\nRecipe Pattern `find ~/.sigstore -name ''fulcio_v1*.pem''` matched\nnichts mehr).\n\nGepinnte Werte (Tag-80 ~12:30 CEST):\n\n- fulcio_root_ca_sha256\n    = 7425db2ed39274a73f011f40d48cc430542c5218e89c6993cab2727b2f9701d2\n    Source: curl https://fulcio.sigstore.dev/api/v1/rootCert | sha256sum\n- rekor_log_shard_id = 1193050959916656506\n    Source: curl https://rekor.sigstore.dev/api/v1/log | jq .treeID\n    (aktiver Shard; 2 inactiveShards 3904496407287907110 +\n    2605736670972794746 nicht relevant)\n\nSequenz-Pflicht erfüllt: G1 (Carrier + Pilot + Welle-4..7 Image-Digest-\nPins) wurde am Tag-80 ~12:08 CEST gemerged in PR #498 + #499. G2 ist\nder erlaubte Folge-Step.\n\nFolge-Auftrag an Kai (separater Polish-PR nach Cutover):\nRecipe in docs/operations/cosign-keyless-oidc-drift-probe.md Sek. 3.1\nauf cosign-v2-Pfad updaten. Empfohlene Cosign-v2-Refresh-Recipe:\n\n    curl -sSL https://fulcio.sigstore.dev/api/v1/rootCert | sha256sum\n    curl -sSL https://rekor.sigstore.dev/api/v1/log | jq -r .treeID\n\nPre-Cutover-Item §G1 + §G2 jetzt KOMPLETT. Strict-Flip-PR (Phase 2.A)\nist der nächste Operator-Hand-Step.\n\nRefs ADR-0066 (Phase-3c Cutover-Plan),\ndocs/operations/cosign-g1-g2-operator-setup.md §G2,\ndocs/operations/cosign-keyless-oidc-drift-probe.md Sek. 3.1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"b73b3904fe5268a0f0f70ac3eabf449a578b439f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/b73b3904fe5268a0f0f70ac3eabf449a578b439f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/f452e9145f17324ade0fc627ee3fe2b1b8a19d12","verification":{"payload":"tree b73b3904fe5268a0f0f70ac3eabf449a578b43