-Mini-\nWelle-Substanz-Drift: die Welle-4..7-Quadlets pinnten Image-Namen mit\n``-welleN``-Suffix, die NIE gebaut werden — die Build-Workflows\n(.github/workflows/build-rust-cli-{state-backing,lifecycle-state-machine,\nsubscribe-loop,recovery-workflow}.yml) pushen Images ohne ``-welleN``-\nSuffix. Der ``-welleN``-Suffix ist nur am in-image binary-Path\n(``/opt/wakir/bin/wakir-persona-engine-state-backing-welle4``), nicht\nam Image-Namen.\n\nBuild-Workflows Tag-80 11:53..11:54 CEST gelaufen + grün:\n\n- Pilot (Run 26154998588): ghcr.io/wakir-labs/wakir-persona-engine:0.1.0-pilot\n  → sha256:6bd39e57173d999f4e5b59db2541cc6942cd239056bb18b3dee5f55446e80b7d\n- Welle-4 state-backing (Run 26155000250):\n  ghcr.io/wakir-labs/wakir-persona-engine-state-backing:0.5.0-pilot\n  → sha256:02eeb208dcebceef44bc00a5fcf4bcbf696a687ddb45ea523da595880d401749\n- Welle-5 fsm (Run 26155001844):\n  ghcr.io/wakir-labs/wakir-persona-engine-fsm:0.5.0-pilot\n  → sha256:98d15a21a9f5da2a1c26177e55de964c7d923c28429d941068db9d690d32c93e\n- Welle-6 subscribe-loop (Run 26155003236):\n  ghcr.io/wakir-labs/wakir-persona-engine-subscribe-loop:0.5.0-pilot\n  → sha256:1847312cff684fb3df3a8010df6f234b43080f977a891328428bd782c3a93705\n- Welle-7 recovery (Run 26155004872):\n  ghcr.io/wakir-labs/wakir-persona-engine-recovery:0.5.0-pilot\n  → sha256:02a5e0840f60e387549303b30701c2d65aa9210b5301233beee081bdf9f378d6\n\nAlle Images sigstore-keyless signed gegen die GitHub-Actions-OIDC-\nIdentität des wakir-runtime-Repos.\n\nSubstanz-Lücke (separater Issue, NICHT in diesem PR adressiert):\npolicies/cosign-policy-phase-3b.yaml hat nur 1 carrier_image Pin und\nkeine separaten Image-Pins für die 4 Welle-4..7-Single-Binary-Images.\nWenn cosign-strict-mode aktiv ist + die Welle-Quadlets diese Images\nreferenzieren, ist die Policy-Coverage incomplete. Folge-Auftrag an\nKai für separates Policy-Pin-Substrat (oder Klärung ob Carrier-Pattern\napplies).\n\nRefs ADR-0066 (Phase-3c Cutover-Plan Welle-4..7 image-build bundle),\ndocs/operations/cosign-g1-g2-operator-setup.md §3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Mira Kessler (CEO Sandbox-Operator-Hand)\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"6538fe94f6676f75ecf447315a10dc04a99889dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/6538fe94f6676f75ecf447315a10dc04a99889dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/a38f7ef0bf5977053ad5d77ef250d5b5269e8b59","verification":{"payload":"tree 6538fe94f6676f75ecf447315a10dc04a99889dc\nparent ef9fd16d74a6dbcc4c70097125f46b60cffcf68a\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779271751 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779271751 +0200\n\nops(g1): pin pilot + welle-4..7 image digests + fix tag-33 image-name drift (#499)\n\nPhase 1.A (Folge-PR zu #498) — G1-Quadlet-Digest-Pin für Pilot-Persona +\n4 Welle-Single-Binary-Images. Korrigiert gleichzeitig eine Tag-33-Mini-\nWelle-Substanz-Drift: die Welle-4..7-Quadlets pinnten Image-Namen mit\n``-welleN``-Suffix, die NIE gebaut werden — die Build-Workflows\n(.github/workflows/build-rust-cli-{state-backing,lifecycle-state-machine,\nsubscribe-loop,recovery-workflow}.yml) pushen Images ohne ``-welleN``-\nSuffix. Der ``-welleN``-Suffix ist nur am in-image binary-Path\n(``/opt/wakir/bin/wakir-persona-engine-state-backing-welle4``), nicht\nam Image-Namen.\n\nBuild-Workflows Tag-80 11:53..11:54 CEST gelaufen + grün:\n\n- Pilot (Run 26154998588): ghcr.io/wakir-labs/wakir-persona-engine:0.1.0-pilot\n  → sha256:6bd39e57173d999f4e5b59db2541cc6942cd239056bb18b3dee5f55446e80b7d\n- Welle-4 state-backing (Run 26155000250):\n  ghcr.io/wakir-labs/wakir-persona-engine-state-backing:0.5.0-pilot\n  → sha256:02eeb208dcebceef44bc00a5fcf4bcbf696a687ddb45ea523da595880d401749\n- Welle-5 fsm (Run 26155001844):\n  ghcr.io/wakir-labs/wakir-persona-engine-fsm:0.5.0-pilot\n  → sha256:98d15a21a9f5da2a1c26177e55de964c7d923c28429d941068db9d690d32c93e\n- Welle-6 subscribe-loop (Run 26155003236):\n  ghcr.io/wakir-labs/w