x-OK-per-B-\n  step mapping.\n\n  Part C -- Day-1..Day-7 cross-validation (7 tests): Day-1 B1 input\n  marker-ready flag, DAY_N_CALENDAR cross-check vs doc table, marker-\n  state irreversibility anchor, clean-pfad 5-step conjunction in §7\n  verdict row, helper-substrate inventory (verifier, tests, planned\n  Tag-77 aggregator, Welle-7-Day P5 cross-link), envelope replay\n  byte-identity, sandbox-boundary stdlib-only assertion.\n\nDisziplin: Test-Suite-Erweiterung, kein neuer Substrate.\nSandbox-boundary: stdlib + pytest + one wire-helper subprocess (Tag-76-\nsanctioned). No network, no podman, no live-VM.\n\n26/26 passing locally. 107/107 combined phase-3-complete suites\n(Tag-40 marker-workflow + Tag-76 audit-bundle + Tag-78 production-\nbringup) green.\n\nCo-authored-by: Mira Kessler <mira@wakir.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d0b0a4dc5b5d4b5fd7c77c1a99a81e46da8fd0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/8d0b0a4dc5b5d4b5fd7c77c1a99a81e46da8fd0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/595c940eec43142815af12ddfb3b67b0fc61eb08","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d0b0a4dc5b5d4b5fd7c77c1a99a81e46da8fd0e\nparent a54d7abb82381938b7292a9627d22d2ce7d3f8ad\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779217575 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779217575 +0200\n\ntest(tag-78): Phase-3-COMPLETE-marker Production-Bringup-Test-Suite (26 tests, Tomás) (#490)\n\nTag-78 Marathon-Polish-Phase extension of Tag-76 PR #484. Covers two\nsurfaces left implicit by the Tag-76 substrate:\n\n  Part A -- Phase-3-COMPLETE-marker post-Welle-7-Sign-off integration\n  (6 tests): Approved-Pfad, Rejected-Pfad, DEFER-Pfad envelope shape,\n  bundle-anchor stability across pfade, Welle-7 P5-sha surface, end-\n  to-end subprocess CLI smoke.\n\n  Part B -- Production-Bringup Day-1..Day-7 sequence pinning\n  (13 tests): Doc frontmatter status/tag, Day-N calendar table,\