lity-gates/phase-3-marathon-anti-patterns.md §AP-9\n    -- Welle-3 Rollback-Cascade (consumed indirectly via Stage 8).\n  decisions/0066-marathon-cadence-vier-wochen.md §Beschluss\n    -- Doppel-Welle PAR-path (consumed indirectly via Stage 8).\n\nBrief-vs-canonical reconciliation\n\n  * Brief \"7 Welle-Integration-Smokes\": canonical = five\n    aggregators on main (Welle-3..7), Welle-1+2 audit-anchor-only\n    stand-ins; surfaced in stage_provenance.\n  * Brief \"Stage 9 Closeout + Stage 10 Bundle\": canonical = two\n    distinct Tag-76 substrates with distinct verdict maps\n    (MARATHON-CLOSEOUT-READY vs BUNDLE-READY); both surfaced\n    as separate stages.\n\nSandbox-boundary\n\n  stdlib only, no network IO, no actual Welle dispatch, no\n  gh workflow run, no Phase-3-COMPLETE-marker emit, no closeout\n  signing. Hermetic by construction. Live dispatch on the\n  Marathon Cutover-Mittwoche (2026-06-10/17/24, 2026-07-01) is\n  operator-hand.\n\nNot a required status check per feedback_branch_protection_check_names.\n\nTests: 57 hermetic cases, all pass locally.\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDKyUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbIEQAEVSq9vG2Agn1ch1W98LPYAA\niq6usIlEq7GMtOmg/JkXp6HIfJ37atmk6lGz1hiJ/CghwMJHbGEUn60X7MWIoWoM\n2QhLMGkmKSHq5mazOjOKaz75HrTmi4esBQ4rfuNVVOifp0kzCLRh1T+4DlH15GPY\nDcvCa2OxdIykrzQ1ep+jZW73HVsk8yJBYnhn27C5McIgvKHiPU2LAUyYzfDCSR4Z\nZEvVCUdrgQ9qTXUGD+UBfG4dFU23dXyfoYj0naYGMPA+tq8j0OQJUjNQ476ckGSK\nrFuk1gFNjyhXL3eXefs+fhO4vRS4uDQw9FwU7ISYHOY466Y54wa4Tt7zgeGI0Rr8\nB39MbpEWvPqP87ZANjbmhH70/aZEA6tRrhzhTLRvN/b1rtXkMDyzuHn0uutwG6xL\nQSU2UEgpPLkS3G6uRBLH10ZLXREGtxFKAVH1Ow3N3AyWqSM0Fc0VOONPDro9phdA\nXSNOh+mcVPmEMoOVkbO8LrabTq4FvA3n9tUmokdP2QQ4hz2xRXvC+W2n/mMSzU1R\nueeWN3Bg0LEAUW80SiP9xCiJ16kUwD1BQhv7vKEMXtsgaKaC+GKMlL5oHOzV+xeu\nBS41t9J+rUmtxuvXbpXKIj+RzLg0kBeYCxKtkVxhANg5qzb+wWWAyofJ6qIBCDK0\ngFioL1rMrS4y