Marker (ALL-CLEAN,\nPARTIAL-HOLD, DEFER, EMERGENCY-HOLD) + drei AR-Hand-Touchpoints\n(TP-EVE-1..TP-EVE-3).\n\n§10 AR-Vorzeichen \"Halt vor Phase 4\" Governance-Pin: Verbatim-Tag-65-\nAR-Signal-Reproduktion + Re-Arm-Signal-Mechanik (Mira-Hand drei-\nMarker-Sequenz: activity-log + ADR + AR-Approval-Stamp).\n\nHelper: tooling/ci/verify_operator_pending_konsolidat_doc.py (stdlib)\nmit --aggregate-verdict-Mode fuer Pre-Cutover-Eve-Verdict-Roll-up.\n\nTest-Suite: tests/observability/test_operator_pending_konsolidat_tag77.py\n(25 hermetic tests, A1..A12 doc-structure + B1..B13 verifier).\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann (DevOps) <kai@wakir-labs.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4116c398fbb6aee85b4c3d136a9fb6e3b9cb0e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/e4116c398fbb6aee85b4c3d136a9fb6e3b9cb0e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/6c093686faf554b5923f00d3dc46dae2b9a42076","verification":{"payload":"tree e4116c398fbb6aee85b4c3d136a9fb6e3b9cb0e6\nparent 8347f897129a3da0e50e7ca665806b4843d2ea22\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779215110 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779215110 +0200\n\ndocs(ops): Tag-77 Operator-Hand Pending-Items Konsolidat Master-Doc (Kai, 25 tests) (#486)\n\nPre-Cutover-Eve Aggregator-Master-Reference for the Tag-50..Tag-76\nspawn corridor. Consolidates ten Operator-Hand-Sandbox-Gap-Item\nclusters (I1..I10) across ten sections (§1..§10), each with six\nstandard fields (Owner, Timing, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step,\nVerification, Rollback).\n\nItems covered:\n- I1 Required-Status-Checks-Pool-Aktivierung (8 Checks, PRs #389/#396/#411)\n- I2 G1 Cosign-Quadlet-Wiring (Operator-Hand)\n- I3 G2 Trust-Root-Snapshot\n- I4 Cross-Substrate-Parity-Required-Check Aktivierung\n- I5 OPEN-J2 Live-VM rotation 0.5.1 -> 0.5.3\n- I6 OPEN-J3 Containerfile-Label-Carry-Forward (Day-6 Phase-3-close)\n- I7 OPEN-K3 Baseline-Metadata-Car