labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/ec96c40e9cfc38c8ec05511654c2f49d98b903b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T18:23:24Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T18:23:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(ops): Tag-77 Operator-Hand OTS-Live-Stamping-Setup-Recipe (Tomas, 35 tests) (#488)\n\nPre-Cutover-Eve Operator-Hand-Activation-Recipe for the\nWAKIR_OTS_LIVE_EMIT=1 toggle at the KW-24 cutover gate\n(T0 = 2026-06-08, Eve = 2026-06-07). Consumes the Tag-57\naudit-only emit substrate (PR #366), the Tag-59\npre-activation-probe, and the Tag-76 Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker\n(PR #484). Strict doc-form-only; Sandbox helpers stay\naudit-only by construction.\n\nSubstanz\n========\n\n* docs/operations/ots-live-stamping-operator-setup.md\n  8 sections: Scope, Pre-Activation-Probe-Verifikation,\n  AR-Authorisierungs-Schritt, WAKIR_OTS_LIVE_EMIT-Toggle-Sequence,\n  First-Live-Stamp Test, Marker-Chain-Verifikation, Rollback-Pfad,\n  Sandbox-Boundary.\n* tooling/ci/verify_ots_live_setup_doc.py — stdlib verifier\n  pinning sections, toggle-export-verbatim, 5 rollback triggers,\n  ADR-0023a + feedback_sandbox_host_trennung anchors.\n* tests/ci/test_ots_live_setup_doc_tag77.py — 35 hermetic tests\n  covering frontmatter, all 8 sections, signature, and 7\n  negative-verifier paths (missing section, dropped pin,\n  removed trigger, missing signature, removed Welle-N, dropped\n  ADR anchor, removed toggle-export).\n\nCross-Anchor\n============\n\n* ADR-0007 Internal Audit Trail via OTS — substrate.\n* ADR-0023a Sandbox-Boundary — no live-emit in Sandbox.\n* ADR-0044 QA x Audit Cross-Review — Zone-N evidence.\n* ADR-0066 Marathon-Closeout Substanz-Pruefung Pflicht.\n* Tag-57 PR #366 — audit-only emit.\n* Tag-58 PR #371 — Wirelang-Spec v0.4.3 seal.\n* Tag-60 PR #382 — Live-VM-Rotation-Stub.\n* Tag-69 PR #440 — RES-D4 HD-1 OTS-substrate-prep.\n* Tag-76 PR #484 — Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker bundle.\n\nCross-Review-Markers\n====================\n\n* Zone-K: WAT-Core x OTS-Substrate (Tomas-domain).\n* Zone-L: Identity x Spec-Seal (Reza cross-anchor).\n* Zone-N: QA x Audit-Trail (Henrik evidence-input).\n\nSandbox-Boundary\n================\n\n* Sandbox stays audit-only: emit helpers refuse\n  WAKIR_OTS_LIVE_EMIT=1 by construction (Tag-70 HD-1 invariant).\n* Live-flip is host-side shell-scope export only; never .env,\n  never committed.\n* Quarantine + rollback path explicit; re-arm requires new\n  AR-authorisation marker.\n\n-- Tomas\n\nCo-authored-by: Mira Kessler <mira@wakir.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3f088757f8f4972abf0bcab28ded3d42ba5db58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/b3f088757f8f4972abf0bcab28ded3d42ba5db58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/ec96c40e9cfc38c8ec05511654c2f49d98b903b9","verification":{"payload":"tree b3f088757f8f4972abf0bcab28ded3d42ba5db58\nparent 567f118089a8dbb389c68f276e8a5eaf4d4969b9\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779215004 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779215004 +0200\n\ndocs(ops