io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T18:09:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ci): Tag-76 Phase-3-COMPLETE-marker Marathon-Closeout-Audit-Bundle (Tomas, 30 tests) (#484)\n\nMarathon-Closeout-Audit-Anchor-Bundle. Consolidates the seven Welle-1..7\naudit-anchor markers (Tag-69..Tag-75 outputs) into a single\nPhase-3-COMPLETE-marker that Henrik''s Zone-N Audit-Evidence-Index ingests\nas the canonical Phase-3-COMPLETE hand-off envelope.\n\nTool-side surfaces:\n  * emit_manifest_hash_ots_marker.py --mode phase-3-complete-marker:\n    consumes the seven welle-N markers, enforces the Welle-1..7-Kind-\n    Disjointness-Pin at ingest, computes the bundle anchor, emits the\n    Phase-3-COMPLETE marker.\n  * tooling/ci/wire_phase_3_complete_audit_bundle.py: single-purpose\n    helper that emits the producer-facing envelope Henrik''s Zone-N\n    consumer reads. CLI-parity with the emit-module bundle anchor.\n\nHash recipe: identical to the per-Welle recipe (canonical-JSON of each\nWelle marker, concatenated in welle-number order with single newline\nseparators, SHA-256 over concat). Welle-1..7-Kind-Disjointness-Pin\nenforced at ingest -- mismatched welle_number, duplicate, gap, wrong\nkind string, or non-hex anchor raises ValueError BEFORE the bundle hash\nis computed.\n\nSurfaces sourced from the Welle-7 marker:\n  * phase_3_final_sealing_tracking (Phase-3-Final-Sealing discipline)\n  * global_acceptance_verdict_recorded + phase_3_complete_marker_ready\n  * pre_auditor_final_sealing_signaling_ready (Tomas -> Henrik hand-off\n    for Phase-3-COMPLETE-marker readiness, per pre-cutover-acceptance-\n    run-order doc section 7.2)\n\nTests: 30 tests covering all-7-Welle-Cross-Anchor-Validation (loader,\ndisjointness-pin, hash determinism + recipe, marker shape, CLI surface\nfor both helpers, cross-anchor distinctness, bundle anchor depends on\nALL seven inputs, sandbox-boundary invariants, WAT-spool envelope).\n\nHermetic audit-only: stdlib only, no network, no OTS calendar call, no\nsubprocess. Real OTS stamping of the Phase-3-COMPLETE marker is an\nOperator-Hand follow-up step.\n\nAnchor: Tag-76 Marathon-Closeout-Audit-Anchor-Bundle.\nCross-Review-Zone-N hand-off (Henrik / Internal-Audit).\n\nCo-authored-by: Mira Kessler <mira@wakir.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dfc69b961e3ed2d7bef290c89c44a56242fdc0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/0dfc69b961e3ed2d7bef290c89c44a56242fdc0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/567f118089a8dbb389c68f276e8a5eaf4d4969b9","verification":{"payload":"tree 0dfc69b961e3ed2d7bef290c89c44a56242fdc0a\nparent d48bde1d7d38f2867b926257983a96a679c35c3d\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779214160 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779214160 +0200\n\nfeat(ci): Tag-76 Phase-3-COMPLETE-marker Marathon-Closeout-Audit-Bundle (Tomas, 30 tests) (#484)\n\nMarathon-Closeout-Audit-Anchor-Bundle. Consolidates the seven Welle-1..7\naudit-anchor markers (Tag-69..Tag-75 outputs) into a single\nPhase-3-COMPLETE-marker that Henrik''s Zone-N Audit-Evidence-Index ingests\nas the canonical Phase-3-COMPLETE hand-off envelope.\n\nTool-side surfaces:\n  * emit_manifest_hash_ots_marker.py --mode phase-3-complete-marker:\n    consumes the seven welle-N markers, enforces the Welle-1..7-Kind-\n    Disjointness-Pin at ingest, computes the bundle anchor, emits the\n    Phase-3-COMPLETE marker.\n  * tooling/ci/wire_phase_3_complete_audit_bundle.py: single-purpose\n    helper that emits the producer-facing envelope Henrik''s Zone-N\n    consumer reads. CLI-parity with the emit-module bundle anchor.\n\nHash recipe: identical to the per-Welle recipe (canonical-JSON of each\nWelle marker, concatenated in welle-number order with single newline\nseparators, SHA-256 over concat). Welle-1..7-Kind-Disjointness-Pin\nenforced at ingest -- mismatched welle_number, duplicate, gap, wrong\nkind string, or non-hex anchor raises ValueError BEFORE the bundle hash\nis computed.\n\nSurfaces sourced from the Welle-7 marker:\n  * phase_3_final_sealing_tracking (Phase-3-Final-Sealing discipline)\n  * global_acceptance_verdict_recorded + phase_3_complete_marker_ready\n  * pre_auditor_final_sealing_signaling_ready (Tomas -> Henrik hand-off\n    for Phase-3-COMPLETE-marker readiness, per pre-cutover-acceptance-\n    run-order doc section 7.2)\n\nTests: 30 tests covering all-7-Welle-Cross-Anchor-Validation (loader,\ndisjointness-pin, hash determinism + recipe, marker shape, CLI surface\nfor both helpers, cross-anchor distinctness, bundle anchor depends on\nALL seven inputs, sandbox-boundary invariants, WAT-spool envelope).\n\nHermetic audit-only: stdlib only, no network, no OTS calendar call, no\nsubprocess. Real OTS stamping of the Phase-3-COMPLETE marker is an\nOperator-Hand follow-up step.\n\nAnchor: Tag-76 Marathon-Closeout-Audit-Anchor-Bundle.\nCross-Review-Zone-N hand-off (Henrik / Internal-Audit).\n\nCo-authored-by: Mira Kessler <mira@wakir.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDKdQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkFQQAJFrG+olloV7KEP0SBKDwXJm\nfUhplkrqWk4MZ+VsTmwYlqxgYdgmAWztrpTqFmVQoUftRdPg6Sn1CUJE8JWFQOz+\nAGxXIKYrFAT8xmg7vFv+Uv8ax8fphSHg/e8FrLDsiwHp76I4mfYxjkura2e5vfsm\nS8NvwL9lHw58kZSP0GoUDsex2MjI8bDJakmB5H7OXxMcJQIDTz0b+2vjNrrNOjVJ\nDTlyv/RBaA7TH7motpmAYpvjJz09gDYq+ZToYNfdyWuFn0W5h1gS2U5QysRd4ozD\nKfUrZMEKA7ssfiOFwWHjPuEItmIyFrtWyvHl2MNzpvt0XgsRspGb2gMWFZ47oSHd\nWGfrrwtzEGc8GjqNMdDeEYcYuSyjBXdNeePChvs4QeHgSv5Ws6RoKhhYzXxxRez6\n8Lw0+B9t+3Y8rzj9acLHrDvEJrUW3PzaTGOmoFuiD25fLigJAlKcFYLnU+vfjkiQ\n/f9RDW4Zq5DHvXH0kPow2Dd5DaWUpGuMpm2/FW5HhgNDHDNNrW7JmWUUxnlN4xv+\nfAu1L5OvNcYVZcTjuAXxqGkGEyfMxMd1Xxr6EKP3KLerKlM/fYlbY4h/2MIVJDgU\nqWWD9xinUhVfUYCa4STket+iDjO+E6uguJlyxT9R24yCVj1An1MYCPHuSE2H/VM6\nB3WY7iPUV2XuzWL8pV