ub.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/d48bde1d7d38f2867b926257983a96a679c35c3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T18:04:04Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T18:04:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(welle-marathon): Tag-76 Cross-Welle-Stability-Pin Aggregator (Amara, 33 tests) (#483)\n\nBundles the seven per-Welle-Integration-Smoke verdicts (Welle-1..Welle-7,\nTag-69..Tag-75) plus a distinctive Cross-Welle-Cascade-Verifikation into a\nsingle CROSS-WELLE-STABILITY-INTACT / -DRIFT / -DEFECT verdict for the\nPhase-3c-Marathon-Closeout pipeline simulation.\n\nSubstanz\n--------\n\n* .github/workflows/cross-welle-stability-pin.yml (9 stages: 7 Welle\n  envelopes + Cross-Welle-Cascade-Verifikation + Aggregate)\n* tooling/ci/aggregate_cross_welle_stability.py (stdlib-only Tag-76\n  aggregator; helper extension: verify_reverse_block_pattern now allows\n  the symmetric Doppel-Welle PAR-path partner exception for the (6,7)\n  symmetric-coupling case per ADR-0066 + phase-3c-doppel-welle-6-7.md)\n* tests/ci/test_cross_welle_stability_tag76.py (33 hermetic tests:\n  aggregator decision rule, envelope schema, forward-cascade topology,\n  Doppel-Welle symmetry, cascade-verification synthesise + consume,\n  brief-vs-canonical reconciliation, sandbox-boundary, Marathon-window,\n  workflow-shape)\n\nAnchors\n-------\n\n* docs/quality-gates/pre-cutover-acceptance-run-order.md §3 -- seven\n  Welle-Datumsanker (cross-Welle sequencing contract)\n* docs/quality-gates/phase-3-marathon-anti-patterns.md §AP-9 -- Welle-3-\n  Rollback-Cascade anchor (3, 4, 5, 6, 7)\n* decisions/0066-marathon-cadence-vier-wochen.md §Beschluss -- Doppel-\n  Welle PAR-path discipline (1,2) audit-anchor-only / (4,5) asymmetric /\n  (6,7) symmetric\n\nBrief-vs-canonical reconciliation\n---------------------------------\n\nThree reconciliations surface on the envelope for the audit trail:\n* \"die 7 Welle-Integration-Smokes\" -- five aggregators on main; Welle-1+2\n  are audit-anchor-only stand-ins\n* \"Cascade-Topologie per AP-9\" -- (3,4,5,6,7) is Welle-3-specific; full\n  seven tuples surface in forward_cascade_topology\n* \"ADR-0066 Marathon-Cadence\" -- PAR-path authority for (1,2)/(4,5)/(6,7)\n  coupling-kind discipline\n\nSandbox-boundary (ADR-0034, feedback_sandbox_host_trennung.md): hermetic,\nstdlib-only, no network IO, no actual Welle dispatch, no gh workflow run.\n\nContinuous-Mode: per feedback_continuous_mode_keine_pause_frage.md and\nfeedback_continuous_mode_keine_push_frage.md the merge of this PR is part\nof the Tag-76 Marathon-Closeout substrate-set and happens automatically.\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8c9f289884b5b7ff1ea6485bbcb525dda4cc0a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/d8c9f289884b5b7ff1ea6485bbcb525dda4cc0a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/d48bde1d7d38f2867b926257983a96a679c35c3d","verification":{"payload":"tree d8c9f289884b5b7ff1ea6485bbcb525dda4cc0a4\nparent f39456ef0e6c511ca1f7a07e0e42775179b35e11\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779213844 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 17792138