7)\n  coupling-kind discipline\n\nSandbox-boundary (ADR-0034, feedback_sandbox_host_trennung.md): hermetic,\nstdlib-only, no network IO, no actual Welle dispatch, no gh workflow run.\n\nContinuous-Mode: per feedback_continuous_mode_keine_pause_frage.md and\nfeedback_continuous_mode_keine_push_frage.md the merge of this PR is part\nof the Tag-76 Marathon-Closeout substrate-set and happens automatically.\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann <kai@wakir.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDKYUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAq+cQAK4LOOaVaC/QJW1vJg8oDcwZ\nt0K9y2kZFUS1XpazycB7fH4rsdybZ2JOraQC0+9o1xK2EnRQ0HBvGFE3vP3cpqj2\n0t8uU6wBLLhGo/V+85rPma3FNPZ/D1fF/q60wBXBJHOShWeIcI4k3TyQpzb6CftK\n3oIyJj2HPovglmoVIf2bhVatf894vogPgIpCQPLWSrMaGAs4uxG2uOAHIlZduBx+\nIeIIbXzOW9MYVtJvoOFwoU0KbwGqYUDPPl/1WFqoo7p12J6ZRkYs0EwoNak5Vt0Q\npWrWWmx/6TnV14CNDu2F6MJx9nvYCaGFzK3TQc1X9QYaWjZs4nG+EYUk8VSlXSO3\nEwYESvNES+/NIntrI2jbd6BXSYwZ5apVVjklOV64htSew7bcWdSj8XLoSK1PA2mt\nf4KKiaSMrfrI8q34OEXt2YDVZRHa/X+XxbzzsfQzxnlMtCnU4I0AqkNax/hglNKq\nSQnl/X5xULV6ZVnMLmQpKE7TplG7YrsFeRIeDPbb0FqLKN3dlDfX8tdXAW16FiRz\nt0Hb2rXau7Z9PmpEu89tmzEvHOgmmSn2AqbhWSM+QKPMCVcVUjts/Jbo/QwraBEG\nDqYevdrTQKo6vZpMYSgwq56tOH0fEGMKbYvAQKay1YLuPpmwpZlCYIxdtg5OIqio\n4nd71i91aIHjepGDezyi\n=wlVC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T18:04:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_u