8d12af632\nparent af8966a7d131d7809e5d0f7a263e54a6628e865f\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779213548 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779213548 +0200\n\nTag-76 Operator-Hand Production-Bringup-Recipe (Day-1..Day-7 post-Welle-7-Sign-off, Kai, 30 tests) (#480)\n\n- docs/operations/operator-hand-production-bringup-recipe.md: 8-section\n  Day-after-Welle-7-Sign-off Operator-Hand companion-doc covering\n  Day-1 (2026-07-04 Sa Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Fire-Day) through\n  Day-7 (2026-07-10 Fr Marathon-Final-Bilanz-Day). Five Production-\n  Bringup-Steps B1..B5, four Rollback-Pfade R-PB-A..R-PB-D, three\n  AR-Hand-Touchpoints TP-PB-1..TP-PB-3. Section 9 reproduces the\n  Tag-65 AR-Vorzeichen \"Halt vor Phase 4\" verbatim and pins\n  PHASE-4-HOLD-VOR-RE-ARM through the full Day-1..Day-7 window\n  (Phase-4-Vor-Vorbereitung named-but-inert per §9.5).\n- tooling/ci/verify_production_bringup_recipe_doc.py: hermetic\n  verifier (H1..H14 hard, S1..S4 soft) including verbatim-token\n  preservation check on the AR-Vorzeichen quote (H9).\n- tests/observability/test_production_bringup_recipe_tag76.py: 30\n  hermetic tests (A1..A12 doc + B1..B18 verifier), all passing.\n\nDay-1 B1 fires (or blocks) the Phase-3-COMPLETE-marker based on\nthe Welle-7-Day P5 Final-Sealing-Decision-Commit (Tag-75 substrate\nhand-off via state/phase-3-marathon-global-verdict.json).\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann (DevOps) <kai@wakir-labs.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDKTsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxYcQALIUYNInjtvyy8qs951/kKaI\nYg9Kmk0P2h96ZJJ+bFyRxIxHN05NlbgwZZhZ8fMg7jprzLHLNhR4lD5SdZlsoouq\n/ND49oLcZdmJQRA9YydP5tavmA6sTDhsLBUYqwYB1GMbNfJdzxaJTQX94matuPsv\nDhEZO5B/f5gt6QtP1IwRuxU7XlOTZz9mCymh/Bpdi0mOKPgysS6FlrTqc6hqml8Q\nNZzH1vp3dqTgOoBZCd2WZTJqf9bVX7qGDSIt7HQ3ZBYuVuLnOlD2qMZZksHPQb8M\naOjIPhXs+8uk5fcFq62mfqeVBENW9Gnb/YcWsDGSXfb+K9pDuKjAmrOAISCzL056\nRTZoNSbKefvXP4sumtP5Nq9U++