er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/6f2759826a5f9e6fb465fb708323e89ef0f56817/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:54:35Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:54:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(audit): Tag-76 Marathon-Closeout-Aggregator (Welle-1..7 bundler, Reza, 31 tests) (#479)\n\nAudit-only stdlib helper that aggregates the seven per-Welle Final-\nSealing-Verifier outcomes into a single marathon-closeout verdict and\ninspects the Production-Bringup-Marker (post-Welle-7-signoff trigger,\ncanonical 2026-07-03) plus Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Readiness state.\n\nSubstance:\n- tooling/audit/verify_marathon_closeout.py: 16 invariants + verdict\n  computer (MARATHON-CLOSEOUT-READY/PARTIAL/DEFECT), canonical Welle-\n  Kind-per-Welle and canonical Signoff-Date-per-Welle cross-pins,\n  CLI emits JSON envelope on stdout.\n- tests/audit/test_marathon_closeout_tag76.py: 31 hermetic tests\n  covering all invariants, both verdict-types, CLI surface, REUSE\n  discipline, and stdlib-only-import recital.\n\nSandbox-boundary recital:\n- No per-Welle-verifier execution; no engine invocation; no schema-\n  registry write; no audit-trail write; no marker emission; no\n  promotion-PR opening; no release-tag cut. probe_default_mode is\n  inspection-only.\n\nCross-anchors: ADR-0007, ADR-0017, ADR-0023a, ADR-0023b, ADR-0025,\nADR-0066, pre-cutover-acceptance-run-order doc, Tag-75 Welle-7 sealing-\nverifier, Tag-74 Welle-6 parity-verifier, Tag-73 Welle-5 capability-\nverifier.\n\n-- Reza\n\nCo-authored-by: Mira Kessler <mira@wakir.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a0348ce8c3fad89300d36bc88f2e3471fbca540","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/7a0348ce8c3fad89300d36bc88f2e3471fbca540"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/6f2759826a5f9e6fb465fb708323e89ef0f56817","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a0348ce8c3fad89300d36bc88f2e3471fbca540\nparent 8f0072edce70dbc98c90ccccea3cb8adf3c92064\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779213275 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779213275 +0200\n\nfeat(audit): Tag-76 Marathon-Closeout-Aggregator (Welle-1..7 bundler, Reza, 31 tests) (#479)\n\nAudit-only stdlib helper that aggregates the seven per-Welle Final-\nSealing-Verifier outcomes into a single marathon-closeout verdict and\ninspects the Production-Bringup-Marker (post-Welle-7-signoff trigger,\ncanonical 2026-07-03) plus Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Readiness state.\n\nSubstance:\n- tooling/audit/verify_marathon_closeout.py: 16 invariants + verdict\n  computer (MARATHON-CLOSEOUT-READY/PARTIAL/DEFECT), canonical Welle-\n  Kind-per-Welle and canonical Signoff-Date-per-Welle cross-pins,\n  CLI emits JSON envelope on stdout.\n- tests/audit/test_marathon_closeout_tag76.py: 31 hermetic tests\n  covering all invariants, both verdict-types, CLI surface, REUSE\n  discipline, and stdlib-only-import recital.\n\nSandbox-boundary recital:\n- No per-Welle-verifier execution; no engine invocation; no schema-\n  registry write; no audit-trail write; no marker emission; no\n  promotion-PR opening; no release-tag cut. probe_default_mode is\n  inspection-only.\n\nCross-anchors: ADR-0007, ADR-0017, ADR-0023a, ADR-0023b, ADR-0025,\nADR-0066, pre-cutover-acceptance-run-order doc, Tag-75 Welle-7 sealing-\nverifier, Tag-74 Welle-6 parity-verifier, Tag-73 Welle-5 capability-\nverifier.\n\n-- Reza\n\nCo-authored-by: Mira Kessler <mira@wakir.local>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDKPbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7yUQAJUWHPCsgT2KRseS81Y4aEFN\ncjgf749Nnh/415KfoAjmPfgqpgOUqbwctXFWnoa3+huSsmbX+QIhqyG2d2oV/g0a\nJEU9Adhrk6N4+9ux2U6QNJeXjxkdTvhhgo1a+WcpnQ6cCqPhWB7mCl6zs8hrPt64\nT1/ovrpPo3hyX1wbTCcNv1Bs8ihEbQc6/QgGZf8Vhug5xVqMM40QAghss0nZ2hnt\nh9QCweIamnFmphdcufUoHZg3xYFP93R/ZintaMmqvEVKdnPVqgmjpdT6BEL5p3qh\nj+h0izT4XPqJtebVbstl7Ry/TCY2f4Jvm4u+vTcEtzjhYFcITScaJTwsNkXDU1Xg\n0zRylAFNsMNjIjwy3CNLSsOs9IQcEc80iJAD8eZCkj5nUkiGGzpV7FJveFO72RPJ\nR+ISdvEzPvQIZu2MCgIRQ/bwitCGgeD0ontGgRpUJkdNCejb/1nEB+T/89HT+ect\nfa3eKCwdabBOftNDq3b0Yjb5T5/H9FrcoyoQ3a5hFj6/CQlTjvwTfvvc2gk19Qf/\nhtr/7ELgvWRwdHPywo8abDPL4yS6Ec74hAgA0qQjf10uY5FOAjxJXyG/KCIWWMfH\naqgB2rFnwiZGRRhOduz2VYCkE1/EmSqnvKMj/bgjGnDkBRMdlLJb3yBymFPnR2mT\nr0igilIpl8yH6neIJOyQ\n=2tCA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T17:54:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url"