":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/8fc24d380f1eb45c72b70ea282c92b56e40b2f15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:09:28Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:09:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(observability): Tag-75 Welle-7 Final-Sealing-Alert-Routing-Erweiterung (Noa SRE, 24 tests) (#474)\n\nTwo additional Welle-7 alerts close the final-sealing positive-\nconfirmation + Pre-Auditor-Signal routing gap surfaced during\nthe Tag-74 stability-window review. Welle-7 is the terminal\nwelle in the KW-27 doppel-cutover sequence; the existing alarms\nsurface FAILURES (RecoveryRehearsalFail, RecoveryReplayDivergence,\nRecoveryWithoutPreAuditWarning). Tag-75 adds the positive-state\nsurface so the AR-Hand audit-trail closes Welle-7 without\ninferring success from absence-of-failure.\n\nNew alerts (appended to welle-7-alerts group):\n  * WakirPhase3Welle7FinalSealingComplete (info)\n    Fires when ALL prior welle Schluss-Audit-Signoffs are recorded\n    (welles 1..6) AND Welle-7 Schluss-Audit-Signoff carrying\n    auditor=external-pre-auditor is recorded; for: 2m.\n  * WakirPhase3Welle7PreAuditorSignalReceived (info)\n    Pre-Auditor-Signal-Alert: positive-acknowledgement counterpart\n    to WakirWelle7RecoveryWithoutPreAuditWarning (IIA-1130 default-\n    path warning). Fires when wakir_welle_pre_auditor_designation_\n    received{welle=\"welle-7\"} == 1 for: 2m.\n\nRouting class welle-7-final-sealing-info added to bridge\nROUTING_CLASS_CHANNELS table (ntfy:ar-hand-info + activity-log:\nappend) and VALID_ROUTING_CLASSES + ROUTING_CLASS_ESCALATION_\nSECONDS (escalation=0). No on-call page from this block.\n\nCross-Repo-Mirror: dashboards/phase-3-marathon-alerts.yaml and\nscripts/observability/alert-rule-to-mira-notify-bridge.py\nmirrored byte-equal into wirelang/specs/protocol-mirror-seed/.\n\nTest-Suite: 24 hermetic tests in tests/observability/\ntest_welle_7_routing_tag75.py covering YAML surface, bridge\nALERT_CATALOG, routing-class table, cross-repo-mirror byte-\nequality, cross-reference consistency, regression guard for\nprior Tag-71/72/73/74 routing classes, end-to-end\nmap_alert_to_event_kwargs channel-set enrichment.\n\nAuftrag: Mira 2026-05-19 Tag-75 Continuous-Mode-Marathon spawn.\n\nCo-authored-by: Noa Bergstroem <noa@wakir.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb654adaf7d9ee5158e8d963c26f8bca692409eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/bb654adaf7d9ee5158e8d963c26f8bca692409eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/8fc24d380f1eb45c72b70ea282c92b56e40b2f15","verification":{"payload":"tree bb654adaf7d9ee5158e8d963c26f8bca692409eb\nparent dd455321032db3c5ebf59469a8a6100ce66e3807\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779210568 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779210568 +0200\n\nfeat(observability): Tag-75 Welle-7 Final-Sealing-Alert-Routing-Erweiterung (Noa SRE, 24 tests) (#474)\n\nTwo additional Welle-7 alerts close the final-sealing positive-\nconfirmation + Pre-Auditor-Signal routing gap surfaced during\nthe Tag-74 stability-window review. Welle-7 is the terminal\nwelle in the KW-27 doppel-cutover sequence; the existing alarms\nsurface FAILURES (RecoveryRehearsalFail, RecoveryReplayDivergence,\nRecoveryWithoutPreAuditWarning). Tag-75 adds the positive-state\nsurface so the AR-Hand audit-trail closes Welle-7 without\ninferring success from absence-of-failure.\n\nNew alerts (appended to welle-7-alerts group):\n  * WakirPhase3Welle7FinalSealingComplete (info)\n    Fires when ALL prior welle Schluss-Audit-Signoffs are recorded\n    (welles 1..6) AND Welle-7 Schluss-Audit-Signoff carrying\n    auditor=external-pre-auditor is recorded; for: 2m.\n  * WakirPhase3Welle7PreAuditorSignalReceived (info)\n    Pre-Auditor-Signal-Alert: positive-acknowledgement counterpart\n    to WakirWelle7RecoveryWithoutPreAuditWarning (IIA-1130 default-\n    path warning). Fires when wakir_welle_pre_auditor_designation_\n    received{welle=\"welle-7\"} == 1 for: 2m.\n\nRouting class welle-7-final-sealing-info added to bridge\nROUTING_CLASS_CHANNELS table (ntfy:ar-hand-info + activity-log:\nappend) and VALID_ROUTING_CLASSES + ROUTING_CLASS_ESCALATION_\nSECONDS (escalation=0). No on-call page from this block.\n\nCross-Repo-Mirror: dashboards/phase-3-marathon-alerts.yaml and\nscripts/observability/alert-rule-to-mira-notify-bridge.py\nmirrored byte-equal into wirelang/specs/protocol-mirror-seed/.\n\nTest-Suite: 24 hermetic tests in tests/observability/\ntest_welle_7_routing_tag75.py covering YAML surface, bridge\nALERT_CATALOG, routing-class table, cross-repo-mirror byte-\nequality, cross-reference consistency, regression guard for\nprior Tag-71/72/73/74 routing classes, end-to-end\nmap_alert_to_event_kwargs channel-set enrichment.\n\nAuftrag: Mira 2026-05-19 Tag-75 Continuous-Mode-Marathon spawn.\n\nCo-authored-by: Noa Bergstroem <noa@wakir.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"---