TU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commit/dd455321032db3c5ebf59469a8a6100ce66e3807","sha":"dd455321032db3c5ebf59469a8a6100ce66e3807","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/dd455321032db3c5ebf59469a8a6100ce66e3807"}],"sha":"8fc24d380f1eb45c72b70ea282c92b56e40b2f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/8fc24d380f1eb45c72b70ea282c92b56e40b2f15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281068747?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/dd455321032db3c5ebf59469a8a6100ce66e3807/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:09:00Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T17:09:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(operations): Tag-75 Operator-Hand Welle-7 Day-of-Recipe-Patch (Kai, 35 tests, doc-form-only) (#476)\n\nWelle-7 ist die vierte Phase-3c-Marathon-Welle mit Pre-Auditor-Section-11-\nDisziplin (IIA-1130) -- nach Welle-3 (Tag-71), Welle-5 (Tag-73) und\nWelle-6 (Tag-74). Welle-7 ist zugleich die Final-Sealing-Welle der\nPhase-3c: Post-Welle-7 fires Layer-1-full + Layer-3-full + Marathon-\nFinal-Acceptance-Live-Verify-Gate als Global Acceptance-Verdict, der das\nPhase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Fire gated (per pre-cutover-acceptance-run-\norder.md §3.2 + §5.4 + §7.2).\n\nSubstanz dieser PR:\n* docs/operations/operator-hand-welle-7-eve-recipe-patch.md\n  -- P1..P4 Pre-Sequence + P5 Post-Sequence (Final-Sealing-Aggregation),\n     vier Welle-7-spezifische Rollback-Pfade R-W7-A/B/C/D (mit\n     KW-27-Doppel-Welle-Decouple Final-Sealing-Variant), drei AR-Hand-\n     Touchpoints TP-W7-1/2/3, Aggregate-Verdict-Roll-up §4 mit\n     WELLE-7-VERDICT-FINAL-SEALING-BLOCK + WELLE-7-VERDICT-CUTOVER-DONE-\n     MARKER-FIRED.\n* tooling/ci/verify_welle_7_recipe_patch_doc.py\n  -- 14 Hard-Checks (H1..H14), 4 Soft-Checks (S1..S4), Exit-Codes 0/1/2.\n     H13/H14 sind Welle-7-unique (Final-Sealing-Authority semantics +\n     Global-Verdict-Aggregator helper path).\n* tests/observability/test_welle_7_recipe_patch_tag75.py\n  -- 35 hermetische Tests (A1..A11 doc-structural, B1..B24\n     verifier-behaviour inkl. CLI-Smoke + Konstanten-Diff-Sentinel).\n\nWelle-7-unique Spezifika vs. Welle-3/5/6-Patches:\n* Final-Sealing-Authority-Mandate (P1 final_sealing_authority flag,\n  P3 final_sealing_intent commit, P5 final_sealing_decision +\n  Global-Verdict-Aggregator-Trigger + Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Fire).\n* Terminal-Welle property (no downstream propagation; cascade endet\n  hier; cross_welle_propagation block stays null per aggregator-design).\n* Marker-Fire-Irreversibilitaet (nur durch Phase-3-RE-OPEN-ADR\n  revidierbar) -- explicit in Rollback-Pfade §5 dokumentiert.\n* KW-27-Doppel-Welle-Decouple-Final-Sealing-Variant (R-W7-D): Welle-7-\n  solo requires strikte Isolations-Bedingungen wegen KW-27-cascade-\n  directionality (Welle-6 -> Welle-7).\n\nSandbox-Posture: doc-form-only (ADR-0058 + AR-Direktive Tag-44 + Tag-66 +\nTag-71/73/74 precedents). Operator-Hand actions (PR-creates, PR-merges,\nFinal-Sealing-marker-fires) happen in live mit explizit Mira-Hand-\nAuthorisation per push. Cross-Review Zone-A (Reza, Identity/Recovery)\n+ Zone-D (Reza, V-904 Phase-3 substrate) markiert fuer Final-Sealing-\nmarker-fire-payload schema validation.\n\nTests: 35/35 green hermetisch. REUSE-clean (Apache-2.0 wildcard).\nVerifier-CLI auf real doc: hard_failures=0, soft_warnings=0, VERDICT\nWELLE-7-RECIPE-PATCH-DOC-CLEAN.\n\nCanonical-anchor Welle-7-Day-Datum: 2026-07-01 KW-27-Mi (Tag-57\npre-cutover-acceptance-run-order.md §3 Per-Welle Run-Order Table).\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann (DevOps) <kai@wakir-labs.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46e99fe42cc7c8f2b26c76bf45b40b1eea8631ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/46e99fe42cc7c8f2b26c76bf45b40b1eea8631ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/dd455321032db3c5ebf59469a8a6100ce66e3807","verification":{"payload":"tree 46e99fe42cc7c8f2b26c76bf45b40b1eea8631ec\nparent 0217b1bc6d66d46a533ea978e90ad086796bd323\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779210540 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779210540 +0200\n\ndocs(operations): Tag-75 Operator-Hand Welle-7 Day-of-Recipe-Patch (Kai, 35 tests, doc-form-only) (#476)\n\nWelle-7 ist die vierte Phase-3c-Marathon-Welle mit Pre-Auditor-Section-11-\nDisziplin (IIA-1130) -- nach Welle-3 (Tag-71), Welle-5 (Tag-73) und\nWelle-6 (Tag-74). Welle-7 ist zugleich die Final-Sealing-Welle der\nPhase-3c: Post-Welle-7 fires Layer-1-full + Layer-3-full + Marathon-\nFinal-Acceptance-Live-Verify-Gate als Global Acceptance-Verdict, der das\nPhase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Fire gated (per pre-cutover-acceptance-run-\norder.md §3.2 + §5.4 + §7.2).\n\nSubstanz dieser PR:\n* docs/operations/operator-hand-welle-7-eve-recipe-patch.md\n  -- P1..P4 Pre-Sequence + P5 Post-Sequence (Final-Sealing-Aggregation),\n     vier Welle-7-spezifische Rollback-Pfade R-W7-A/B/C/D (mit\n     KW-27-Doppel-Welle-Decouple Final-Sealing-Variant), drei AR-Hand-\n     Touchpoints TP-W7-1/2/3, Aggregate-Verdict-Roll-up §4 mit\n     WELLE-7-VERDICT-FINAL-SEALING-BLOCK + WELLE-7-VERDICT-CUTOVER-DONE-\n     MARKER-FIRED.\n* tooling/ci/verify_welle_7_recipe_patch_doc.py\n  -- 14 Hard-Checks (H1..H14), 4 Soft-Checks (S1..S4), Exit-Codes 0/1/2.\n     H13/H14 sind Welle-7-unique (Final-Sealing-Authority semantics +\n     Global-Verdict-Aggregator helper path).\n* tests/observability/test_welle_7_recipe_patch_tag75.py\n  -- 35 hermetische Tests (A1..A11 doc-structural, B1..B24\n     verifier-behaviour inkl. CLI-Smoke + Konstanten-Diff-Sentinel).\n\nWelle-7-unique Spezifika vs. Welle-3/5/6-Patches:\n* Final-Sealing-Authority-Mandate (P1 final_sealing_authority flag,\n  P3 final_sealing_intent commit, P5 final_sealing_decision +\n  Global-Verdict-Aggregator-Trigger + Phase-3-COMPLETE-Marker-Fire).\n* Terminal-Welle property (no downstream propagation; cascade endet\n  hier; cross_welle_propagation block stays null per aggregator-design).\n* Marker-Fire-Irreversibilitaet (nur durch Phase-3-RE-OPEN-ADR\n  revidierbar) -- explicit in Rollback-Pfade §5 dokumentiert.\n* KW-27-Doppel-Welle-Decouple-Final-Sealing-Variant (R-W7-D): Welle-7-\n  solo requires strikte Isolations-Bedingungen wegen KW-27-cascade-\n  directionality (Welle-6 -> Welle-7).\n\nSandbox-Posture: doc-form-only (ADR-0058 + AR-Direktive Tag-44 + Tag-66 +\nTag-71/73/74 precedents). Operator-Hand actions (PR-creates, PR-merges,\nFinal-Sealing-marker-fires) happen in live mit explizit Mira-Hand-\nAuthorisation per push. Cross-Review Zone-A (Reza, Identity/Recovery)\n+ Zone-D (Reza, V-904 Phase-3 substrate) markiert fuer Final-Sealing-\nmarker-fire-payload schema validation.\n\nTests: 35/35 green hermetisch. REUSE-clean (Apache-2.0 wildcard).\nVerifier-CLI auf real doc: hard_failures=0, soft_warnings=0, VERDICT\nWELLE-7-RECIPE-PATCH-DOC-CLEAN.\n\nCanonical-anchor Welle-7-Day-Datum: 2026-07-01 KW-27-Mi (Tag-57\npre-cutover-acceptance-run-order.md §3 Per-Welle Run-Order Table).\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann (DevOps) <kai@wakir-labs.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDJksCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKYoQAE026Bepv8rorPDfGxS2VJNt\nOVJANP9l9uiqPK5a6Y00U2JSP6nZvuG3oLj4zYldUBogqR81Vm9rP8BunkZuSXyr\nL5r+URukeMT5tKg4zVVa0JTxrNL4c4DzYLaeCT/g1czc9QA0jKJyLutlGuLjdDzT\nlLC5ndKBIOn2CDYeGENO5WkfaiARFfRFfAauLnfPIXxe3fQBufW44A80tK3g2cdU\niFsq9z2kJ9a/Cmwf6/mDslppz7ZwOJewlWgWgWhAftk5TZBg0g9EIRTHRsEculXp\nNbniI7L/TO687gricDaWVG2kLH0MDxc0l1dXboAdQeHjPiVl1lyuIsMHJrqqJ1ML\nZqe3egtw/Bu/XyFUOTBM+dNUA1ctbhwBqzQH1U5HyBj9aKjhI7IKwnWdHkwnxcR3\nPYtzEnweFMk9y1YzVUSAbgc4PnWvo8RNRf5iZeGyTgf2DWS18n+xFLHyXPfyEf2b\nkIUhcaRTiHLWguGnPP7msgLy73ahMt5XRXBkePX4B+tD7SSVB1bU5yvtT85hziWD\nIUkb05Peuec0uPFbpW0uu/9z8WrSL0mmAjOEiCNOv7g5J0wiuAvbbS+9Zehs6GgZ\nB+oIVwbtlwsaLnyIwboDLr6FwgIAxjgt7xE2CC1/mCBkqhbhJme9YNnaieNRY1bD\nVRCyHXcDYZdNs8i0BeR2\n=S5cA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T17:09:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow