hub.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(audit): Tag-75 Welle-7 final-sealing-spec verifier (Reza, 32 tests) (#473)\n\nPhase-3c-Cutover-Marathon-Schluss-Sealing. Audit-only / doc-form-only\nhelper for Welle-7 final-sealing-spec conformance. Validates a sealing\ndocument with 21 invariants over predecessor wellen, marker families,\nOTS anchor chain, sealing budget, sandbox boundary, cross-anchors.\n\nHelper:  tooling/audit/verify_welle_7_final_sealing.py (stdlib-only)\nTests:   tests/audit/test_welle_7_final_sealing_tag75.py (32 hermetic)\n\nWelle-7 invariants summary:\n  I-1..I-4:   tag/welle/audit-only/scope/id shape\n  I-5..I-6:   six predecessor wellen, all signed-off\n  I-7..I-9:   marker families (capability + parity cornerstones),\n              finalisation status consistency\n  I-10..I-13: OTS anchor chain shape, link adjacency, head/tail\n              pin consistency, chain_complete vs gap_count\n  I-14..I-15: sealing budget shape + enforcement\n  I-16:       sandbox boundary (six bools incl. no_release_tag_cut)\n  I-17:       cross-anchors with tag_74_parity_layer carry-forward\n  I-18..I-19: strict shape, audit_only bool-typed\n  I-20:       any ''rejected'' predecessor signoff is terminal\n  I-21:       helper itself touches no engine/registry/wat/spec/PR/tag\n\nSandbox-boundary: helper is stdlib-only (no requests/urllib3/httpx/\nNATS-py/biscuit/cryptography), no engine invocation, no schema-\nregistry write, no audit-trail write, no spec-compiler call, no\npromotion-PR opening, no release-tag cut.\n\n-- Reza\n\nCo-authored-by: Reza Tehrani <reza@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"c4a51e78c00259d045bf0b33b9787ee2e5af9bf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/c4a51e78c00259d045bf0b33b9787ee2e5af9bf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/0217b1bc6d66d46a533ea978e90ad086796bd323","verification":{"payload":"tree c4a51e78c00259d045bf0b33b9787ee2e5af9bf7\nparent 72c05813a78b0e56991826c68176fba2903ae0eb\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779210353 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779210353 +0200\n\nfeat(audit): Tag-75 Welle-7 final-sealing-spec verifier (Reza, 32 tests) (#473)\n\nPhase-3c-Cutover-Marathon-Schluss-Sealing. Audit-only / doc-form-only\nhelper for Welle-7 final-sealing-spec conformance. Validates a sealing\ndocument with 21 invariants over predecessor wellen, marker families,\nOTS anchor chain, sealing budget, sandbox boundary, cross-anchors.\n\nHelper:  tooling/audit/verify_welle_7_final_sealing.py (stdlib-only)\nTests:   tests/audit/test_welle_7_final_sealing_tag75.py (32 hermetic)\n\nWelle-7 invariants summary:\n  I-1..I-4:   tag/welle/audit-only/scope/id shape\n  I-5..I-6:   six predecessor wellen, all signed-off\n  I-7..I-9:   marker families (capability + parity cornerstones),\n              finalisation status consistency\n  I-10..I-13: OTS anchor chain shape, link adjacency, head/tail\n              pin consistency, chain_complete vs gap_count\n  I-14..I-15: sealing budget shape + enforcement\n  I-16:       sandbox boundary (six bools incl. no_release_tag_cut)\n  I-17:       cross-anchors with tag_74_parity_layer carry-forward\n  I-18..I-19: strict shape, audit_only bool-typed\n  I-20:       any ''rejected'' predecessor signoff is terminal\n  I-21:       helper itself touches no engine/registry/wat/spec/PR/tag\n\nSandbox-boundary: helper is stdlib-only (no requests/urllib3/httpx/\nNATS-py/biscuit/cryptography), no engine invocation, no schema-\nregistry write, no audit-trail write, no spec-compiler call, no\npromotion-PR opening, no release-tag cut.\n\n-- Reza\n\nCo-authored-by: Reza Tehrani <reza@wakir.dev>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDJhxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9McQACfq5vO7B9yItHohdIHTF73W\nBtXLKQ6dpA+k83dn9hi2fNM7Zof/VXdYdy5eNS2qinstU3ylZicbPPJgnSPFiqAk\nN3NHPBEkS3Aj3A2K6yfCOodth9wlGpEQCrQ9DfEAkwzy48rd6kFSHE23yk+q+kWq\nGF76WSolNLELFSL8TFWBcGwQafThSOsamoJfmLwZLK0nvn8hO4LsOuV0