blocked (6,7))\n* Stage 5 -- Aggregate WELLE-6-INTACT/DRIFT/DEFECT\n\nBrief-vs-canonical reconciliations (Tag-71+72+73 lehre):\n1. Brief \"Cross-Substrate-Parity-Welle\" -> canonical J3 W6\n   subscribe_loop rust->python (Marathon-Rollback-Runbook view);\n   cross_substrate_parity surfaced as parallel KW-24-Acceptance §6.\n2. Brief \"KW-26 Fr\" -> canonical KW-27 Mi 2026-07-01 cutover /\n   KW-27 Fr 2026-07-03 sign-off (ADR-0066 Marathon-Cadence\n   supersedes KW-24-Acceptance §6 chronology).\n3. state/welle-6.json kw_cutover_anchor=KW-26 -> canonical KW-27\n   (state-file pin-drift surfaced; state-file NOT patched, Selin\n   producer-domain per ADR-0036).\n\nForward-cascade symmetry note: Welle-7 IS in cascade-set under\nPAR-path (Doppel-Welle-6+7 symmetric coupling) -- divergence from\nTag-73 Welle-5 one-way coupling to Welle-4. Wellen-1..5 are\nupstream and NOT in cascade.\n\nHermetic (stdlib only). No NATS, no SPIRE, no gh workflow run,\nno ntfy POST. Actual Welle-6 trigger on 2026-07-01 is operator-hand.\n\nREUSE-compliant (REUSE-IgnoreStart/End wraps in aggregator + test).\n\nRefs: docs/quality-gates/pre-cutover-acceptance-run-order.md row\nWelle-6, docs/quality-gates/phase-3-marathon-final-acceptance.md\nrow KW-27, docs/quality-gates/phase-3c-doppel-welle-6-7.md,\ndocs/ci/phase-3-marathon-rollback-runbook.md J3,\ndocs/quality-gates/kw-24-welle-1-7-acceptance-criteria.md §6.\n\nContinuous-Mode (Mira, 2026-05-19).\n\nCo-authored-by: Amara Osei <amara@wakir.dev>","tree":{"sha":"66bfc18736903f44d7179301caae920ec4a2032b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/66bfc18736903f44d7179301caae920ec4a2032b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/d70090f5e4d860e1c0fabf4ccb13c722946ce0d8","verification":{"payload":"tree 66bfc18736903f44d7179301caae920ec4a2032b\nparent 60a4c25200e1ae8cb3dd05266ee882803fdf6303\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779208960 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 177920