.\n\nCo-authored-by: Noa Bergstroem <noa@wakir.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDJLzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUV4QAH5Vt7BVgwcefbXS6MdrdDrt\nb4clODERrnmX0aPY4V/6zvpbWUQS7/sjX6BuzKQxVVKRy9jMfrKse9uJkDouB2Mb\n9p9j8WzXHo5CReP9AdmzEZDbxYCIimaN//0YmKLGD7OKPGxKbd61UwwwmATbV5G9\n41KwIqSkAC3mMEqUUqWPWjROFUbWhuWqPDSADsvDhs3mocUasuGl05T1li+w/SJT\nUYko/oL6I16gVMa915CWbvccACk8giC1f0CulZsaTJ+NmEGivpYZLwPQZc21+BXp\nWHcgwmKT3v5TWcjCwR9Og09++R2kcGS1/z51SnHJo8CF03JYga386QCx2FzDHLUa\nJt6i0PeFrm/ab6x0CQYE9mrIAdYdORUG5EnFf3/bte5U78gic38bOKSRpj/a+4U1\nGOLVpU5b0zRyND3OkMUH1IzlYQ9CirWVvUBuGWgwtII8QfFDCNt2un691O3u7Ld1\nU5gNPy+FdXHwHtKSgAcoPaJ1fOXPNSOtKxYgZ2MtP8tZod4Ctwf0RPDOK1KNWIQ4\nOyQKg2p2Um0DabAvwSfYPzGVoTmgmSkrAbdNCWY+1QTqboquo5ykQLAkc2AqWgWz\nCG/CrCM1gjfUF/kZydv77jVM7iTYAqckVnBYAtmWRnm2obwHMLVgFlehgJMWoqwt\nysh7vi9ff7+IZ/22s0s2\n=pXUa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T16:42:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.