 (#467)\n\nWelle-6 (Cross-Substrate-Parity). Audit-only structural inspector\nover a parity-document that asserts the same spec invariants hold\nacross all four substrates (engine, spec, schema-registry,\naudit-trail). 20 invariants (I-1 .. I-20). Helper does not invoke\nthe engine, does not write the schema-registry, does not touch\nWAT-leaves, does not call the spec-compiler, and does not open\nany promotion-PR. Stdlib only.\n\nFiles:\n  - tooling/audit/verify_cross_substrate_parity_spec.py\n  - tests/audit/test_cross_substrate_parity_spec_tag74.py (31 tests)\n\nREUSE-Wrap on in-helper constant block; bare SPDX literal in test\nT02 is REUSE-IgnoreStart/End-wrapped per Tag-73 hygiene lesson.\n\nCross-anchors include tag-73-capability-layer (Welle-5 carry-forward).\n\n-- Reza\n\nCo-authored-by: Mira Kessler <mira@wakir.local>","tree":{"sha":"7629c55f944a5dd81868439307b81e7f0b9ffdd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/7629c55f944a5dd81868439307b81e7f0b9ffdd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/cc908d955b8d817a03cd9041aa1c904a8d504c6f","verification":{"payload":"tree 7629c55f944a5dd81868439307b81e7f0b9ffdd9\nparent 01333a0ebfe989ff0ec2a99480e8fb3ecf34ee19\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779208542 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779208542 +0200\n\naudit(reza): Tag-74 Welle-6 Cross-Substrate-Parity Spec-Verifier (Reza, 31 tests, audit-only) (#467)\n\nWelle-6 (Cross-Substrate-Parity). Audit-only structural inspector\nover a parity-document that asserts the same spec invariants hold\nacross all four substrates (engine, spec, schema-registry,\naudit-trail). 20 invariants (I-1 .. I-20). Helper does not invoke\nthe engine, does not write the schema-registry, does not touch\nWAT-leaves, does not call the spec-compiler, and does not open\nany promotion-PR. Stdlib only.\n\nFiles:\n  - tooling/audit/verify_cross_substrate_parity_spec.py\n  - tests/audit/test_cross_substrate_parity_spe