26-05-19T16:24:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(operations): Tag-73 Operator-Hand Welle-5 Day-of-Recipe-Patch (Kai, 26 tests, doc-form-only) (#463)\n\nWelle-5 (lifecycle_state_machine / persona-engine-fsm) is the second\nPhase-3c marathon welle with Pre-Auditor-Section-11-Discipline (IIA-1130),\nfollowing the Welle-3 Tag-71-Patch precedent. Welle-5 carries two\nintertwined hot-spot axes (fsm-phantom + capability-token-rotation),\neach requiring axis-resolved Pre-Auditor verdicts. Doc-form-only per\nADR-0058 + AR-Direktive Tag-44/66/71.\n\nSubstrate:\n- docs/operations/operator-hand-welle-5-eve-recipe-patch.md\n  Pre-Sequence P1..P4 + Standard-Day + Post-Sequence P5 +\n  four Welle-5-specific Rollback-Pfade R-W5-A..D (incl.\n  KW-26-Doppel-Welle-Decouple) + three AR-Hand-Touchpoints TP-W5-1..3\n- tooling/ci/verify_welle_5_recipe_patch_doc.py\n  12 hard-checks H1..H12 (incl. dual-axis hot-spot + dual-axis state-file)\n  3 soft-warnings S1..S3\n- tests/observability/test_welle_5_recipe_patch_tag73.py\n  26 hermetic tests (8 doc-A + 18 verifier-B)\n\nREUSE-3.3 compliant: 1885/1885 files licensed (no new SPDX-header\nexceptions; doc-catchall covers the new .md).\n\nTag-73 brief: Operator-Hand Welle-5 Day-of-Recipe-Patch\n(Capability-Token-Rotation hot-spot axis).\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann (DevOps) <kai@wakir-labs.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"843c9d6c4e26fb274faff50d90b41f3613fe448d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/843c9d6c4e26fb274faff50d90b41f3613fe448d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/01333a0ebfe989ff0ec2a99480e8fb3ecf34ee19","verification":{"payload":"tree 843c9d6c4e26fb274faff50d90b41f3613fe448d\nparent 155861868e0be7de9695b7dcd43c268b31fcbb9f\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779207845 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779207845 +0200\n\ndocs(operations): Tag-73 Operator-Hand Welle-5 Day-of-Recipe-Patch (Kai, 26 tests, doc-form-only) (#463)\n\nWelle-5 (lifecycle_state_machine / persona-engine-fsm) is the second\nPhase-3c marathon welle with Pre-Auditor-Section-11-Discipline (IIA-1130),\nfollowing the Welle-3 Tag-71-Patch precedent. Welle-5 carries two\nintertwined hot-spot axes (fsm-phantom + capability-token-rotation),\neach requiring axis-resolved Pre-Auditor verdicts. Doc-form-only per\nADR-0058 + AR-Direktive Tag-44/66/71.\n\nSubstrate:\n- docs/operations/operator-hand-welle-5-eve-recipe-patch.md\n  Pre-Sequence P1..P4 + Standard-Day + Post-Sequence P5 +\n  four Welle-5-specific Rollback-Pfade R-W5-A..D (incl.\n  KW-26-Doppel-Welle-Decouple) + three AR-Hand-Touchpoints TP-W5-1..3\n- tooling/ci/verify_welle_5_recipe_patch_doc.py\n  12 hard-checks H1..H12 (incl. dual-axis hot-spot + dual-axis state-file)\n  3 soft-warnings S1..S3\n- tests/observability/test_welle_5_recipe_patch_tag73.py\n  26 hermetic tests (8 doc-A + 18 verifier-B)\n\nREUSE-3.3 compliant: 1885/1885 files licensed (no new SPDX-header\nexceptions; doc-catchall covers the new .md).\n\nTag-73 brief: Operator-Hand Welle-5 Day-of-Recipe-Patch\n(Capability-Token-Rotation hot-spot axis).\n\nCo-authored-by: Kai Hoffmann (DevOps) <kai@wakir-labs.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDI6lCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtloQAEQ1BhXuJKwzE/SFMQ9BV/gH\n2nx3F79biLbUNYgFy+ZRJ7J31zH7T4iknwtqQvgwVXCBPuHTBr/N1pDsL9214IKN\n7FruLuWl/RJuWIrPIaAmG2Vua4/rjjXx1XMqi/Z6gCAI5WacHPuuJNFbw4nZGclD\nqYFEX+GXDH+z1bGHJtzwDcRaqK064YIcbD3YHmilrWqVMUk5qZ1r/z0mRQe/E11W\ngW0T3n+UTvZnyAcMbWM/dVeFtMtBMFISbeNItmDZloOMO6g5AM/M/fjmJ4rIaIs8\nnqzt7fONbioEc4l2u7xbCEojanUMt2/AHRSOLEp7GB8L7wq3Fb/LnBof7ibrMY+a\nysEe5HFZruGn/Gvh0li+rh4QTJDclT7mVoTZ3af9GtgW9Hd7XsiGZCmFiv3AzzZc\nXzqksbkLpmyVg1BiKZj2EtPZsT4ZUaoKcExtAzEW051GKhqDotLQY+nWcT/tNOiG\n/IPCMU5EuM/HKUQYkKhiPYHpgbrIeT1zJAHxAkP1EAH50ZnIhbhofAyCasSR3Cyh\n/qER3N