NoAKGRiMWM3N2NhN2U5Njg4ZWMwZWVhMTNjYTZkYzJjOTRhMTBkZTAxYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commit/24666b719603f7857dec332c96edddb62927a9f3","sha":"24666b719603f7857dec332c96edddb62927a9f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/24666b719603f7857dec332c96edddb62927a9f3"}],"sha":"db1c77ca7e9688ec0eea13ca6dc2c94a10de01a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/db1c77ca7e9688ec0eea13ca6dc2c94a10de01a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281068747?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/24666b719603f7857dec332c96edddb62927a9f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T16:10:13Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T16:10:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(observability): Tag-73 Welle-5 capability-token-rotation alert-routing extension (Noa SRE) (#462)\n\nTwo additional Welle-5 alerts close the capability-token-rotation\npositive-confirmation + rotation-lag routing gap surfaced during\nthe Welle-5 KW-26 doppel-cutover audit (DW-AC-6-7-RC R1 rotation-\nrace patterns):\n\n  * WakirPhase3Welle5CapabilityTokenRotated     (info)\n    Positive-state indicator: rotation_epoch counter increase\n    >= 1 in 10m AND rotator_state{state=\"rotated\"}=1 for >= 2m.\n    AR-Hand audit-trail marker that attests each rotation epoch\n    explicitly, not by absence-of-fault.\n\n  * WakirPhase3Welle5CapabilityTokenRotationLag (warning,\n                                                 rotation-lag-Pfad)\n    rotation_lag_seconds >= 1350 (target 900s + 50% margin per\n    ADR-0066 KW-26 doppel spec) for >= 2m. Warning severity:\n    rotation is past target but no production capability has\n    expired; AR-Hand must see + activity-log it. If rotation\n    fully stalls, the existing Welle-5 page-level alerts\n    (FSM-Phantom, Orphan-State) cover.\n\nBoth alerts carry the new routing class\nwelle-5-capability-token-info which routes to ntfy:ar-hand-info\n+ activity-log:append (no on-call page). Bridge ALERT_CATALOG\n+ ROUTING_CLASS_CHANNELS + ROUTING_CLASS_ESCALATION_SECONDS\nextended accordingly. Trinary routing-table shape invariants\n(Tag-64 contract) preserved; Tag-72 Welle-4 routing class\nretained (regression guard test included).\n\nCross-repo-mirror: both files mirrored byte-equal into\nwirelang/specs/protocol-mirror-seed/.\n\nTests: tests/observability/test_welle_5_routing_tag73.py\n(24 tests, all passing). 1111 neighbour observability tests\nunchanged (1135 total passing).\n\nCo-authored-by: Noa Bergstroem <noa@wakir.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c5eb435002ee765e7d68baa0027187fae9284cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/9c5eb435002ee765e7d68baa0027187fae9284cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/24666b719603f7857dec332c96edddb62927a9f3","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c5eb435002ee765e7d68baa0027187fae9284cd\nparent f3091bdd3d4074aeece91dc270e81265dbb47193\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779207013 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779207013 +0200\n\nfeat(observability): Tag-73 Welle-5 capability-token-rotation alert-routing extension (Noa SRE) (#462)\n\nTwo additional Welle-5 alerts close the capability-token-rotation\npositive-confirmation + rotation-lag routing gap surfaced during\nthe Welle-5 KW-26 doppel-cutover audit (DW-AC-6-7-RC R1 rotation-\nrace patterns):\n\n  * WakirPhase3Welle5CapabilityTokenRotated     (info)\n    Positive-state indicator: rotation_epoch counter increase\n    >= 1 in 10m AND rotator_state{state=\"rotated\"}=1 for >= 2m.\n    AR-Hand audit-trail marker that attests each rotation epoch\n    explicitly, not by absence-of-fault.\n\n  * WakirPhase3Welle5CapabilityTokenRotationLag (warning,\n                                                 rotation-lag-Pfad)\n    rotation_lag_seconds >= 1350 (target 900s + 50% margin per\n    ADR-0066 KW-26 doppel spec) for >= 2m. Warning severity:\n    rotation is past target but no production capability has\n    expired; AR-Hand must see + activity-log it. If rotation\n    fully stalls, the existing Welle-5 page-level alerts\n    (FSM-Phantom, Orphan-State) cover.\n\nBoth alerts carry the new routing class\nwelle-5-capability-token-info which routes to ntfy:ar-hand-info\n+ activity-log:append (no on-call page). Bridge ALERT_CATALOG\n+ ROUTING_CLASS_CHANNELS + ROUTING_CLASS_ESCALATION_SECONDS\nextended accordingly. Trinary routing-table shape invariants\n(Tag-64 contract) preserved; Tag-72 Welle-4 routing class\nretained (regression guard test included).\n\nCross-repo-mirror: both files mirrored byte-equal into\nwirelang/specs/protocol-mirror-seed/.\n\nTests: tests/observability/test_welle_5_routing_tag73.py\n(24 tests, all passing). 1111 neighbour observability tests\nunchanged (1135 total passing).\n\nCo-authored-by: Noa Bergstroem <noa@wakir.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDItlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiAQQAIHPFDOS9tG/Kr7wQPymALfQ\n+mYxu3BQ/L43Sb4s2a/QxqnxDjOmTYvSxlxtu2z7Ap2Qpm+ZvbjYQ5R6t2yJk8fw\nZBvTvC/ft+7BDYgPQa1WZqNpZVL99Ym42E/krrGg19CPaO3+B3n5zAMk7fKdLvZ3\nHxTyImggncoKZP/nTvyZpReLt/Gub6ySnVBpsl2Ch7cw1nPkIUZ4+dDg42a/eoIv\nrQ9UY1awXAxfmE0v8rcExlW9iCSMDbuE4GurPyhhDTHrrEflnZuqVT6IsBpOJNIl\nk2vk3ziAhyzJ6PvVhTOm9HIHkUXi3eQaFcNrPRLoJpFtGIY/UzIXIIJiKLKuf0kZ\n5Ds21E3hnpgON9/ETQ2XQIWzyP4ViAyAkgAZ68x6sBfaTEJbF1Rkr2PdLqjDzcXK\nMKq8DbjM5cZSIiz/0kQ+aZnj9mIi3QtOMOZBrc9ZX0W4Np6n9yBfpQCLKxsXwwsi\nCATiOrn1eZ63/X8imdg58JtYutk6RW1fms1ahSBW+fHqkZG87ajOlAFjHzHvIRfz\n/CcAEcH7hsE8kfND5z39OMSohvX312V+RYD8qi19nlyAsYLHOw7Bqotb5ntnPQdK\n7KbNYc0RG5qWa93r8BxNVI6ot1+RBCC2xZdh974gseGjTicDefGkTUnRf6UaT6JQ\n22nXWHFUxvEWMJKDw738\n=GeUE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T16:10:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commit/24666b719603f7857dec332c96edddb62927a9f3","node_id":"C_kwDOSVv36NoAKDI0NjY2YjcxOTYwM2Y3ODU3ZGVjMzMyYzk2ZWRkZGI2MjkyN2E5ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commit/f3091bdd3d4074aeece91dc270e81265dbb47193","sha":"f3091bdd3d4074aeece91dc270e81265dbb47193","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/f3091bdd3d4074aeece91dc270e81265dbb47193"}],"sha":"24666b719603f7857dec332c96edddb62927a9f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/24666b719603f7857dec332c96edddb62927a9f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281068747?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs","id":281068747,"login":"wakir-labs","node_id":"U_kgDOEMDEyw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wakir-labs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commits/f3091bdd3d4074aeece91dc270e81265dbb47193/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T16:09:59Z","email":"xypu4r8e@addy.io","name":"wakir-labs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T16:09:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(audit): Tag-73 Welle-5 Capability-Token-Layer State-Conformance Verifier (Reza, 31 tests, audit-only) (#461)\n\nAdds tooling/audit/verify_capability_token_layer_state.py — a stdlib-only,\naudit-only verifier for the Welle-5 (Capability-Token-Rotation) state\ndocument over the AIP+Biscuit Layer-3 substrate. The helper checks 20\ninvariants (I-1..I-19 + top-level shape I-0) covering:\n\n  - Tag-73 / Welle-5 / Layer-3-AIP+Biscuit identification\n  - audit_only + doc_form_only posture (refuses non-audit documents)\n  - Canonical rotation_state (pre-rotation, rotation-in-progress,\n    post-rotation-grace, post-rotation-sealed)\n  - Two-Curve-Stack issuer_curve (Ed25519 | secp256k1)\n  - biscuit-v3 token_format (ADR-0017 anchor)\n  - attenuation_depth_max in [1,8]\n  - active_tokens shape (token_id, issuer_pubkey, NB <= NA,\n    attenuation_depth, rotation_role in outgoing|incoming|stable)\n  - ADOL overlapping-validity-window semantics in post-rotation-grace\n  - 5-step canonical rotation sequence: announce-incoming ->\n    dual-validity-window-open -> outgoing-drain ->\n    dual-validity-window-close -> seal\n  - post-rotation-sealed terminal: all 5 steps done, no outgoing tokens\n  - audit_trail_refs as well-formed wat-leaf://<hex-32> URIs\n  - sandbox_boundary: 5 booleans + probe_default_mode=inspection-only\n  - cross_anchors: ADR-0007/0017/0023a/0023b/0025 + WAT-Layer-4 +\n    Wirelang-Layer-3 schema\n  - strict token-record shape (unknown fields rejected)\n  - rotation_id pattern (rot-<a-z0-9->{4,64})\n  - pre-rotation steps must all be ''planned''\n  - forward-progress invariant: incoming.not_after strictly > outgoing\n\nSandbox-Boundary-Recital: helper does NOT mint tokens, does NOT revoke\ntokens, does NOT call any AIP issuer, does NOT write the NATS-KV\ncapability-policy bucket, does NOT open any PR. probe_default_mode is\ninspection-only. Test T31 asserts no third-party imports (no requests,\nurllib3, httpx, biscuit-*, nats-*).\n\nTests: 31/31 green (tests/audit/test_capability_token_layer_verify_tag73.py)\ncovering 4 happy-path states, 19 invariant rejections, 4 CLI smoke\nscenarios, and 1 import-whitelist guard. Hermetic, stdlib + pytest only.\n\nREUSE: SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 inline; reuse lint clean.\n\nCross-Anchors:\n  - ADR-0007 OTS-Substrat\n  - ADR-0017 Embodied Capability Tokens\n  - ADR-0023a / ADR-0023b Capability-Token-Layer Charter / Wirelang-L3\n  - ADR-0025 Drei-Achsen-Modell\n  - Reza Tag-2 (Layer-3 Capability-Token Schema) + Tag-13 (Vector-Pack)\n  - Reza Strang-2-Korrektur (Two-Curve-Stack, 2026-05-06)\n  - Tag-72 RES-D4 HD-3 substrate trilogy (PR #459)\n\nTag-73 = Reza-Zone-L Substanz für Welle-5 (Doppel-Welle-4+5)\nCapability-Token-Rotation Cutover, audit-only / doc-form-only.\n\n-- Reza\n\nCo-authored-by: Mira Kessler <mira@wakir.local>","tree":{"sha":"e2de23d6d8c7773baf57c8db9342381c00c942e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/trees/e2de23d6d8c7773baf57c8db9342381c00c942e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/git/commits/f3091bdd3d4074aeece91dc270e81265dbb47193","verification":{"payload":"tree e2de23d6d8c7773baf57c8db9342381c00c942e5\nparent 27dd52802b2ebdd6c15c2471806d5952fa8fbf61\nauthor wakir-labs <xypu4r8e@addy.io> 1779206999 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779206999 +0200\n\nfeat(audit): Tag-73 Welle-5 Capability-Token-Layer State-Conformance Verifier (Reza, 31 tests, audit-only) (#461)\n\nAdds tooling/audit/verify_capability_token_layer_state.py — a stdlib-only,\naudit-only verifier for the Welle-5 (Capability-Token-Rotation) state\ndocument over the AIP+Biscuit Layer-3 substrate. The helper checks 20\ninvariants (I-1..I-19 + top-level shape I-0) covering:\n\n  - Tag-73 / Welle-5 / Layer-3-AIP+Biscuit identification\n  - audit_only + doc_form_only posture (refuses non-audit documents)\n  - Canonical rotation_state (pre-rotation, rotation-in-progress,\n    post-rotation-grace, post-rotation-sealed)\n  - Two-Curve-Stack issuer_curve (Ed25519 | secp256k1)\n  - biscuit-v3 token_format (ADR-0017 anchor)\n  - attenuation_depth_max in [1,8]\n  - active_tokens shape (token_id, issuer_pubkey, NB <= NA,\n    attenuation_depth, rotation_role in outgoing|incoming|stable)\n  - ADOL overlapping-validity-window semantics in post-rotation-grace\n  - 5-step canonical rotation sequence: announce-incoming ->\n    dual-validity-window-open -> outgoing-drain ->\n    dual-validity-window-close -> seal\n  - post-rotation-sealed terminal: all 5 steps done, no outgoing tokens\n  - audit_trail_refs as well-formed wat-leaf://<hex-32> URIs\n  - sandbox_boundary: 5 booleans + probe_default_mode=inspection-only\n  - cross_anchors: ADR-0007/0017/0023a/0023b/0025 + WAT-Layer-4 +\n    Wirelang-Layer-3 schema\n  - strict token-record shape (unknown fields rejected)\n  - rotation_id pattern (rot-<a-z0-9->{4,64})\n  - pre-rotation steps must all be ''planned''\n  - forward-progress invariant: incoming.not_after strictly > outgoing\n\nSandbox-Boundary-Recital: helper does NOT mint tokens, does NOT revoke\ntokens, does NOT call any AIP issuer, does NOT write the NATS-KV\ncapability-policy bucket, does NOT open any PR. probe_default_mode is\ninspection-only. Test T31 asserts no third-party imports (no requests,\nurllib3, httpx, biscuit-*, nats-*).\n\nTests: 31/31 green (tests/audit/test_capability_token_layer_verify_tag73.py)\ncovering 4 happy-path states, 19 invariant rejections, 4 CLI smoke\nscenarios, and 1 import-whitelist guard. Hermetic, stdlib + pytest only.\n\nREUSE: SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 inline; reuse lint clean.\n\nCross-Anchors:\n  - ADR-0007 OTS-Substrat\n  - ADR-0017 Embodied Capability Tokens\n  - ADR-0023a / ADR-0023b Capability-Token-Layer Charter / Wirelang-L3\n  - ADR-0025 Drei-Achsen-Modell\n  - Reza Tag-2 (Layer-3 Capability-Token Schema) + Tag-13 (Vector-Pack)\n  - Reza Strang-2-Korrektur (Two-Curve-Stack, 2026-05-06)\n  - Tag-72 RES-D4 HD-3 substrate trilogy (PR #459)\n\nTag-73 = Reza-Zone-L Substanz für Welle-5 (Doppel-Welle-4+5)\nCapability-Token-Rotation Cutover, audit-only / doc-form-only.\n\n-- Reza\n\nCo-authored-by: Mira Kessler <mira@wakir.local>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDItXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4ZAQAEKAJdiSgrAanFLwoVqVtbRI\nq9d3f8aIia/dnJP0RvCoHWucx0jbtn5BJnaot1hCsqFyUVGP9g7tEfExFZ14j5Bi\ntz7AQTsJXSapOzqBKmlbGYUrnZF4xAnoXhJOqNY8ttEKAi910+C4pUkbXa6iEygV\n/R0bPR9LVH34I8bnP4C6zOnV/9wmygu1cALOPKXHW6a810Yh89Rm+o+v0xL0IFNg\nwhXYvvwjtu/Kb5QKdzV/Oe6nva1KY5i35fqQRa5509dnP4RVZW8tf38W4P+ZaM2d\n/fJUq43JnTKmAUgqSY2Yqh66dwmqEPp9GBfL1WAlDj+wJNTi8bcXa73theBmSb6M\nyE+2Jkjt9PpxrldN3hx0oOfczc/95BzxuIDisQrjhehDcQ0Vz5eSlJv0cShsW1mH\nQRV6GVaQXtCO86LSrLIYKM9Ao/asj4UWP7xXuULOUOmqy6gTeGbTiMDCvmxH1FKi\nTdLJfWMNXTNeny16/h5KMKRRXVvinnukY6Vk1TxWb2qoJp0Rv6AVRXPIIbCytyWW\nGbLggM68og21sCb4k5LyROPPIgx5FzBgIv4+3Ww8HmmpnvKa1e8ncGySnCMl+TX/\nwZz2BpN2vvDG/9xEiozhEMb0WidgajZfAVLqtn1i4Pbf5XJ7hzGBYvcF5DixEUaM\nKeJYSwFPXManHwf4TMFJ\n=OaF/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T16:10:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wakir-labs/wakir-runtime/commit/f3091bdd3d4074aeece91dc270e81265dbb47193","node_id":"C_k