ommits/e56203b6a8cc64f127f89e077e2120ffb2c3d5a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T06:08:40Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T06:08:40Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"message":"fix: Settings panel now respects NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL (#468)\n\nThe multi-gateway panel was constructing WebSocket URLs client-side\nusing buildGatewayWebSocketUrl() with the gateway''s DB host/port,\nignoring the server-side URL resolution that respects\nNEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL, Tailscale Serve, and reverse-proxy configs.\n\n- Remove client-side buildGatewayWebSocketUrl fallback in connectTo()\n  — server''s /api/gateways/connect already handles all URL resolution\n- Simplify gatewayMatchesConnection() to use direct host/port string\n  matching without constructing a derived WS URL\n- Remove unused buildGatewayWebSocketUrl import\n\nFixes #468","tree":{"sha":"5531aee465ac0aeec209a1c340cfee16f23df290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsmearyanabc/Arvis-Automation/git/trees/5531aee465ac0aeec209a1c340cfee16f23df290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsmearyanabc/Arvis-Automation/git/commits/e56203b6a8cc64f127f89e077e2120ffb2c3d5a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin