4:14:59Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"message":"test: add CLI and MCP server integration tests (38 new e2e tests)\n\nCLI tests cover:\n- Help/usage output and exit codes\n- Unknown group/action handling\n- Missing required flag validation\n- Status health/overview\n- Agent list, get, heartbeat lifecycle\n- Agent memory set/get\n- Agent attribution\n- Task list, queue polling, comments add/list\n- Sessions, tokens, skills, cron, connect list\n- Raw passthrough\n\nMCP server tests cover:\n- Protocol: initialize handshake, tools/list, ping, unknown method\n- Tool schema validation (all 35 tools have name, description, schema)\n- Unknown tool error handling\n- mc_health and mc_dashboard\n- Agent tools: list, heartbeat, write/read/clear memory\n- Task tools: list, poll queue, create, add comment, list comments\n- Token stats, skills list, cron list\n\nTotal e2e: 472 → 510 (all passing)","tree":{"sha":"4e0e07d3b178128135a82c524a01ecae985fbc1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsmearyanabc/Arvis-Automation/git/trees/4e0e07d3b178128135a82c524a01ecae985fbc1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/itsmearyanabc/Arvis-Automation/git/commits/5cd515105ec660328d85448256793259d89ad77f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred