om/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/06ad0070b599c01c8aaf2a226fba0a03cc0d2c9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/528f7aac489d6bbef2a8f5e91d26d23b84624513/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T03:24:05Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T03:24:05Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(remote): show stats panel + embed build SHA in export filename\n\nLets the developer tell from a screenshot exactly what produced any\ngiven render. Two pieces:\n\n1. Stats panel sits next to the Download button and lists every dial\n   that affects output — build SHA, style, resolution, saturation,\n   smoothness, face-aware, palette mode/size, posterize bands, chunk\n   size, outline, silhouette quality + tolerance, subject-aware,\n   silhouette boundary outline, and the v4.2 cartoon-shaping group\n   (close, dilate, tight crop margin + mode, flat-fill colors).\n   Renders as monospace prose so a screenshot is readable.\n\n2. Filename of the downloaded PNG appends the short build SHA\n   (pixel-art-asset-128x128-a43a780.png), matching the displayed\n   stat. When iterating on the pipeline we can now match any\n   downloaded file back to the exact deploy that produced it.\n\nRemoved the redundant \"build X\" footer at the bottom of PixelArtApp —\nthe stats panel includes the same info in a more useful layout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb0c0112ac67815a8a4c5b1e3b594d5b969255c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/fb0c0112ac67815a8a4c5b1e3b594d5b969255c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/528f7aac489d6bbef2a8f5e91d26d23b84624513","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/528f7aac489d6bbef2a8f5e91d26d23b84624513","node_id":"C_kwDOSV4urtoAKDUyOGY3YWFjNDg5ZDZiYmVmMmE4ZjVlOTFkMjZkMjNiODQ2MjQ1MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/a43a780efd048b926aff97dc5cb6e4ac4ff9aeed","sha":"a43a780efd048b926aff97dc5cb6e4ac4ff9aeed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/a43a780efd048b926aff97dc5cb6e4ac4ff9aeed"}],"sha":"528f7aac489d6bbef2a8f5e91d26d23b84624513","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/528f7aac489d6bbef2a8f5e91d26d23b84624513"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/a43a780efd048b926aff97dc5cb6e4ac4ff9aeed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T03:10:39Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T03:10:39Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"fix(remote): watershed uses seed-distance criterion to spare concavities\n\nThe local-max-on-distance-map criterion was firing inside fg\nconcavities (e.g. dents in the mortar barrel) where the distance map\nplateaus naturally — leaving spurious bg holes inside what should be\nsolid foreground. The render came back worse than the simple\nRGB-spread version.\n\nReplace the criterion: a bg pixel is a watershed iff any 8-neighbor''s\nnearest-fg seed sits MORE THAN `SEED_GAP_THRESHOLD` source pixels\naway from this pixel''s seed on the image plane. Distant seeds = real\ngap between two fg features (tripod legs). Nearby seeds = smooth\nvariation along a single fg arc (concavity inside the subject) —\nthose fill normally now.\n\nThreshold = 4 source px: above U2-Net''s typical 1-2 px boundary jitter\nbut well below typical leg-gap widths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22da29f61980674a1c22662eb4e242d8c4d0b690","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/22da29f61980674a1c22662eb4e242d8c4d0b690"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/a43a780efd048b926aff97dc5cb6e4ac4ff9aeed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c