://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/c5d0912341730f2fbdd370d1e5282a4000f5d128"}],"sha":"62b8a294a66d10c28f5c1a34cd03ba14f16d2afd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/62b8a294a66d10c28f5c1a34cd03ba14f16d2afd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/c5d0912341730f2fbdd370d1e5282a4000f5d128/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T02:35:43Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T02:35:43Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"fix(remote): erode mask boundary before subject dilate to kill bg leak\n\nThe first RGB-spread fix didn''t fully kill the white halo because\nU2-Net masks routinely classify 1-3 source pixels of bg as fg along\nthe subject edge (binary cutoff lands on anti-aliased transition\npixels). dilateSubject was finding those leaky boundary pixels as\nthe \"first foreground 4-neighbor\" and propagating their bg-leaning\nRGB outward — the halo had subject-color-MIXED-WITH-bg, which still\nread as washed-out white on a white-bg photo.\n\nMitigation: pre-erode the mask by 2 source pixels before the spread,\nthen dilate by radius+2 so the net outward growth still equals\nradius. The spread sources are now firmly inside the subject, not on\nthe leaky boundary. Cleanup is clamped to radius so dilate=1 doesn''t\nshrink the mask. Features thinner than 4 source px (the 2*cleanup\nthreshold) lose mass — acceptable since they wouldn''t survive\naggressive fattening anyway.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"348a91e1861e50d8ec0621dd353ad297f54157c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/348a91e1861e50d8ec0621dd353ad297f54157c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/c5d0912341730f2fbdd370d1e5282a4000f5d128","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur