":{"date":"2026-05-08T02:21:31Z","email":"36343085+masonstevens95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Mason Stevens"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T02:21:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #8 from masonstevens95/feat/pixel-art-cartoon-quality-v4\n\nfix(remote): dilate spreads subject RGB, not just alpha","tree":{"sha":"fff43b77055fe1119012598f5cbb94e1f03e9708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/fff43b77055fe1119012598f5cbb94e1f03e9708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/8a09ba0e7a415664e0ec92432f0186572a65194e","verification":{"payload":"tree fff43b77055fe1119012598f5cbb94e1f03e9708\nparent 7c0768ae7185ffc0778bfad430fa446e75d519f6\nparent 8d465794dc0089981fb3afb29fd94ce926cf4ada\nauthor Mason Stevens <36343085+masonstevens95@users.noreply.github.com> 1778206891 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778206891 -0400\n\nMerge pull request #8 from masonstevens95/feat/pixel-art-cartoon-quality-v4\n\nfix(remote): dilate spreads subject RGB, not just alpha","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/UirCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnZ8QAGltyF7XqPQ/ZknHxs+r1TOg\nX06OlZSQD4imG5xmQDl12vrxK/nRxyQ25bi3YYgzuG4+Y+DCDtH+VfNwUQsqYbJ4\nOA1oBbJCm75mK3s60zX+IWlAdcRLDaGkroB9FiKKVhgCmSeUNJrE2FKgrO2R4BdA\n7SkuYtPqI9SnmEtT1L/RNcsKJYYShxjM/aRzKmiMhHDfwyg/cLJpcmXek6w7T/ib\nReth5hbakmL5KWY9piW9ZhDHPzIl1z55CQ8+AH55RvZKazRvyW+W3B7/7XVghrJf\nAeqJbtYP/hFDUfqkjEJd5FfxexYZ/vspnIoC1/ds9dYh4yEQOwxq04v7kEFOkoYo\n+ZxgmjmAcKlxEU+mapoo95DdkxWWWqOBMDOk8tIEF6oBobtwqFd9bGZ4Khel2E+L\nfDfokdSB3HX6RyNNC/C0RgqWwGW9pkM/G1tp4GHGNw0x+2QI0kvFP5WdkGlZ3Adq\nAM/leOsNfMUdRHcRlTCcsec/6+5xjYtvijqowoUAqFR9BiSJrdqOrTf1Y47Vw+D0\nDYJZYltdQqJlrXxhnAOFhnznxAxfYzzebYztLv40iZXMN4l/zNjRFbt6nx9ewnaq\nut1cn9EQ2+U7dA4Eb3U7QwQSrAzSp2f1DjtC6dRdkCYM6BLGrTpybiRMHATsjpcw\nn4ETBDmBDmtWVRgrUUmU\n=0cbB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-08T02:21:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/8a09ba0e7a415664e0ec92432f0186572a65194e","node_id":"C_kwDOSV4urtoAKDhhMDliYTBlN2E0MTU2NjRlMGVjOTI0MzJmMDE4NjU3MmE2NTE5NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/7c0768ae7185ffc0778bfad430fa446e75d519f6","sha":"7c0768ae7185ffc0778bfad430fa446e75d519f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/7c0768ae7185ffc0778bfad430fa446e75d519f6"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/8d465794dc0089981fb3afb29fd94ce926cf4ada","sha":"8d465794dc0089981fb3afb29fd94ce926cf4ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/8d465794dc0089981fb3afb29fd94ce926cf4ada"}],"sha":"8a09ba0e7a415664e0ec92432f0186572a65194e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/8a09ba0e7a415664e0ec92432f0186572a65194e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/8d465794dc0089981fb3afb29fd94ce926cf4ada/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T02:15:33Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T02:15:33Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"fix(remote): dilate spreads subject RGB, not just alpha\n\nThe v4.2 dilate was fattening the alpha mask but leaving the IMAGE''s\nRGB untouched in the dilated halo. With high dilate values on photos\nthat have a bright background (e.g. an olive-drab mortar on white),\nthe halo pixels became newly-foreground (alpha=255) but kept their\noriginal photo bg color — producing a visible white ghost around\nthe subject in the output.\n\nFix: replace dilateMask(mask, R) with dilateSubject(image, mask, R)\nwhich propagates RGB outward alongside alpha. Each newly-fg pixel\ntakes its RGB from the first 4-neighbor that was foreground in the\nprior pass; iterating R passes spreads subject edge colors R pixels\ninto the halo. The closeMask path keeps an alpha-only dilateMaskOnly\ninternally — close erodes back, so RGB spread there would be wasted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fff43b77055fe1119012598f5cbb94e1f03e9708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/fff43b77055fe1119012598f5cbb94e1f03e9708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/8d465794dc0089981fb3afb29fd94ce926cf4ada","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/8d465794dc0089981fb3afb29fd94ce926cf4ada","node_id":"C_kwDOSV4urtoAKDhkNDY1Nzk0ZGMwMDg5OTgxZmIzYWZiMjlmZDk0Y2U5MjZjZjRhZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/bb378c619f4b2797267e79