_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/f1113904f77ad9db81cff1f265485bc2140e8d01/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T19:29:37Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T19:29:37Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"docs: add v4 cartoon-quality brainstorm + plan (post-doc-review)\n\nAdds the v4 cartoon-quality requirements doc and the 9-unit plan\n(U1 ML runtime + Cache Storage, U2 source-cache, U3 bilateral,\nU4 XDoG outline, U5 ML segmentation, U6 face landmarker + boost,\nU7 filter re-tuning, U8 model-load UX, U9 invariant + bundle ceiling).\n\nPlan incorporates 5 doc-review fixes:\n- Removed phantom BlazeFace-on-ORT fallback claim from Risks; on\n  MediaPipe-in-worker failure, U6 ships with faceAware off by default\n- Resolved source-cache shape contradiction (typed struct, not Record)\n- Added bundle-ceiling contingency ladder to U9 (lazy-import audit\n  through last-resort U6 descope)\n- Added Cache Storage corruption self-heal to U1 (evict + retry once)\n- Added explicit R12 gate for face-landmark detection in U6 worker\n  routing (skip detectLandmarks when faceAwareEnabled=false)","tree":{"sha":"6ce8c0a9da3ed9e8047c37ff0d714ca27fdd78d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/6ce8c0a9da3ed9e8047c37ff0d714ca27fdd78d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/f1113904f77ad9db81cff1f265485bc2140e8d01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com