om/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/b64a52156ce5c487f1c2981fba5286b4b8f3bb1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T11:53:47Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T11:53:47Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(remote): U6 — filter preset catalog + StyleSelector + apply logic\n\napps/remote/src/filters.ts: 5 filter presets (art-piece, portrait,\nunits, asset, environment) with every dial value per origin''s table.\ndialsMatchPreset uses float-aware equality (saturation/tolerance via\n1e-3 epsilon, outlineColor element-wise per scope-guardian doc-review)\nso slider drag noise doesn''t produce false ''Custom (was: X)'' flips.\n\nStyleSelector: native <select> dropdown above ResolutionSlider per\nplan. Enabled regardless of image-load state (F3 pre-arm). ''Custom\n(was: X)'' indicator + ''Reset to X'' button surface only when value=\ncustom AND wasFilter is set. Indicator wrapped in role=status +\naria-live=polite so screen readers announce drift on dial change.\nforwardRef so PixelArtApp can focus the dropdown after Reset.\n\nPixelArtApp: applyFilter batches every dial setState (React 18 auto-\nbatches in event handlers — no flushSync per scope-guardian feedback).\nModified-state detection runs in a useEffect that compares current\ndial state against the active preset; first mismatch flips activeStyle\nto ''custom'' and stores wasFilter so the indicator can show ''(was: X)''.\nhandleResetFilter re-applies wasFilter and focuses the StyleSelector\nref so keyboard users stay oriented.\n\nTests: 8 filters catalog + dialsMatchPreset (epsilon, RGB, conditional\nfields) + 8 StyleSelector. 209 total.","tree":{"sha":"1e0b4a11110898954fdf9452d8d647f424ed683a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/1e0b4a11110898954fdf9452d8d647f424ed683a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/b64a52156ce5c487f1c2981fba5286b4b8f3bb1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/b64a52156ce5c487f1c2981fba