ze control + VALID_LONG_EDGES extension\n\nVALID_LONG_EDGES extended from v1''s 5 stops {16,32,64,128,256} to 8\nstops {16,32,48,64,96,128,192,256} per inline plan patch. Asset filter\nneeds 48 and Environment needs 192; original v1 stops preserved so\nthe v2-invariant test still passes byte-identically.\n\nPaletteSizeControl: dropdown with 8 discrete values\n{8,16,24,32,48,64,96,128}. Default 16 preserves v2.\n\nWorker: msg.paletteSize forwarded into quantizePalette options\n(quantize.ts already accepted the option from v2; this just plumbs\nthe user value through). Default ?? 16 keeps R12 invariant.\n\nTwo tests updated for the new VALID_LONG_EDGES — protocol.test\nasserts the new 8-stop list, ResolutionSlider.test uses index 5\n(was 3) for value 128.\n\nTests: 4 PaletteSizeControl. 186 total.","tree":{"sha":"996ce911037a7edd4c8e3c595363c20b328d3c6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/996ce911037a7edd4c8e3c595363c20b328d3c6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/1e96e9c5d79ef6152ebe290ada83fcfca2858682","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"h