xel-art/commits/34e643a1f562135686f03f8c7ed90c5759816518/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T01:29:08Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T01:29:08Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(remote): U4 — chunky pixel render (NxN block multiplication)\n\nchunky.ts: chunkify expands each pixel to an NxN block; output dims\ninflate by chunkSize. chunkSize=1 short-circuits to identity (R12).\nchunkSize > MAX_CHUNK_SIZE (4) clamps silently.\n\nWorker: chunkify is the final pipeline stage before postMessage so\nthe PNG export carries the chunky scaling at native resolution.\n\nChunkyPixelsControl: dropdown labels ''1× (default)'', ''2×'', ''3×'', ''4×''\nper design-lens doc-review (no-op state self-describing).\n\nWorker protocol: chunkSize field. Hook + PixelArtApp threading.\n\nTests: 7 chunky pure-function + 4 ChunkyPixelsControl. 182 total.","tree":{"sha":"9b4dcee4dd7026aad620e8ee8454198e97eb157b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/9b4dcee4dd7026aad620e8ee8454198e97eb157b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/34e643a1f562135686f03f8c7ed90c5759816518","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_eve