ns","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/7590681fc0f97cd0213bd7b79427937c6a3e9a98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T01:27:27Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T01:27:27Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(remote): U3 — silhouette transform (post-crop corner-sample)\n\nsilhouette.ts: sampleBackgroundColor (avg 4 corners), buildMask (binary\nalpha mask via squared-Euclidean threshold), downscaleMask (nearest-\nneighbor preserves binary semantics), applyMask (zero alpha at masked\npositions, RGB untouched).\n\nWorker: corner-sample on the CROPPED image (post-crop fix per inline\nplan patch — pre-crop sampling produced coordinate mismatches when\naspect ratio was active). Mask downscaled alongside image; applied\nafter quantize so the quantizer''s alpha=255 force is harmless.\n\nSilhouetteControl: toggle + tolerance slider 0-30, default 12. Helper\ncopy ''Works best on photos with a clean, uniform background'' surfaces\nthe v3 quality bar.\n\nWorker protocol: silhouetteEnabled + silhouetteTolerance fields.\n\nTests: 11 silhouette pure-function + 6 SilhouetteControl. 171 total.","tree":{"sha":"09fa8a21dfde1f40da774e9f4bea1ff3d6a8f582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/09fa8a21dfde1f40da774e9f4bea1ff3d6a8f582"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/7590681fc0f97cd0213bd7b79427937c6a3e9a98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonsteven