,"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/57ba7c2185c17961fced5d46415d1bdad69cb6d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:58:43Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:58:43Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"chore(deploy): root vercel.json — deploy the remote from the repo root\n\nSwitches the Vercel deploy posture from ''point Root Directory at\napps/remote'' to ''build from the repo root and tell Vercel where the\noutput lives''.\n\nRoot vercel.json now carries:\n- buildCommand: pnpm --filter @pixelart/remote build\n- installCommand: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile\n- outputDirectory: apps/remote/dist\n- framework: null  (skip auto-detect that was guessing ''Other''/public)\n- headers: same MF + asset CORS / cache rules that previously lived in\n  apps/remote/vercel.json (Vercel only reads vercel.json at the project\n  root, so they had to move).\n\napps/remote/vercel.json reverts to headers-only and stays in tree as a\nreference for the alternate ''set Root Directory in Vercel UI'' deploy\nposture — it has no effect from the current root-of-repo project root\nbut is harmless.","tree":{"sha":"bf539f4bd638fa0747bb4866a99e0613d149b3ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/bf539f4bd638fa0747bb4866a99e0613d149b3ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/