ens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/62890501d6ed4eda31a9a52b42740ae2c4113079/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:48:09Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:48:09Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(deploy): production deploy config + smoke test recipe\n\napps/remote ships header configs for the three common static hosts:\n- vercel.json (Vercel)\n- _headers (Netlify and Cloudflare Pages share this format)\n\nBoth set Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * on remoteEntry.js, the MF\nbootstrap chunk, the assets directory, and the auto-emitted @mf-types\nzip. Without ACAO the host gets a CORS block when it lazy-imports\nremote/PixelArtApp at runtime — and none of the three default-config\nthis for JS files.\n\ndocs/deploy.md is the operator-facing recipe:\n- pnpm build outputs and what each verify script asserts\n- Per-host deploy commands\n- Subpath hosting note (with the @module-federation/vite open issues\n  flagged so users know to vite preview --base before promoting)\n- Host portfolio wiring including the manual TS declare-module\n  fallback when auto type emission isn''t configured upstream\n- A 5-step post-deploy smoke test that goes from ''build artifact\n  exists'' through ''cross-origin curl returns ACAO'' to ''end-to-end PNG\n  export of a real photo works''\n\nREADME.md replaced with a v1-honest version: v1 scope, what''s deferred,\nthe dual-deploy layout of the repo, the dev workflow split (the\nremote can''t run vite dev under @module-federation/vite, so harness is\nthe dev surface).","tree":{"sha":"b591b69dd9cae0a6e03dd3035c92d603e07d9ef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/b591b69dd9cae0a6e03dd3035c92d603e07d9ef1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/62890501d6ed4eda31a9a52b42740ae2c4113079","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/62890501d6ed4eda31a9a52b42740ae2c4113079","node_id":"C_kwDOSV4urtoAKDYyODkwNTAxZDZlZDRlZGEzMWE5YTUyYjQyNzQwYWUyYzQxMTMwNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/50f1a0c3c017af2bd7e1700ccdc9b10c2f5b1c45","sha":"50f1a0c3c017af2bd7e1700ccdc9b10c2f5b1c45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/50f1a0c3c017af2bd7e1700ccdc9b10c2f5b1c45"}],"sha":"62890501d6ed4eda31a9a52b42740ae2c4113079","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/62890501d6ed4eda31a9a52b42740ae2c4113079"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/50f1a0c3c017af2bd7e1700ccdc9b10c2f5b1c45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:46:15Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:46:15Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(remote): lifecycle hardening — AE4 spy coverage + harness MF-runtime guard\n\nAdds spy-based test coverage for AE4 (no resources retained from prior\nmounts) on the PixelArtApp side. The hook tests already covered worker\ntermination + bitmap close on the pipeline side; this fills in the\ncomponent side: object URLs revoked on every file replacement, on\nevery unmount, and across three mount/unmount cycles.\n\nTest approach uses jsdom with createImageBitmap stubbed to a fake\nclosable bitmap and URL.createObjectURL/revokeObjectURL spies. Per\nfeasibility doc-review feedback (WeakRef-based GC tests are unreliable\nin Node/Vitest), spy assertions are the deterministic primary check;\nreal memory-profile verification stays a manual smoke step.\n\nAlso adds apps/harness/scripts/verify-build.sh, parallel to the\nremote''s verify script, asserting the harness bundle does not contain\n__mfe_internal__ or __federation__ artifacts. The harness must NEVER\nload the same exposed module via federation (host loads it federated;\nharness loads it via workspace alias) — two MF runtimes in one app\nwould create dueling React copies. The check fills the System-Wide\nImpact line that previously had no owning unit.","tree":{"sha":"7d5c6ebbae6cc6d3185efd1ef5e46e1a1df21ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/7d5c6ebbae6cc6d3185efd1ef5e46e1a1df21ac6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/50f1a0c3c017af2bd7e1700ccdc9b10c2f5b1c45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/50f1a0c3c017af2bd7e1700ccdc9b10c2f5b1c45","node_id":"C_kwDOSV4urtoAKDUwZjFhMGMzYzAxN2FmMmJkN2UxNzAwY2NkYzliMTBjMmY1YjFjNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/3680e11fce6470828b2306391a4c6a621aa2a02e","sha":"3680e11fce6470828b2306391a4c6a621aa2a02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/3680e11fce6470828b2306391a4c6a621aa2a02e"}],"sha":"50f1a0c3c017af2bd7e1700ccdc9b10c2f5b1c45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/50f1a0c3c017af2bd7e1700ccdc9b10c2f5b1c45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/3680e11fce6470828b2306391a4c6a621aa2a02e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:43:57Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:43:57Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(remote): PNG export at native resolution\n\napps/remote/src/pipeline/exportPng.ts implements the v1 export flow:\n\n  bufferToPngBlob — render the result ImageData onto an OffscreenCanvas\n  at exact native pixel size (no upscale, no smoothing) and convertToBlob\n  with type ''image/png''. Per AE2: a 64-long-edge landscape input produces\n  a PNG that is exactly 64x48 with the source aspect ratio preserved.\n\n  pngFilename — ''pixel-art-WxH.png'' so the saved file carries its actual\n  output dimensions in the name.\n\n  triggerDownload — anchor + click + revokeObjectURL on the next\n  microtask, no leak of the object URL across exports.\n\nPixelArtApp adds a Download PNG button below the side-by-side preview.\nDisabled until status is ''ready'' and a result exists; label shows the\noutput dimensions inline so the user sees what they''re about to save.\n\nTests: pngFilename naming (covers AE2 explicitly) and triggerDownload''s\nURL.createObjectURL / revokeObjectURL contract via spies. URL methods are\nstubbed in vitest.setup.ts before spying since jsdom 25 doesn''t expose\nthem by default. Real canvas-encoded PNG bytes get verified later via\nmanual smoke test or browser-mode tests.","tree":{"sha":"b5d67a1cd4ec592dd3ab7e1c293f89210521edb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/b5d67a1cd4ec592dd3ab7e1c293f89210521edb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/3680e11fce6470828b2306391a4c6a621aa2a02e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/3680e11fce6470828b2306391a4c6a621aa2a02e","node_id":"C_kwDOSV4urtoAKDM2ODBlMTFmY2U2NDcwODI4YjIzMDYzOTFhNGM2YTYyMWFhMmEwMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/9b9bee326cbaa6e143866b9c3800e07a3249de78","sha":"9b9bee326cbaa6e143866b9c3800e07a3249de78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/9b9bee326cbaa6e143866b9c3800e07a3249de78"}],"sha":"3680e11fce6470828b2306391a4c6a621aa2a02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/3680e11fce6470828b2306391a4c6a621aa2a02e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/9b9bee326cbaa6e143866b9c3800e07a3249de78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:41:45Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:41:45Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(remote): integrate drop zone, resolution slider, and side-by-side preview\n\nPixelArtApp now ships the full v1 UX. Three components live under\napps/remote/src/components/ rather than packages/ui (per scope-guardian\ndoc-review feedback — three primitives with one consumer don''t justify\na separate package boundary).\n\nDropZone: explicit state machine (idle / drag-over / drag-invalid /\nerror), ARIA role=button + tabIndex=0 + Enter/Space activation, inline\nerror with dismiss button for non-image drops. Stops the input''s click\nevent from bubbling to the parent div so programmatic input.click()\nfrom keyboard activation doesn''t double-trigger the picker.\n\nResolutionSlider: native <input type=range> mapped over the 5 v1 stops\n(16/32/64/128/256). Native handles Home/End and PgUp/PgDn — no custom\nkey handler. ARIA value text reflects the underlying px stop, not the\ninternal index.\n\nSideBySidePreview: two-pane layout that stacks vertically below md.\nResult canvas is rendered at native pixel size with image-rendering:\npixelated and CSS-scales up via object-contain. Status drives the\nresult pane''s visual treatment — processing dims any prior result,\nerror shows a ''Drop a different image'' CTA, idle shows a waiting\nplaceholder.\n\nPixelArtApp glues drop -> createImageBitmap -> usePixelArtPipeline ->\nresult canvas. Object-URL lifecycle (mint on file change, revoke on\nreplacement / unmount). Live-region announcements for screen readers\non every status transition. Source ImageBitmap is cloned before\ntransfer to the worker so the retained reference stays valid for the\nnext slider change without re-decoding from the File.\n\nTests: DropZone covers drop / picker / invalid file / dismiss /\nkeyboard / disabled (6 tests). ResolutionSlider covers value display /\nemit / ARIA / disabled (4 tests). 36 tests passing total. Worker is\npolyfilled in vitest.setup.ts as a no-op stub so harness integration\ntests can mount PixelArtApp without an actual worker runtime — real\nworker behavior moves to browser-mode tests later.","tree":{"sha":"2d986ce164fd7492a0ff7ce60e5d952bc6975c87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/2d986ce164fd7492a0ff7ce60e5d952bc6975c87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/9b9bee326cbaa6e143866b9c3800e07a3249de78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/9b9bee326cbaa6e143866b9c3800e07a3249de78","node_id":"C_kwDOSV4urtoAKDliOWJlZTMyNmNiYWE2ZTE0Mzg2NmI5YzM4MDBlMDdhMzI0OWRlNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/3b3fcfd224f36fa707a0548de5f7308982335bec","sha":"3b3fcfd224f36fa707a0548de5f7308982335bec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/3b3fcfd224f36fa707a0548de5f7308982335bec"}],"sha":"9b9bee326cbaa6e143866b9c3800e07a3249de78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/9b9bee326cbaa6e143866b9c3800e07a3249de78"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/3b3fcfd224f36fa707a0548de5f7308982335bec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:37:48Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:37:48Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(remote): area-average downscale + image-q Wu quantization in worker\n\nReplaces U3''s identity transform with the real conversion pipeline:\n\n  bitmap -> composite onto neutral-900 -> ImageData (opaque)\n         -> areaAverageDownscale(target dims)\n         -> quantizePalette(16 colors, Wu)\n         -> postMessage with transferred buffer\n\nAlpha is normalized once at the composite step (per feasibility doc-\nreview feedback). Origin spec is fully-opaque v1 output, so semi-\ntransparent edges in PNG/SVG sources flatten to neutral-900 (matches\nthe host''s chrome) before any downstream stage sees them. Quantize and\ndownscale both assert opaque output as a defense-in-depth.\n\ndownscale.ts is a hand-rolled box filter — pure function on ImageData,\ntestable in jsdom without the canvas native package. Skipped Canvas API\n+ imageSmoothingQuality:''high'' because that path requires Playwright\njust to unit-test, and the JS box filter is fast enough at v1 sizes\n(target <= 256x256, source <= 4000x3000 = ~12M pixel reads, tens of ms).\n\nquantize.ts wraps image-q''s Wu quantizer at a fixed 16-color palette\ndefault; quantize runs after downscale so the input is at most\n256x256, which keeps quantization in the millisecond range.\n\nTests: 12 new (7 downscale + 5 quantize), 26 total now passing.\nImageData polyfill in vitest.setup.ts keeps tests in jsdom — minimal\nshim covering only the typed-array container shape, since canvas behavior\nitself moves to browser-mode Playwright tests later.","tree":{"sha":"9a2eddc564b1c5923e3f18672187f92ec81d1078","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/9a2eddc564b1c5923e3f18672187f92ec81d1078"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/3b3fcfd224f36fa707a0548de5f7308982335bec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/3b3fcfd224f36fa707a0548de5f7308982335bec","node_id":"C_kwDOSV4urtoAKDNiM2ZjZmQyMjRmMzZmYTcwN2EwNTQ4ZGU1ZjczMDg5ODIzMzViZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commit/abf0beaebf89520323114ed766572caa9f3f48d2","sha":"abf0beaebf89520323114ed766572caa9f3f48d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/abf0beaebf89520323114ed766572caa9f3f48d2"}],"sha":"3b3fcfd224f36fa707a0548de5f7308982335bec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/3b3fcfd224f36fa707a0548de5f7308982335bec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/masonstevens95","id":36343085,"login":"masonstevens95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQzMDg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/commits/abf0beaebf89520323114ed766572caa9f3f48d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:34:45Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:34:45Z","email":"mason.c.stevens@gmail.com","name":"masonstevens95"},"message":"feat(remote): worker pipeline skeleton with debounced jobId-based dispatch\n\napps/remote/src/pipeline/protocol.ts defines the wire protocol between\nPixelArtApp and the pixel-art worker — three message types only\n(ProcessRequest, ProcessResult, WorkerErrorMessage). No AbortRequest:\ncancellation works by jobId discard at the receive side, which the\ndebounce + monotonic id pattern handles without a bidirectional abort\nhandshake.\n\napps/remote/src/pipeline/pixelArtWorker.ts ships an identity transform\nfor U3 — render the source ImageBitmap to an OffscreenCanvas at the\ntarget long-edge dimension and round-trip the pixel buffer back via a\ntransferable. U4 will swap the single drawImage() for area-average\ndownscale + image-q Wu quantization without touching the protocol.\n\napps/remote/src/hooks/usePixelArtPipeline.ts owns the worker, debounces\nslider input (~16ms), increments jobId monotonically, and discards any\nresult whose jobId is below the latest dispatched. Cleanup on unmount\nterminates the worker, clears the pending timer, and closes any queued\nImageBitmap that was about to be transferred. Workers are injected via\nworkerFactory option so tests can pass a hand-rolled MockWorker.\n\nTests: 11 across protocol type guards (jsdom) and hook contract\n(debounce collapse, jobId monotonicity, stale-result discard, invalid-\ninput rejection, error surfacing, unmount cleanup, queued-bitmap close\non replacement). Real-worker behavior with OffscreenCanvas comes when a\n*.browser.test.ts lands in U4.","tree":{"sha":"0ed88a43e078f59556e625899c01b53e16fb89f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/trees/0ed88a43e078f59556e625899c01b53e16fb89f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/masonstevens95/picture-to-pixel-art/git/commits/abf0beaebf89520323114ed766572caa9f3f48d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36343085?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masonstevens95/followers","following_url":"ht