beach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach","id":56612434,"login":"mollybeach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjEyNDM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commits/a67e366fbca04b2ce59c7f1581b240e9b7d5edb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T18:23:48Z","email":"mollyjbeach@gmail.com","name":"Molly Beach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T18:23:48Z","email":"mollyjbeach@gmail.com","name":"Molly Beach"},"message":"feat: extend basic-storage types and align full-stack POC UI\n\nExtend the Soroban `basic-storage` contract with additional persisted types and\nevents (flag, i64, capped blob, u128, Symbol, optional Address pointer, i128),\nbounded blob storage, and matching getters/setters plus contract events.\nExpand unit and integration tests and update the storage fuzz target and large\nset of checked-in fuzz JSON fixtures under `contracts/basic-storage/test/`.\n\nRefresh the Next.js POC: shared slot palettes for Get/Writes, compact write\nforms, docs and in-app tests surfaces, Stellar client helpers for the new\nentrypoints, layout/shell/header polish, and exported `test-results.json`.\nImprove UX on the main page with transaction log autoscroll, a write-in-flight\noverlay, per-slot “updated” motion on the matching Get tile after a successful\nwrite, and horizontally scrollable Get value cells so long pointers and wide\nintegers stay inside the card. Add global CSS for the Get-tile cue animation.","tree":{"