lets\n\nAdd WalletConnectModalTabs: a client overlay that switches Reown’s RouterController\nbetween AllWallets (search grid) and ConnectingWalletConnectBasic (QR + copy link).\nPosition the pill with fixed coordinates derived from w3m-modal’s shadow DOM\n(w3m-header / wui-card) so it sits on the modal stack just above the “All Wallets”\nheader instead of the top of the viewport; keep ResizeObserver, scroll, and a\nshort post-open poll so layout tracks animations.\n\nDefault the connect flow to the wallet grid by resetting the router to\nAllWallets immediately after modal.open. Mount the chrome from AppShell next to\nthe existing shell.","tree":{"sha":"27faaa553d38b2f93562b0a4540bfbd9beb439d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/git/trees/27faaa553d38b2f93562b0a4540bfbd9beb439d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/git/commits/a187cd29985723a1e387d9d8854e703d1c1c3856","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56612434?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach","id":56612434,"login":"mollybeach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjEyNDM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commit/a187cd29985723a1e387d9d8854e703d1c1c3856","node_id":"C_kwDOSWDDx9oAKGExODdjZDI5OTg1NzIzYTFlMzg3ZDlkODg1NGU3MDNkMWMxYzM4NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commit/2b2c424cb2c916d4c9c855ef9b667b3d56119f54","sha":"2b2c424cb2c916d4c9c855ef9b667b3d56119f54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commits/2b2c424cb2c916d4c9c855ef9b667b3d56119f54"}],"sha":"a187cd29985723a1e387d9d8854e703d1c1c3856","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commits/a187cd29985723a1e387d9d8854e703d1c1c3856"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56612434?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach","id":56612434,"login":"mollybeach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjEyNDM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commits/2b2c424cb2c916d4c9c855ef9b667b3d56119f54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T16:09:53Z","email":"mollyjbeach@gmail.com","name":"Molly Beach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T16:09:53Z","email":"mollyjbeach@gmail.com","name":"Molly Beach"},"message":"fix(frontend): stabilize WalletConnect for Stellar testnet and Reown modal\n\nRegister Stellar testnet and pubnet (plus Ethereum mainnet) in createAppKit so\nReown and the Explorer use the right CAIP chain filters, while provider.connect\nstill requests only stellar:testnet for the session.\n\nBridge the Universal Provider pairing URI into AppKit (display_uri listener plus\nshort polling of provider.uri) so the QR and copy-link work with manualWCControl.\n\nOpen the modal with a temporary CoreHelperUtil.isMobile override on viewports\nat least 768px wide so touch desktops see ConnectingWalletConnectBasic instead\nof an empty AllWallets flow.\n\nStop passing includeWalletIds so the wallet catalog is not over-filtered to\nzero rows for Stellar chains; keep featuredWalletIds for pinned wallets.","tree":{"sha":"385dea03635712a28a5f2389336acfb2a06e2564","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/git/trees/385dea03635712a28a5f2389336acfb2a06e2564"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/git/commits/2b2c424cb2c916d4c9c855ef9b667b3d56119f54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56612434?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach","id":56612434,"login":"mollybeach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjEyNDM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commit/2b2c424cb2c916d4c9c855ef9b667b3d56119f54","node_id":"C_kwDOSWDDx9oAKDJiMmM0MjRjYjJjOTE2ZDRjOWM4NTVlZjliNjY3YjNkNTYxMTlmNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commit/83e143bfe76f3cd03ba93fa0facb7f4259b61c27","sha":"83e143bfe76f3cd03ba93fa0facb7f4259b61c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commits/83e143bfe76f3cd03ba93fa0facb7f4259b61c27"}],"sha":"2b2c424cb2c916d4c9c855ef9b667b3d56119f54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commits/2b2c424cb2c916d4c9c855ef9b667b3d56119f54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56612434?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach","id":56612434,"login":"mollybeach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjEyNDM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/commits/83e143bfe76f3cd03ba93fa0facb7f4259b61c27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T14:12:52Z","email":"mollyjbeach@gmail.com","name":"Molly Beach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T14:12:52Z","email":"mollyjbeach@gmail.com","name":"Molly Beach"},"message":"feat(frontend): multi-wallet with WalletConnect and Freighter on testnet\n\nReplace the Freighter-only provider with WalletProvider: browser extension via `@stellar/freighter-api`, plus WalletConnect using `@walletconnect/universal-provider` and `@reown/appkit` (`stellar:testnet`, `stellar_signXDR`, normalized signed XDR for the Soroban contract client). Refactor `lib/stellar.ts` write helpers to take a `SorobanTransactionSigner` from context. Add header connect menu (Freighter vs WalletConnect), home CTAs when disconnected, optional WC session restore, and `npm overrides` so AppKit and the app share one `@walletconnect/*` tree. Document `NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID` in `frontend/.env.example`, README, and `/docs`; transpile WC packages in `next.config.ts`. Export `useFreighter` as a deprecated alias of `useWallet` for callers that have not migrated yet.","tree":{"sha":"51ff153e4491821e5af5062d8a9244e969b338e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/git/trees/51ff153e4491821e5af5062d8a9244e969b338e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mollybeach/soroban-fullstack-poc/git/commits/83e143bfe76f3cd03ba93fa0facb7f4259b61c27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56612434?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mollybeach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mollybeach","id":56612434,"login":"mollybeach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjEyNDM0","organizations_url":"