c","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/134dafb7ba4a9a328a8f618eb9df5cea2894213a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T11:02:30Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T11:02:30Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"shop: drop host-side remote-components proxy\n\nRemove the proxy.ts middleware and routeThroughHostProxy plumbing from\neach host zone. The proxy was only buying us correct rendering on\npreview deploys where each shop project is independently protected and\nthe browser can''t satisfy cross-origin asset fetches. In practice\npreviews go through the Vercel toolbar / share links, which already set\nthe necessary bypass cookies, and production has no protection to\nsatisfy at all — so the proxy was adding a function hop and a\nmaintenance surface without paying for itself.\n\n- Delete apps/shop/{shell,home,beds,pdp,sale,checkout}/proxy.ts\n- Drop the routeThroughHostProxy import and resolveClientUrl prop from\n  each zone''s Providers; the RemoteComponentsClientProvider falls back\n  to its default direct-fetch behaviour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e64c55b8f3ce468cfcf571522ec4b910c21169f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/6e64c55b8f3ce468cfcf571522ec4b910c21169f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/134dafb7ba4a9a328a8f618eb9df5cea2894213a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e64c55b8f3ce468cfcf571522ec4b910c21169f\nparent 6703e70eba6287df9b0e947da03dffcd1c2ccd93\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778497350 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778497350 +0100\n\nshop: drop host-side remote-components proxy\n\nRemove the proxy.ts middleware and routeThroughHostProxy plumbing from\neach host zone. The proxy was only buying us correct rendering on\npreview deploys where each shop project is independently protected and\nthe browser can''t satisfy cross-origin asset fetches. In practice\npreviews go through the Vercel toolbar / share links, which already set\nthe necessary bypass cookies, and production has no protection to\nsatisfy at all — so the proxy was adding a function hop and a\nmaintenance surface without paying for itself.\n\n- Delete apps/shop/{shell,home,beds,pdp,sale,checkout}/proxy.ts\n- Drop the routeThroughHostProxy import and resolveClientUrl prop from\n  each zone''s Providers; the RemoteComponentsClientProvider falls back\n  to its default direct-fetch behaviour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGM44FYSfcolHV2A4IVu8xfCSNjeIwwZheiqK5tlQtVlGgCDe/0FrwOOl1nQ9P5rFb\nreD8CPDkogQMrb3U/XLQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-11T11:02:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user