ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778486068 +0100\n\nprogessively uncomment out till it breaks\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJVVtrJ4II3ELIQ0DyqsUdA3kS7N6AWM95YOjshZmj9QB3sWTN0dtPXrgbipldt+bn\n3FcSE1EOdO1XStTL35CQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-11T07:54:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/1fd790186abfc78af33993c1e7556cc7d06ffb4c","node_id":"C_kwDOSWDkl9oAKDFmZDc5MDE4NmFiZmM3OGFmMzM5OTNjMWU3NTU2Y2M3ZDA2ZmZiNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/2ae189b6612063fdb56cf46b582a6dec4bfa82ab","sha":"2ae189b6612063fdb56cf46b582a6dec4bfa82ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/2ae189b6612063fdb56cf46b582a6dec4bfa82ab"}],"sha":"1fd790186abfc78af33993c1e7556cc7d06ffb4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/1fd790186abfc78af33993c1e7556cc7d06ffb4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/2ae189b6612063fdb56cf46b582a6dec4bfa82ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:50:34Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T07:50:34Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"shop: route remote-component assets through host on preview deploys\n\nVercel preview deployments protect each shop project independently, which\nblocks the cross-origin asset fetches the browser would otherwise make to\nshop-header.vercel.app, shop-footer.vercel.app, etc. when consuming a\nremote component. Use remote-components'' built-in host-proxy mode so the\nshell (and every other consumer zone) proxies those asset requests\nserver-side, attaching VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET to satisfy the\nremote zone''s protection.\n\nEach host zone (shell, home, beds, pdp, sale, checkout) now exposes a\nproxy.ts that runs withConsumeRemoteComponentsProxy on the magic\n/rc-fetch-protected-remote path. Allowed targets are constrained to the\nshop''s vercel.app deployments via the allowedProxyUrls regex.\n\nClient-side, RemoteComponentsClientProvider gets resolveClientUrl set to\nrouteThroughHostProxy only when NEXT_PUBLIC_VERCEL_ENV === ''preview''.\nThat keeps production fast (assets load directly from each zone''s CDN\nedge, full caching, no extra function hop) and local dev unaffected\n(requests are already same-origin via the local microfrontends proxy).\n\nRequires: set VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET on all 8 shop Vercel\nprojects to a shared automation-bypass secret.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3e61e30019cdfbdfbb3416c3ba8bcb80fdfe277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/a3e61e30019cdfbdfbb3416c3ba8bcb80fdfe277"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/2ae189b6612063fdb56cf46b582a6dec4bfa82ab","verification":{"payload":"tree a3e61e30019cdfbdfbb3416c3ba8bcb80fdfe277\nparent 4bdeb4aeb4545da2e08e259f7de35176c3c186c3\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778485834 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778485834 +0100\n\nshop: route remote-component assets through host on preview deploys\n\nVercel preview deployments protect each shop project independently, which\nblocks the cross-origin asset fetches the browser would otherwise make to\nshop-header.vercel.app, shop-footer.vercel.app, etc. when consuming a\nremote component. Use remote-components'' built-in host-proxy mode so the\nshell (and every other consumer zone) proxies those asset requests\nserver-side, attaching VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET to satisfy the\nremote zone''s protection.\n\nEach host zone (shell, home, beds, pdp, sale, checkout) now exposes a\nproxy.ts that runs withConsumeRemoteComponentsProxy on the magic\n/rc-fetch-protected-remote path. Allowed targets are constrained to the\nshop''s vercel.app deployments via the allowedProxyUrls regex.\n\nClient-side, RemoteComponentsClientProvider gets resolveClientUrl set to\nrouteThroughHostProxy only when NEXT_PUBLIC_VERCEL_ENV === ''preview''.\nThat keeps production fast (assets load directly from each zone''s CDN\nedge, full caching, no extra function hop) and local dev unaffected\n(requests are already same-origin via the local microfrontends proxy).\n\nRequires: set VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET on all 8 shop Vercel\nprojects to a shared automation-bypass secret.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDC9wGqfhvJgIYEIhRml1ghzjjyq1dUTbNlGAY7RXttUegCDzsQvJcGiR3LrbOFDVU\n01ed8JWggwEYm1kDmufAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-11T07:50:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/2ae189b6612063fdb56cf46b582a6dec4bfa82ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSWDkl9oAKDJhZTE4OWI2NjEyMDYzZmRiNTZjZjQ2YjU4MmE2ZGVjNGJmYTgyYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/4bdeb4aeb4545da2e08e259f7de35176c3c186c3","sha":"4bdeb4aeb4545da2e08e259f7de35176c3c186c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/4bdeb4aeb4545da2e08e259f7de35176c3c186c3"}],"sha":"2ae189b6612063fdb56cf46b582a6dec4bfa82ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/2ae189b6612063fdb56cf46b582a6dec4bfa82ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/4bdeb4aeb4545da2e08e259f7de35176c3c186c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T17:25:03Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T17:25:03Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"shop: register react/next as host shared modules in providers\n\nExplicitly list react, react/jsx-runtime, react-dom, next/link,\nnext/navigation, next/script and next/form in the shared map of every\nshop host''s RemoteComponentsClientProvider. The provider already\nauto-imports these from a virtual app-host.tsx file generated by\nwithRemoteComponentsConfig, but that auto-import only resolves when\nprocess.env.TURBOPACK is set at build time (the plugin gates the\nturbopack resolveAlias on that env). When TURBOPACK is unset, the\nauto-import returns {} and the only host shared modules registered are\nwhatever the user passes in here -- previously just @shop/ui and\n@vercel/microfrontends/next/client. That left every remote loading its\nown copy of React, breaking useContext lookups across the bundle\nboundary.\n\nListing the modules here makes the host''s shared map self-sufficient,\nso dedupe works regardless of whether the build-time alias is set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6e24e8f170e50b8d4121c14080e24e685256600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/c6e24e8f170e50b8d4121c14080e24e685256600"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/4bdeb4aeb4545da2e08e259f7de35176c3c186c3","verification":{"payload":"tree c6e24e8f170e50b8d4121c14080e24e685256600\nparent 03f546fc2156037c0564116ef9d313e45b5e82a9\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778261103 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778261103 +0100\n\nshop: register react/next as host shared modules in providers\n\nExplicitly list react, react/jsx-runtime, react-dom, next/link,\nnext/navigation, next/script and next/form in the shared map of every\nshop host''s RemoteComponentsClientProvider. The provider already\nauto-imports these from a virtual app-host.tsx file generated by\nwithRemoteComponentsConfig, but that auto-import only resolves when\nprocess.env.TURBOPACK is set at build time (the plugin gates the\nturbopack resolveAlias on that env). When TURBOPACK is unset, the\nauto-import returns {} and the only host shared modules registered are\nwhatever the user passes in here -- previously just @shop/ui and\n@vercel/microfrontends/next/client. That left every remote loading its\nown copy of React, breaking useContext lookups across the bundle\nboundary.\n\nListing the modules here makes the host''s shared map self-sufficient,\nso dedupe works regardless of whether the build-time alias is set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLNQLR0JPNEDperVuLsNtr8vW/2LBXCn/j5hgkwYOMs/EgHm/vqPvzjoTC1Eb5TxBN\nRe9D7INUXn/5DvHoGTzQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-08T17:25:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/4bdeb4aeb4545da2e08e259f7de35176c3c186c3","node_id":"C_kwDOSWDkl9oAKDRiZGViNGFlYjQ1NDVkYTJlMDhlMjU5ZjdkZTM1MTc2YzNjMTg2YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/03f546fc2156037c0564116ef9d313e45b5e82a9","sha":"03f546fc2156037c0564116ef9d313e45b5e82a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/03f546fc2156037c0564116ef9d313e45b5e82a9"}],"sha":"4bdeb4aeb4545da2e08e259f7de35176c3c186c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/4bdeb4aeb4545da2e08e259f7de35176c3c186c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/03f546fc2156037c0564116ef9d313e45b5e82a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T17:17:45Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T17:17:45Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"shop: align package versions with pandora reference\n\n- Bump react/react-dom from ^19.2.0 to ^19.2.5 across all shop apps and the\n  @shop/ui peer range, matching pandora''s pin and ensuring consistent\n  dedupe targets across cross-deploy remotes.\n- Bump remote-components from a pinned 0.4.1 (resolved via a private\n  microfrontends-vtest314 preview URL) to ^0.4.2, which now resolves to\n  the public 0.4.3 release. Drops the private preview-URL resolutions\n  from the lockfile.\n- Bring devDeps in line with pandora: @types/node ^22.19.17, @types/react\n  ^19.2.14, @types/react-dom ^19.2.3, typescript ^5.9.3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42e46d9ae5de7f367e103126ec9d867063df608b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/42e46d9ae5de7f367e103126ec9d867063df608b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/03f546fc2156037c0564116ef9d313e45b5e82a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 42e46d9ae5de7f367e103126ec9d867063df608b\nparent 829a011ab99a0f7550774fa27ede3dbf5fa222ce\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778260665 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778260665 +0100\n\nshop: align package versions with pandora reference\n\n- Bump react/react-dom from ^19.2.0 to ^19.2.5 across all shop apps and the\n  @shop/ui peer range, matching pandora''s pin and ensuring consistent\n  dedupe targets across cross-deploy remotes.\n- Bump remote-components from a pinned 0.4.1 (resolved via a private\n  microfrontends-vtest314 preview URL) to ^0.4.2, which now resolves to\n  the public 0.4.3 release. Drops the private preview-URL resolutions\n  from the lockfile.\n- Bring devDeps in line with pandora: @types/node ^22.19.17, @types/react\n  ^19.2.14, @types/react-dom ^19.2.3, typescript ^5.9.3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN