users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/9d4de0e36370faa8b009c96eb1972a3f5cd89722/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T16:16:45Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T16:16:45Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"shop: extract products to api-client and wire end-to-end cart\n\n- Move MOCK_PRODUCTS into @shop/api-client as the single source of truth\n  and have the shell''s /api/products and /api/products/[id] routes import\n  from it instead of duplicating the catalogue inline.\n- Add cart-cookie helpers to @shop/api-client: writeCartCookieFromDocument,\n  getCartItems (read cookie + hydrate via /api/products), and setCartItems.\n- PDP \"Add to Bag\" now persists via addToCartEntry + writeCartCookieFromDocument\n  and notifies the header badge through the pandora:cart-updated event.\n- Header: add a real bag icon link wrapping CartBadge so the absolutely-\n  positioned counter has a positioned ancestor and a clickable target.\n- Checkout: drop the stale localStorage(''shop:cart'') clear, clear the cart\n  cookie on order placement, and persist +/- quantity and remove actions\n  through setCartItems (kills the dual-state-of-truth bug).\n- Revert the shop-home debug commit that pointed at pandora-shell''s\n  remotely-hosted header.\n- Drop a leftover [rc-debug] console.log from header/next.config.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4109d413effb1de55f4b0c8292ab65ac0d9f9f5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/4109d413effb1de55f4b0c8292ab65ac0d9f9f5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/9d4de0e36370faa8b009c96eb1972a3f5cd89722","verification":{"payload":"tree 4109d413effb1de55f4b0c8292ab65ac0d9f9f5c\nparent 05e4b515dbd554b1ba61dfb9d84b40b749aff070\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778257005 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778257005 +0100\n\nshop: extract products to api-client and wire end-to-end cart\n\n- Move MOCK_PRODUCTS into @shop/api-client as the single source of truth\n  and have the shell''s /api/products and /api/products/[id] routes import\n  from it instead of duplicating the catalogue inline.\n- Add cart-cookie helpers to @shop/api-client: writeCartCookieFromDocument,\n  getCartItems (read cookie + hydrate via /api/products), and setCartItems.\n- PDP \"Add to Bag\" now persists via addToCartEntry + writeCartCookieFromDocument\n  and notifies the header badge through the pandora:cart-updated event.\n- Header: add a real bag icon link wrapping CartBadge so the absolutely-\n  positioned counter has a positioned ancestor and a clickable target.\n- Checkout: drop the stale localStorage(''shop:cart'') clear, clear the cart\n  cookie on order placement, and persist +/- quantity and remove actions\n  through setCartItems (kills the dual-state-of-truth bug).\n- Revert the shop-home debug commit that pointed at pandora-shell''s\n  remotely-hosted header.\n- Drop a leftover [rc-debug] console.log from header/next.config.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQK9r+b7EIQyqq+r9S5x743CPXwPow0buzsEStgswgn/UmvVK3Auc2hou/Z8EQu5DuA\nflsT67jbj7gbJ5pviTzAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-08T16:16:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/9d4de0e36370faa8b009c96eb1972a3f5cd89722","node_id":"C_kwDOSWDkl9oAKDlkNGRlMGUzNjM3MGZhYThiMDA5Yzk2ZWIxOTcyYTNmNWNkODk3MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/05e4b515dbd554b1ba61dfb9d84b40b749aff070","sha":"05e4b515dbd554b1ba61dfb9d84b40b749aff070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/05e4b515dbd554b1ba61dfb9d84b40b749aff070"}],"sha":"9d4de0e36370faa8b009c96eb1972a3f5cd89722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab