ttps://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/97df35f109a41b11f18cb564ea406715b95e9fad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T17:12:25Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T17:12:25Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"Add TURBOPACK to turbo''s env passthrough/cache list\n\nThe shell-prefix form `TURBOPACK=1 next build` in package.json scripts\ndoesn''t reliably propagate through Vercel''s build runner, so the env\nvar is now also set as a Vercel project env var. Declare it in turbo.json''s\nbuild.env so cache keys reflect it and globalPassThroughEnv so it reaches\nthe task process.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5bfbf2ff9682cfbe9467f28b5fa15a31b280377a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/5bfbf2ff9682cfbe9467f28b5fa15a31b280377a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/97df35f109a41b11f18cb564ea406715b95e9fad","verification":{"payload":"tree 5bfbf2ff9682cfbe9467f28b5fa15a31b280377a\nparent 2112d09e35b70f686e1fa5180e7960995ea107f8\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778173945 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778173945 +0100\n\nAdd TURBOPACK to turbo''s env passthrough/cache list\n\nThe shell-prefix form `TURBOPACK=1 next build` in package.json scripts\ndoesn''t reliably propagate through Vercel''s build runner, so the env\nvar is now also set as a Vercel project env var. Declare it in turbo.json''s\nbuild.env so cache keys reflect it and globalPassThroughEnv so it reaches\nthe task process.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMcRdbPiXmQBNEjnoCEy+0V1/0lg1iAqY39zJauZkn72CSpnhdBnkQyUhuv927+dum\nhU6PO7QtVZPawAnQUEXAs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-07T17:12:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/97df35f109a41b11f18cb564ea406715b95e9fad","node_id":"C_kwDOSWDkl9oAKDk3ZGYzNWYxMDlhNDFiMTFmMThjYjU2NGVhNDA2NzE1Yjk1ZTlmYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/2112d09e35b70f686e1fa5180e7960995ea107f8","sha":"2112d09e35b70f686e1fa5180e7960995ea107f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/2112d09e35b70f686e1fa5180e7960995ea107f8"}],"sha":"97df35f109a41b11f18cb564ea406715b95e9fad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/97df35f109a41b11f18cb564ea406715b95e9fad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/2112d09e35b70f686e1fa5180e7960995ea107f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T17:04:51Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T17:04:51Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"Bump remote-components to 0.4.3 and set TURBOPACK=1 for prod builds\n\nremote-components/dist/config/nextjs.js gates its Turbopack code path\non process.env.TURBOPACK. next dev --turbo propagates that env var,\nbut next build (which uses Turbopack as the bundler in Next 16) never\nsets it. Without it, the config falls through to the webpack branch,\nthe #remote-components/remote/defaults/app alias is never registered,\nthe dynamic import in app-client.js fails inside its try/catch, and\nno TURBOPACK_REMOTE_SHARED marker ends up in the remote bundle. The\nhost then can''t dedupe shared modules, so the remote ships its own\ncopy of React and useContext crashes the page.\n\nSet TURBOPACK=1 in each shop app''s build script so the marker is\nemitted. Also bump to 0.4.3 (latest) — only chunk hashes changed,\nbut worth staying current.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b80647e45b40a43a15c8c35e9de39f44996d2550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/b80647e45b40a43a15c8c35e9de39f44996d2550"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/2112d09e35b70f686e1fa5180e7960995ea107f8","verification":{"payload":"tree b80647e45b40a43a15c8c35e9de39f44996d2550\nparent a692eb8c9e8c894b12c973f177db732349c0f79d\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778173491 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778173491 +0100\n\nBump remote-components to 0.4.3 and set TURBOPACK=1 for prod builds\n\nremote-components/dist/config/nextjs.js gates its Turbopack code path\non process.env.TURBOPACK. next dev --turbo propagates that env var,\nbut next build (which uses Turbopack as the bundler in Next 16) never\nsets it. Without it, the config falls through to the webpack branch,\nthe #remote-components/remote/defaults/app alias is never registered,\nthe dynamic import in app-client.js fails inside its try/catch, and\nno TURBOPACK_REMOTE_SHARED marker ends up in the remote bundle. The\nhost then can''t dedupe shared modules, so the remote ships its own\ncopy of React and useContext crashes the page.\n\nSet TURBOPACK=1 in each shop app''s build script so the marker is\nemitted. Also bump to 0.4.3 (latest) — only chunk hashes changed,\nbut worth staying current.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHwW+rAStP73mgLSb+CdXz44RxFt9Rt83eW9tq5v9J/8c7kKFHi3OiB/PokpjOPz6g\n40nxH0tyYltc3U4n0oeA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-07T17:04:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/2112d09e35b70f686e1fa5180e7960995ea107f8","node_id":"C_kwDOSWDkl9oAKDIxMTJkMDllMzViNzBmNjg2ZTFmYTUxODBlNzk2MDk5NWVhMTA3Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commit/a692eb8c9e8c894b12c973f177db732349c0f79d","sha":"a692eb8c9e8c894b12c973f177db732349c0f79d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/a692eb8c9e8c894b12c973f177db732349c0f79d"}],"sha":"2112d09e35b70f686e1fa5180e7960995ea107f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/2112d09e35b70f686e1fa5180e7960995ea107f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/a692eb8c9e8c894b12c973f177db732349c0f79d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T16:29:41Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T16:29:41Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"Convert <img> to next/image and copy product assets per-app\n\nThe shop apps used plain <img> tags so the browser fetched images\nstraight through the microfrontends proxy from shell''s public/. Switching\nto next/image breaks that — each app''s _next/image optimizer fetches the\nsource from its own origin to optimize, but the files only existed in\nshell.\n\nConvert the seven uses (home heroes, sale/beds/pdp/checkout cards,\nPDP main + thumbnail rail, MiniCart and CheckoutPage line items) to\nnext/image with appropriate fill/sizes/priority props, and copy the\nneeded product images into each consuming app''s public/ so the\noptimizer can resolve them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"805dfbc1c3cced3a267d2948088764e9725b3a2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/805dfbc1c3cced3a267d2948088764e9725b3a2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/a692eb8c9e8c894b12c973f177db732349c0f79d","verification":{"payload":"tree 805dfbc1c3cced3a267d2948088764e9725b3a2e\nparent 6aa0ae6bc074fab40f789d9baee08879e496b805\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778171381 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778171381 +0100\n\nConvert <img> to next/image and copy product assets per-app\n\nThe shop apps used plain <img> tags so the browser fetched images\nstraight through the microfrontends proxy from shell''s public/. Switching\nto next/image breaks that — each app''s _next/image optimizer fetches the\nsource from its own origin to optimize, but the files only existed in\nshell.\n\nConvert the seven uses (home heroes, sale/beds/pdp/checkout cards,\nPDP main + thumbnail rail, MiniCart and CheckoutPage line items) to\nnext/image with appropriate fill/sizes/priority props, and copy the\nneeded product images into each consuming app''s public/ so the\noptimizer can resolve them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEdaF58H1e47rfGD5ISb43gTXByMeQMdEtW2JlNgoapfQ0hdfP0Fde73+bEHXaRkf0\nO2e4vY1uNa3oBiQDKT8wQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-07T16:29:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/event