d_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/commits/6aa0ae6bc074fab40f789d9baee08879e496b805/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T16:18:04Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T16:18:04Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"Drop scripts/ folder\n\nThe Vercel Blob upload helper was a one-off used to populate the\nproduct image manifest; not needed in the repo anymore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea41755e48e82a52d92cd32c0c555992ed041917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/ea41755e48e82a52d92cd32c0c555992ed041917"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/6aa0ae6bc074fab40f789d9baee08879e496b805","verification":{"payload":"tree ea41755e48e82a52d92cd32c0c555992ed041917\nparent 50d336aa8e003986b9c61a378308fafbc67f43bf\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778170684 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778170684 +0100\n\nDrop scripts/ folder\n\nThe Vercel Blob upload helper was a one-off used to populate the\nproduct image manifest; not needed in the repo anymore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\