85+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"Match PDP skeleton to loaded layout\n\nThe skeleton used a half-width 50/50 grid with no max-width, while the\nloaded page is capped at 1280px and uses a 1fr/400px split with a 72px\nthumbnail rail. On wide viewports the image collapsed by ~230px and\nshifted horizontally when the product loaded. Mirror the loaded shape\n(container, grid, thumbnails, info rows) so the layout stays put.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ace84df794edb032722c1e63459e0607b15508c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/1ace84df794edb032722c1e63459e0607b15508c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/e731732d6b06b6d68ca541a77995c9ba03718f65","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ace84df794edb032722c1e63459e0607b15508c\nparent 2b7c6416a302d1bf953adba8deb9ac7c80cb46e3\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778168806 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778168806 +0100\n\nMatch PDP skeleton to loaded layout\n\nThe skeleton used a half-width 50/50 grid with no max-width, while the\nloaded page is capped at 1280px and uses a 1fr/400px split with a 72px\nthumbnail rail. On wide viewports the image collapsed by ~230px and\nshifted horizontally when the product loaded. Mirror the loaded shape\n(container, grid, thumbnails, info rows) so the layout stays put.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJM7h5kPxESRqMk5dvFw1rflPdSEHVKR+lrYU6XUjQlNVjYM5d3ferornGmC2lhltf\npVLV1rR7jDIHxZLug7lgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-07T15:46:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.github