ment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T15:02:28Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tim123abc"},"message":"Bump remote-components 0.3.7 → 0.4.2 across consumer apps\n\n0.3.7 didn''t rewrite TURBOPACK_CHUNK_LISTS to a per-scope global, so\nremote chunks pushed into the host''s registry and Next 16''s\ndev-backend-dom registerChunk crashed with\n\"chunkListsToRegister.forEach is not a function\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a67759d287a1f8182c5bbc8f200cb9dee6cdf5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/trees/5a67759d287a1f8182c5bbc8f200cb9dee6cdf5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/vc-runtime-lab/git/commits/b41b59c244caf21276bd0ad264d0ba42553a07cd","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a67759d287a1f8182c5bbc8f200cb9dee6cdf5d\nparent 1dd8d55342c64c65898abfed6fa2d55c80ce4d34\nauthor tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778166148 +0100\ncommitter tim123abc <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1778166148 +0100\n\nBump remote-components 0.3.7 → 0.4.2 across consumer apps\n\n0.3.7 didn''t rewrite TURBOPACK_CHUNK_LISTS to a per-scope global, so\nremote chunks pushed into the host''s registry and Next 16''s\ndev-backend-dom registerChunk crashed with\n\"chunkListsToRegister.forEach is not a function\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgIIux6vscqQZ0XLcFoP/S3GweTd\nQKC3CEL/Q4x/ea1P0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCZoExDiBk+1h5YZIRJ7D8TcbKLs8xGcWG+wN9cf9fjVB9WetZz9nbA12J1jMpnQ/u\nrb2sj7eG0UrEzJ1w26BQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-07T15:13:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http