et_angular_containerized_decomposition_microservices/commits/db7de3656344bf3b1a823e4b3422789d6eb7c942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T08:22:37Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T08:22:37Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"Scaffold decomposed .NET microservices architecture\n\n- API Gateway (YARP reverse proxy, port 5000)\n- Identity Service (port 5001)\n- Customer Service (port 5002)\n- Order Service (port 5003)\n- Product Service (port 5004)\n- Notification Service (port 5005)\n- Shared Contracts (events, DTOs)\n- Shared Infrastructure (middleware, health checks)\n- Docker Compose for local development\n- PostgreSQL per-service, RabbitMQ for messaging","tree":{"sha":"50e23b06c522304ac07a2819a58203965b270f34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cognition-Partner-Workshops-mirror/app_dotnet_angular_containerized_decomposition_microservices/git/trees/50e23b06c522304ac07a2819a58203965b270f34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cognition-Partner-Workshops-mirror/app_dotnet_angular_containerized_decomposition_microservices/git/commits/db7de3656344bf3b1a823e4b3422789d6eb7c942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","id":158243242,"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","organizatio