t_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits/01e7a55b4425e088dd730753617461e51ded906f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T18:53:23Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T18:53:23Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"message":"chore(upload): block PowerPoint (.ppt and .pptx) from uploads\n\nRemoves both PowerPoint extensions from EXTENSION_ALLOWLIST:\n- .pptx (originally allowed)\n- .ppt (added 2026-05-15 in #11; reverted here)\n\nServer-side ingestion does not extract PowerPoint, so accepting\nthem client-side just queues uploads that the API will reject.\nSurface as \"Unsupported\" at the gate instead.\n\nTest:\n- Drop the .ppt accept-case.\n- Add an explicit reject-case covering both .ppt and .pptx so a\n  future \"add PowerPoint back\" PR breaks loudly and forces a\n  conscious decision.","tree":{"sha":"724024049accb20258344a1a25ec9cb68fb18d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/trees/724024049accb20258344a1a25ec9cb68fb18d0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/commits/01e7a55b4425e088dd730753617461e51ded906f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at