"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits/9fea85fc052a3579d732c2c8a122ed0f329948ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T22:11:09Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T22:11:09Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"message":"chore(upload): remove retry buttons and controller methods\n\nStrips both retry surfaces:\n- Per-file Retry button (UploadProgressBanner + FailedFilesPopover)\n- Retry all (both surfaces)\n- controller.retry / retryAll + their dispatches\n- onRetry / onRetryAll props from FailedFilesPopover and its\n  call site in RootShell\n\nRe-uploading from the dropzone is the recovery path now. The\n`retryable` boolean on UploadFile stays for completeness — it''s\nstill computed from the API error classifier and exercised by\nthe failure-mapping tests, but no UI gates on it.\n\nNote: the beforeunload guard the user mentioned in the same\nrequest is already wired (RootShell -> useBeforeUnloadGuard\nkeyed on uploadController.isInFlight, which stays true through\nupload + indexing). No code change needed there.\n\nTests updated:\n- UploadProgressBanner.test: assert Retry/Retry-all buttons\n  absent; Dismiss path still covered.\n- FailedFilesPopover.test: assert no Retry button rendered;\n  dismiss + dismiss-all retained.\n- useUploadController.test: remove the four retry/retryAll\n  cases. Coverage of `retryable` classification stays.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b742f20388d11dbbc249567ef429e9260ffcd13b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/trees/b742f20388d11dbbc249567ef429e9260ffcd13b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/commits/9fea85fc052a3579d732c2c8a122ed0f329948ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4922472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commit/9fea85fc052a3579d732c2c8a122ed0f329948ba","node_id":"C_kwDOSWKPM9oAKDlmZWE4NWZjMDUyYTM1NzlkNzMyYzJjOGExMjJlZDBmMzI5OTQ4YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commit/a347cb54cfffae2313985b877c898877c55cf9ae