ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits/ea3c34876300b1c4e5e2deae68568611c3b0d003/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T21:32:09Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T21:32:09Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"message":"feat(file-list): surface API-classified documentType column\n\nThe contents endpoint now returns three classification fields on each\nDocumentMetadataResponse: documentType (string|null), documentTypeConfidence\n(number|null), and manuallyClassified (boolean). All three are added to\nthe shared DTO so the TS type matches the wire format. Only documentType\nis rendered for now — a new \"Doc type\" column sits between the existing\nfileType and Size columns. Nulls render as an em dash.\n\nConfidence and manuallyClassified are typed but not yet displayed; they\nunlock a future \"show confidence pill\" or \"manual override\" feature without\nanother contract churn.\n\nThe column is intentionally not added to the sort / type-filter pipeline\nin this slice — keeping the change small. Sort/filter on documentType\ncan land alongside whatever UX motivates them.\n\nTest fixtures in FileList.test.tsx and DocumentPropertiesPanel.test.tsx\nget the three new fields (default to null / null / false). New FileList\nspec asserts the column header is rendered and that documentType values\nappear, with null rows falling back to the em dash.\n\nCoverage note: branches still at 78.23% vs 80% floor — pre-existing\nrealHost.ts gap that main already carries; this PR slightly improves the\nnumber (from 78.15%).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c2f4c398aaa6a076dc88a462153cc6b77f43be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/trees/6c2f4c398aaa6a076dc88a462153cc6b77f43be2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/commits/ea3c34876300b1c4e5e2deae68568611c3b0d003","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4922472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commit/ea3c34876300b1c4e5e2deae68568611c3b0d003","node_id":"C_kwDOSWKPM9oAKGVhM2MzNDg3NjMwMGIxYzRlNWUyZGVhZTY4NTY4NjExYzNiMGQwMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commit/bbe1f496b42de2e9bff0fee9d17b999b06c1fa04","sha":"bbe1f496b42de2e9bff0fee9d17b999b06c1fa04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits/bbe1f496b42de2e9bff0fee9d17b999b0