d220db41de228fdfc4ef8dc161"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3151422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pm38702003","id":3151422,"login":"pm38702003","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTE0MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits/da4a8c40a8fec743f768c83fbf65ba2f8f63f62d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T00:51:32Z","email":"pm38702003@yahoo.com","name":"pm38702003"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T00:51:32Z","email":"pm38702003@yahoo.com","name":"pm38702003"},"message":"feat: host integration fixes shipped to the test SWA\n\nBundle of local edits made during the GlobalAPI test-tenant integration\nwork over 2026-05-07/08. All four changes are LIVE on the deployed\nindexer SWA at witty-stone-0347a500f.7.azurestaticapps.net but were\nnever pushed back upstream — committing them here so they survive\ncheckouts and so the FE team can see exactly what''s running in test.\n\n1. webpack.config.js — output.publicPath: process.env.PUBLIC_PATH || ''auto''\n   Was ''/''. With publicPath: ''/'', a federated consumer at a DIFFERENT\n   origin (e.g. localhost:8080) loading remoteEntry.js from this SWA\n   tries to load chunks from its OWN origin and 404s. ''auto'' resolves\n   chunks relative to where remoteEntry.js was loaded from. Diagnosed\n   2026-05-08 during the consuming-app slice 2 demo. Back-merge wave-2\n   item #33.\n\n2. src/utils/fileTypeFilter.ts — MAX_FILE_SIZE_BYTES bumped 50 MB → 100 MB\n   to match the API''s SupportedContentTypes.MaxFileSizeBytes (100 MB).\n   Reason field text updated. Was a real UX regression: 50-100 MB\n   files the API would have accepted were being rejected client-side.\n   Diagnosed 2026-05-07. Back-merge wave-2 item #32.\n\n3. src/features/upload/useUploadController.ts — /complete signal hardened\n   Set the completeFiredRef latch only on success (was set before\n   await). Added completeInFlightRef to dedupe concurrent firings.\n   Logs failures via console.warn (was silent). Diagnosed 2026-05-07\n   when API logs showed 9 of 13 batches stuck at status=Pending over\n   48h because /complete never fired (or failed silently). Back-merge\n   wave-2 item #31. Three layered fixes are still owed: this is fix\n   (a); persistence + retry-on-mount and IndexerEvent for failure are\n   (b) and (c).\n\n4. src/host/realHost.ts (NEW) + bootstrap.tsx\n   Added a real-MSAL host implementation that runs alongside the\n   existing stubHost. Activated by ?real=1 URL flag (sessionStorage\n   persists the choice across the MSAL redirect cycle). Lets the\n   standalone indexer dev shell exercise the real API for shake-down\n   without needing a federation host. Hardcodes the MWE Test tenant\n   id, the API scope, and the API base URL as defaults. The\n   PublicClientApplication''s clientId is read from\n   process.env.MSAL_CLIENT_ID at build time (must point to a SPA-\n   classified Entra app reg with localhost:5174 in spa.redirectUris).\n\nVerification: production build at this commit was deployed to\nglobalapi-indexer-test SWA on 2026-05-08 and passes the live shake-\ndown (1163 docs Ready across multiple test batches).\n\nThese changes are NOT in chriskonopka/reusable-indexer@master and have\nnot been opened as a PR. The CLI back-merge plan (wave 2 items 31-33)\ncaptures the structural lessons; whether to land any of these as code\nchanges upstream is a separate decision for the FE team.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a625a8ba4b99de8ed8e1c67886d9e680c76bc35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/trees/8a625a8ba4b99de8ed8e1c67886d9e680c76bc35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/commits/da4a8c40a8fec743f768c83fbf65ba2f8f63f62d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3151422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pm38702003","id":3151422,"login":"pm38702003","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNTE0MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pm38702003","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commit/da4a8c40a8fec743f768c83fbf65ba2f8f63f62d","node_id":"C_kwDOSWKPM9oAKGRhNGE4YzQwYThmZWM3NDNmNzY4YzgzZmJmNjViYTJmOGY2M2Y2MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commit/0de694d24f6091544dae6da28d692af606427417","sha":"0de694d24f6091544dae6da28d692af606427417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits/0de694d24f6091544dae6da28d692af606427417"}],"sha":"da4a8c40a8fec743f768c83fbf65ba2f8f63f62d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits/da4a8c40a8fec743f768c83fbf65ba2f8f63f62d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4922472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits/0de694d24f6091544dae6da28d692af606427417/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T18:15:32Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T18:15:32Z","email":"chris@Christophers-MacBook-Pro.local","name":"Christopher Konopka"},"message":"feat: reusable indexer SPA — initial commit (slices S1–S4)\n\nReusable indexer shipped as a Webpack 5 Module Federation remote.\nThe host application supplies the host-contract props (apiBaseUrl,\ngetAccessToken, themeOverrides) and receives IndexerEvents\n(collection/activated, document/selected, error/unhandled, etc.).\nThe indexer manages ingestion + collection management; chat,\ncitations, and document-viewer rendering remain the consuming\napplication''s responsibility.\n\nSlices delivered (see docs/architecture/0[1-4]-slice-*.md):\n- S1: shell, theme, collections (sidebar + CRUD + share dialog)\n- S2: folders (tree + CRUD + drag-drop) and file list\n       (sort / filter / search / bulk-select + properties panel)\n- S3: upload pipeline (drag-drop, folder walk, batch lifecycle,\n       status polling, progress banner, failure triage popover,\n       browser-close guard)\n- S4: read-only mode polish, responsive layout (desktop / tablet /\n       mobile + hamburger overlay), keyboard pass, accessibility\n       sweep, three new Playwright e2e suites (accessibility,\n       responsive, read-only)\n\nTooling:\n- React 19 + TypeScript + Webpack 5 + @module-federation/enhanced\n- TanStack Query for server state; Context + reducer for UI state\n- Jest + jest-axe + React Testing Library (417 tests, 80%+ coverage)\n- Playwright + @axe-core/playwright (49 chromium e2e specs)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48200ddfe59cb8d80f9aa39bfb3b6ddf89c80dcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/trees/48200ddfe59cb8d80f9aa39bfb3b6ddf89c80dcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/git/commits/0de694d24f6091544dae6da28d692af606427417","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4922472?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisgoddard","id":4922472,"login":"chrisgoddard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjI0NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisgoddard","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commit/0de694d24f6091544dae6da28d692af606427417","node_id":"C_kwDOSWKPM9oAKDBkZTY5NGQyNGY2MDkxNTQ0ZGFlNmRhMjhkNjkyYWY2MDY0Mjc0MTc","parents":[],"sha":"0de694d24f6091544dae6da28d692af606427417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits/0de694d24f6091544dae6da28d692af606427417"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/chriskonopka/reusable-indexer/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=661d0d294a0a907c725f55796bfffcb99394e74c&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A18%3A23.714Z"}');
