k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/commits/5c4821569661049b13e578216a821249ebfe2fa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T20:00:58Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T20:00:58Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"message":"docs(openspec): sync change 008 deltas — headers capability + compat notes\n\nWorkstream D of 0020_PLAN_mvp_finalization archived changes 001-015 but\nassumed each archived delta had already been merged into\nopenspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md. Audit (per 0021_PLAN) found change\n008 (error-pages-and-security) was the sole outlier:\n\n| Drift                              | Location                              | Missing                                                                  |\n|------------------------------------|---------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Capability never created           | openspec/specs/headers/               | entire 222-line delta (2 Requirements + 7 Scenarios + impl notes)        |\n| Compatibility notes dropped        | openspec/specs/security/spec.md       | trailing ## Compatibility notes block (D-015 + bodyMayDiffer notes)      |\n| Compatibility notes dropped        | openspec/specs/static-files/spec.md   | trailing ## Compatibility notes block (D-015 + D-003 markup-parity)      |\n\nFixes:\n\n- Create openspec/specs/headers/spec.md from change 008''s headers delta\n  (delta → source-of-truth: title, ## Purpose, ## Requirements; body\n  verbatim).\n- Append ## Compatibility notes to openspec/specs/security/spec.md\n  verbatim from the change 008 security delta.\n- Append ## Compatibility notes to openspec/specs/static-files/spec.md\n  verbatim from the change 008 static-files delta.\n- CHANGELOG [Unreleased] → ### Fixed entry (spec catalogue fix only;\n  behavior, oracle probes, and cargo test results unchanged).\n- methodology_retrospective: bullet under \"What did NOT work / overhead\"\n  documenting that openspec validate does not catch unsynced archived\n  deltas — lesson for the next port.\n\nVerification:\n\n- npx openspec validate --all --strict --concurrency 12 → 12 passed\n  (was 11; new headers spec brings the count up).\n- cargo test --workspace --lib → 362/0/0 (unchanged).\n- cargo test --test oracle → 81/2/0 (unchanged).\n\nSame shape as 5891054 (docs(openspec): archive changes 001-015): no\ncode change, no version bump, no tag — the released v0.1.0 binary\ncontract is unchanged at the wire.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e892ae03a8dda6b58d0d0e1357b8db8acc48fe5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/trees/e892ae03a8dda6b58d0d0e1357b8db8acc48fe5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/commits/5c4821569661049b13e578216a821249ebfe2fa1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sotnyk","id":890642,"login":"sotnyk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDY0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/repos"