-sotnyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T21:44:37Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"message":"chore: address Codex P1 + P3 findings on v0.1.0\n\n- P1 (install path actually submodule-free): set `update = none` on both\n  third_party/* submodules in .gitmodules so `cargo install --git`\n  skips them. Verified empirically: post-fix `cargo install --git\n  file:///...` shows no \"Updating git submodule\" line. Contributor\n  init path now uses `git submodule update --init --checkout --recursive`\n  (the --checkout flag overrides the none strategy); README updated.\n\n- P3 (CHANGELOG count off-by-one): 15 -> 16 archived OpenSpec packages\n  (000 baseline + 001-015 implementation deltas), aligning with the\n  retrospective.\n\n- P3 (Cargo metadata stale): crate descriptions updated from \"Strict-L0\"\n  to \"L0-L3 compatibility\" so `cargo install` output reflects the\n  shipped surface.\n\nTag v0.1.0 force-moved to the new HEAD (tag is local-only, no push has\nhappened, no shared-state to displace).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae2df020e0cbd29f3cd36523ceb6b5e8e8e88226","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/trees/ae2df020e0cbd29f3cd36523ceb6b5e8e8e88226"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/commits/c848b3e7ab1cfd45c95674b4ffe5cc5baa3b4213","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sotnyk","id":890642,"login":"sotnyk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDY0Mg==","organizations_u