ARTIAL_CONTENT` check.**\n  That model held at slice 2 / round 1 P1 but was\n  empirically refuted by Codex round 4 P2: reference\n  DOES compress above-threshold 206 bodies; there is\n  no status-based skip; the explicit\n  `StatusCode::PARTIAL_CONTENT` short-circuit was\n  removed. Rewrote §7''s Range × compression paragraph\n  to describe the empirical evolution (slice 0''s\n  16-byte anchor passed because the slice fails the\n  threshold gate naturally; round 4 P2 added an\n  above-threshold anchor that confirmed reference''s\n  unified-gate behavior) and the current irserve\n  implementation (unified threshold gate, both\n  sub-cases pinned dual-target via ORC-206 and\n  ORC-213).\n\nVerification:\n\n- `npx @fission-ai/openspec validate --all --strict`\n  — 26 passed / 0 failed.\n- No code changed; `cargo` unchanged from rounds 6-9\n  (362 / 81-2-0 / 26 still holds).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9cc7b5b7e72a17001521829f60b60810d1614821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/trees/9cc7b5b7e72a17001521829f60b60810d1614821"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/commits/f6cb9abf5e7bb0bb911f7846a60cc864b298c56c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sotnyk","id":890642,"login":"sotnyk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDY0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotny