":"serge-sotnyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T20:32:41Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"message":"docs(stage-7e): address Codex review round 9 (P3 fix)\n\nOne doc-hygiene finding:\n\n- **[P3] `design.md` gate ordering omitted the round-3\n  `Content-Encoding != identity` passthrough.** The\n  numbered list at §4''s \"`maybe_apply` itself is the\n  only mutating call ... Its gate ordering,\n  top-to-bottom\" jumped from HEAD (step 6) to\n  threshold (step 7) and never mentioned the user-\n  `headers` already-encoded passthrough implemented\n  in `crates/irserve-core/src/compression.rs:328-358`\n  by Codex round 2 P2 / round 3 P2. The canonical\n  spec delta at\n  `openspec/changes/015-compression/specs/http-compression/spec.md:80`\n  already had the correct step. Mirrored the\n  canonical wording into `design.md` as a new step 7:\n  `existing_encoding != None && existing_encoding !=\n  Some(\"identity\")` → return with `Vary` set, no\n  re-encoding. Renumbered the subsequent steps\n  (threshold → 8, negotiate → 9, encode → 10) and\n  updated the closing \"step 8''s framing\" reference\n  to \"step 10''s framing\" so the D-020 #1 citation\n  still points at the encode/framing step.\n\nVerification:\n\n- `npx @fission-ai/openspec validate --all --strict`\n  — 26 passed / 0 failed.\n- No code changed; `cargo` unchanged from rounds 6-8\n  (362 / 81-2-0 / 26 still holds).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90b9e4721459dc134a363da77ac443e443a50339","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/trees/90b9e4721459dc134a363da77ac443e443a50339"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/commits/1a84f8d3ec617d080a3567e08ca04d18e879fdb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.g