u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sotnyk","id":890642,"login":"sotnyk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDY0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/commits/d92d5246971cf6717fce9f393653cb06abf0bcf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T12:50:56Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T12:50:56Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"message":"docs(stage-7b): address Codex review round 7 (P3 fix)\n\nP3 — reorder the round-log in\n`openspec/changes/012-last-modified/tasks.md` so Round 6 follows\nRound 5 chronologically.\n\nRound 6''s commit (`7f219e1`) inserted the new section *before*\nRound 5 — at the spot just after Round 4''s \"plan file\nintentionally left at point-in-time wording\" paragraph, where\nthe previous round had been appended in earlier commits. The\nresult was a log that rendered `1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 5`, with Round 5\nlanding after Round 6 in document order even though Round 5\nwas committed first chronologically.\n\nSwap the two blocks so the log reads `1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7`\nunder the `## Codex review rounds` heading. Content within\neither block is unchanged.\n\nAlso pin Round 6''s now-known hash: `(commit pending; pinned in\nnext round if any)` → `(commit 7f219e1)`. Round 6 was committed\nbetween this review and Codex''s reading, so the \"pending\"\nmarker can resolve. Round 7 itself carries the same marker\n(self-reference window, documented in Round 6''s block).\n\nNo code, no spec content, no probe, no count changes.\nRound-log presentation only.\n\nVerified:\n- `cargo test --workspace --lib` — 279/279 unchanged.\n- `npx -y @fission-ai/openspec@latest validate --all --strict`\n  — 21/21 passed.\n- `grep -nE ''^### Round [0-9]''\n  openspec/changes/012-last-modified/tasks.md` — rounds appear\n  in order 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6398bef5b84c5c32b5a2ab3b321d755d4775b81d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/trees/6398bef5b84c5c32b5a2ab3b321d755d4775b81d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/commits/d92d5246971cf6717fce9f393653cb06abf0bcf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sotnyk","id":890642,"login":"sotnyk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDY0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk","user_view_type"