/api.github.com/users/sotnyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/commits/7ed7fe4e04db00ffa5fc504d62d0b2adde700e16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T12:41:39Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T12:41:39Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"message":"docs(stage-7b): address Codex review round 5 (P3 fix)\n\nP3 — restore the `## Validation` heading in\n`openspec/changes/012-last-modified/tasks.md` that round 4\nclobbered when inserting the Round 4 section. The Round 4 edit\nappended after the Round 3 block but consumed the existing\n`## Validation` heading (`## Validation` → `### Round 4`),\nleaving the validation bullets visually attached to Round 4 and\nreading as Round-4 output. The bullets also still cited the\nslice-3 numbers (278/278 unit tests; \"slice 4 final step\" for\nthe openspec validate line) rather than the current end-of-stage\ntotals.\n\nFix:\n- Round 4 heading pinned with the actual commit hash (`3437082`)\n  instead of \"this commit\" (same convention as Rounds 1–3).\n- New Round 5 section records this round''s scope.\n- `## Validation` heading restored as a separate top-level\n  section below the round log. Bullets refreshed:\n  - `cargo test --workspace --lib` now **279/279** (was 278;\n    +1 from Codex round 1 P2''s `etag_on_ignores_ims_even_with_user_lm_rule`).\n    Stage-7b additions enumerated by slice for traceability:\n    4 in `last_modified.rs` + 9 in `dispatch::tests` (across\n    slice 2 and slice 3) + 1 in `dispatch::tests` (Codex\n    round 1 P2) = 14.\n  - Oracle line unchanged in content (82/76/6/0) but rephrased\n    to clarify why `ims_exact`/`ims_future` produce the\n    asymmetric reference-vs-irserve totals.\n  - `openspec validate` line concretised with the current\n    21/21 totals + the run-every-round cadence.\n\nNo code or spec changes; pure round-log hygiene.\n\nVerified:\n- `cargo test --workspace --lib` — 279/279 (unchanged).\n- `npx -y @fission-ai/openspec@latest validate --all --strict`\n  — 21/21 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"499f9a845ef4606bb1bb8ad265bab4f551496a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/trees/499f9a845ef4606bb1bb8ad265bab4f551496a5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/commits/7ed7fe4e04db00ffa5fc504d62d0b2adde700e16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sotnyk","id":890642,"login":"sotnyk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDY0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/serge-sotnyk/irServe/commit/7ed7fe4e04db00ffa5fc504d62d0b2adde700e16","node_id":