ic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/commits/b653646522b3feac6751112bddcddeb2f46180d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T16:45:40Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T16:45:40Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"message":"feat(stage-6g): slice 1 — directory resolve outcome plumbing\n\nAdds a `Directory(PathBuf)` variant to `ResolveOutcome` so phase 11\ncan distinguish \"directory without index.html\" from \"missing\".\nThe carried path is canonicalized and containment-checked against\nroot, mirroring the File/Index branches. All three dispatch sites\nthat pattern-match the enum (rewrite-fallback in extensionless\nflow, has-extension pre-stat fallback, and the final outcome\nmatch) treat the new variant identically to NotFound for now —\nbehavior-preserving plumbing only. Slice 2 wires the listing\nrenderer.\n\nOracle: 70 total / 56 passed / 14 skipped / 0 failed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4c09ba51968ec9c92870b393e5df510c3c5ca3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/trees/e4c09ba51968ec9c92870b393e5df510c3c5ca3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/commits/b653646522b3feac6751112bddcddeb2f46180d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sotnyk","id":890642,"login":"sotnyk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDY0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sot