after Stage 6f (which ran ~470k tokens\nacross 6 slices + 5 Codex review rounds, with subagents only used\nduring plan-mode reconnaissance).\n\nAGENTS.md gains a \"Subagent delegation triggers\" section listing the\ntwo highest-leverage hand-offs: (1) spec prose after green slices —\nproposal/design/tasks/MOD deltas drafted by a subagent given the slice\nplan + commit log + a peer change package, and (2) cross-cutting\nreference reconnaissance in plan-mode — when a stage mirrors 2+\nfunctions of the same reference family, one Explore agent returns\nverbatim branch code with line numbers so empirical surprises don''t\nget rediscovered in review rounds.\n\nstage_kickoff_template.md sharpens both anchors: step 1 (plan-mode)\nexplicitly requires the verbatim-code recon for cross-cutting stages,\nstep 2 (implementation) adds slice-6 spec prose to the delegation\nlist, with the briefing shape that lets a subagent draft without the\nfull implementation conversation in context.\n\nNo methodology change; just earlier-and-more-explicit subagent use.","tree":{"sha":"32bb2124e8bd06c16fb1f0fd633e7b52b18e309f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/trees/32bb2124e8bd06c16fb1f0fd633e7b52b18e309f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/commits/3f34e0b09564a8ff20a31b123526d2d1e10e9b7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sotnyk","id":890642,"login":"sotnyk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDY0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/orgs","received_events_url":"h