/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T16:02:32Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T16:02:32Z","email":"serge.sotnyk@gmail.com","name":"serge-sotnyk"},"message":"docs(stage-6f): address Codex review round 5 (P3 fix)\n\nP3 — custom_headers module-level doc comment said \"Custom headers\napply to every successful and error response\" + \"skipped on 3xx\".\nThat''s the round-1 description; rounds 1-3 split the contract per\nsendError branch (JSON skip, custom <status>.html apply, fallback\nHTML conditional + Content-Type force). Replaced the stale paragraph\nwith a per-branch summary mirroring index.js:467-524 and :746, so\nfuture readers don''t re-introduce the apply-everywhere bug.\n\nNo code changes; cargo build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4d306e886bba709e9f53d0ff0b141baa9671af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/trees/d4d306e886bba709e9f53d0ff0b141baa9671af7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/serge-sotnyk/irServe/git/commits/4f012026cd3bb205b396fd8768476803555079c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/890642?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sotnyk","id":890642,"login":"sotnyk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDY0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sotnyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s