ZjZGQ0OTc0NzZlYzk2NGUyNThlNjM5NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/78b785134125ba4c0bb952df1715555569b0ecd6","sha":"78b785134125ba4c0bb952df1715555569b0ecd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/78b785134125ba4c0bb952df1715555569b0ecd6"}],"sha":"5bc284416cfdc4c6cdd497476ec964e258e63951","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/5bc284416cfdc4c6cdd497476ec964e258e63951"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/78b785134125ba4c0bb952df1715555569b0ecd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T15:47:12Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"Noel Huibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T15:47:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(graph-canvas): i18n the shared canvas via a labels API (DE + EN) (#100)\n\nThe graph canvas is shared across web / VS Code / JupyterLab, so it can''t import\nany one host''s i18n. Instead every user-facing string is now a `label` with an\nEnglish default; a host overrides them by passing `labels` to <Canvas>\n(canvas-internal strings, via a React context) or <NodeConfigEditor> (that panel\nis host-rendered outside <Canvas>, so it takes a labels prop).\n\n- graph-canvas: new labels.tsx (CanvasLabels + NodeConfigLabels types, English\n  defaults, context + useCanvasLabels hook). Canvas / Node / NodeGroup /\n  InletOutletGrid / PortEditor read labels via the hook; NodeConfigEditor via prop.\n  English defaults are byte-identical to the old strings, so all 119 tests pass\n  unchanged. Exports the label types + defaults from the package entry.\n- web-app: new `canvas` i18n namespace (EN + DE, ~46 keys) built into label\n  objects and fed to <Canvas labels> (App.tsx) and <NodeConfigEditor labels>\n  (CanvasSidebar): node status/tags, ports, rename, minimap/layout toolbar, run\n  summary, breadcrumbs, and the config panel.\n\nOther surfaces keep the English defaults until they wire their own labels.\n\nVerified: graph-canvas tsc -b + 119 tests; web-app typecheck (enforces DE/EN\nparity + label-prop types); every CanvasLabels key present in the catalog; biome\nand build green.","tree":{"sha":"ab015e1d8716b965eb905728583c0ad87a0bb647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/ab015e1d8716b965eb905728583c0ad87a0bb647"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/78b785134125ba4c0bb952df1715555569b0ecd6","verification":{"payload":"tree ab015e1d8716b965eb905728583c0ad87a0bb647\nparent 119bc976beea1b4e79387cdbea709b8d7193d4bd\nauthor Noel Huibers <noel@huibers.io> 1783180032 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783180032 +0200\n\nfeat(graph-canvas): i18n the shared canvas via a labels API (DE + EN) (#100)\n\nThe graph canvas is shared across web / VS Code / JupyterLab, so it can''t import\nany one host''s i18n. Instead every user-facing string is now a `label` with an\nEnglish default; a host overrides them by passing `labels` to <Canvas>\n(canvas-internal strings, via a React context) or <NodeConfigEditor> (that panel\nis host-rendered outside <Canvas>, so it takes a labels prop).\n\n- graph-canvas: new labels.tsx (CanvasLabels + NodeConfigLabels types, English\n  defaults, context + useCanvasLabels hook). Canvas / Node / NodeGroup /\n  InletOutletGrid / PortEditor read labels via the hook; NodeConfigEditor via prop.\n  English defaults are byte-identical to the old strings, so all 119 tests pass\n  unchanged. Exports the label types + defaults from the package entry.\n- web-app: new `canvas` i18n namespace (EN + DE, ~46 keys) built into label\n  objects and fed to <Canvas labels> (App.tsx) and <NodeConfigEditor labels>\n  (CanvasSidebar): node status/tags, ports, rename, minimap/layout toolbar, run\n  summary, breadcrumbs, and the config panel.\n\nOther surfaces keep the English defaults until they wire their own labels.\n\nVerified: graph-canvas tsc -b + 119 tests; web-app typecheck (enforces DE/EN\nparity + label-prop types); every CanvasLabels key present in the catalog; biome\nand build green.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSSsACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKBoQAI6+mdXBs7h2EzLELPVwP5TV\nfFj9X7GaClm3bu+tlxpdxkc1A3h/LBo8VhpAClI49nl9LTcNGRxu3CHz/2kFLwNe\neFbS0kMpPMbM6XyAw++oZ4X+xz0vVQJ8aFukaSXS6FNnmloNFDvjzPzgvAURUL5h\nITY7X9LKagW2nRe7XtrgYCaeVwCW2nahxsaqMF+6r7f9gjnpKb4PKH7Rt5VVeCuz\nTQ0CEOjzsW91d79xxZVBksna4oVyRVvnkeM/XEpH/qfokRGlnTRmuxT3TPLMMTMD\nZJ3cdI4e47FfFnanCY9BJJ26QnnZMlW5oHPpPokQ3tVRHhToBMHOMwN7jXGUrr8R\nDzLFfPymqQKTcci7IQWQxXqn2W23FPHSSzuWYBE0X7Q8Ow+srkm+zWt3ItYPKkd1\n4v7SnMU1t9Tcy+dzvPUP2WLQyB5kLEHKOWQjm2fGfmQx4VA0ez6xumcI5LQnnGpC\nz57aisAUgxh1YAKtRtV6DH/MXZryozu7HyC7kJExQycgf4PoOjCRLwg+fRAeX98D\nRLOMhX4+fhn0/X+RAOmYUwv5PMzbOQyApYSXzaT0u6FtJvterVPpDMkvtOEAGcaL\ncip5Qs01OodwS7WlJPjzEuZWhSw33aS1+cStQBkgmwpUGXLZaQ7au59qI3J2aBSU\nfbgE6pFe6bvjiA3MlGOK\n=S1lb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"