:"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/85511b5909a935317e21d2242bf5a8964a175afe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T00:38:13Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"Noel Huibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T00:38:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(web-app): cinematic scroll-driven landing page (#96)\n\n* feat(web-app): cinematic scroll-driven landing page\n\nRebuild the landing hero as a pinned, scroll-scrubbed narrative that\nanimates the product story: a notebook''s cells lift into graph nodes,\nlocal wires draw on, a second notebook links in via a cross-notebook\n(purple, dashed) wire, then a run pulse lights the DAG up in\ntopological order. Driven by GSAP ScrollTrigger over a crisp SVG/DOM\ngraph, with a lazy-loaded Three.js (R3F) ambient backdrop for depth.\n\n- Authentic content/colours from examples/demo.ipynb and graph-canvas\n  Node.tsx (tag/wire/runtime palette) so it reads as a real app slice.\n- Adaptive to the light/dark theme via existing oklch tokens.\n- SSR-safe: GSAP runs client-only; the R3F backdrop is the only\n  ClientOnly piece; resting markup is the clean final-state graph.\n- Degrades under prefers-reduced-motion (timeline + WebGL skipped).\n- Three.js code-split out of the initial payload; backdrop pauses\n  offscreen with DPR capped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(web-app): biome format + lint fixes for landing page\n\nApply repo biome formatting/import-sorting and replace array-index keys\nwith stable content keys (lint/suspicious/noArrayIndexKey).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24d24f4961691460b59ff30abca5e72deca949cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/24d24f4961691460b59ff30abca5e72deca949cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/85511b5909a935317e21d2242bf5a8964a175afe","verification":{"payload":"tree 24d24f4961691460b59ff30abca5e72deca949cb\nparent f4a2400eb03c53eec367a0d79a27d92321aacb2c\nauthor Noel Huibers <noel@huibers.io> 1782434293 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782434293 +0200\n\nfeat(web-app): cinematic scroll-driven landing page (#96)\n\n* feat(web-app): cinematic scroll-driven landing page\n\nRebuild the landing hero as a pinned, scroll-scrubbed narrative that\nanimates the product story: a notebook''s cells lift into graph nodes,\nlocal wires draw on, a second notebook links in via a cross-notebook\n(purple, dashed) wire, then a run pulse lights the DAG up in\ntopological order. Driven by GSAP ScrollTrigger over a crisp SVG/DOM\ngraph, with a lazy-loaded Three.js (R3F) ambient backdrop for depth.\n\n- Authentic content/colours from examples/demo.ipynb and graph-canvas\n  Node.tsx (tag/wire/runtime palette) so it reads as a real app slice.\n- Adaptive to the light/dark theme via existing oklch tokens.\n- SSR-safe: GSAP runs client-only; the R3F backdrop is the only\n  ClientOnly piece; resting markup is the clean final-state graph.\n- Degrades under prefers-reduced-motion (timeline + WebGL skipped).\n- Three.js code-split out of the initial payload; backdrop pauses\n  offscreen with DPR capped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(web-app): biome format + lint fixes for landing page\n\nApply repo biome formatting/import-sorting and replace array-index keys\nwith stable content keys (lint/suspicious/noArrayIndexKey).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPcn1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4NgQAH1uewxHN6XoMJiX9yu/DkO6\n8/S2xXS6rB57jQ8q+h9rKjWJ+uaOQpKMRXbdh3jEtOulwvHpx8D9TJTjyKNhz3kO\nB4cNihHoCQj9jCFZi+IgdeJFkKGs00ZfKWdHuXO+u6gxbA99iSI8YelOGvhLltxX\n0TKqOeqLmvHr5YGs94lIMgXFyO9n2nLR4fOw7mBWcRHni4rkEmK5Zq9DuURQTckl\nILABRoB3ZkKqiqKJfzXSKbbBjXpRC9t5GvcEBVFErHBQa5xRXNpU43LghSF1BSty\nrFGwufARuqg/CrOJX5PMVCWQ4MRk/lLHxF5FQOvG8I5aGfN/Po36I0vzUXsxuc2j\nl9XGcT0curymb+BjLL1E6SiBlEmwX6d5U23AXzvRVyhhfauGD3qEkR9Qa2qoebLP\n8VEF0e3hV1SXUHpbaf65E0W9DP8iwyBTEw/4r8tafxFxsd0jOsIeDhw3INwM+AOO\nZjTRTFI8+fA0l2+p6QjsTTE6O4qmgzT3rOetgcplvXJUsU34DioSrMhUvhCj4jUa\nkUYPL5FAgw/bbQ6Hpr59OjRmOQuzrZbhfhY+1B822np8WT9dQxSnTr0VbwOeh5Y2\nMZiKJissZUkwxJHjAoebTv4z3MBT7rMEuIsAim2i7km8FlI86oOxUYxn0bhSKUsS\neTLsiY/BDv1GNy2Hrhyw\n=0AzB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-26T00:38:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OD