ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/22f7ce6c2466c8846a499f22fe8cd0369a679a72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T22:55:23Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"Noel Huibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T22:55:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: strict NodeNext typecheck for server/function files (#92)\n\nMake our checks as strict as Vercel''s function compiler so the bug that took\nprod down (extensionless relative imports — fine under `bundler`, fatal under\nthe function''s `nodenext` at runtime) fails locally and in CI instead.\n\n- tsconfig.server.json: type-checks api/ + src/server/** + src/lib/auth.ts +\n  src/lib/db/** under moduleResolution NodeNext + @types/node (skipLibCheck to\n  avoid third-party export-map noise that Vercel ignores anyway).\n- `typecheck` now runs both passes (app `bundler` + strict server `nodenext`).\n- Fixed the 3 extensionless dynamic imports it flagged in src/server/api.ts.\n- Add @types/node as a direct devDep.\n\nVerified: full typecheck green; dropping any `.js` extension fails the strict\npass with TS2835.","tree":{"sha":"daa9d7c7138bec9050ffda92eeb76601bbaa232e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/daa9d7c7138bec9050ffda92eeb76601bbaa232e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/22f7ce6c2466c8846a499f22fe8cd0369a679a72","verification":{"payload":"tree daa9d7c7138bec9050ffda92eeb76601bbaa232e\nparent a69cd53da9d547675a09f202bbbba911b8693fdf\nauthor Noel Huibers <noel@huibers.io> 1782428123 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782428123 +0200\n\nchore: strict NodeNext typecheck for server/function files (#92)\n\nMake our checks as strict as Vercel''s function compiler so the bug that took\nprod down (extensionless relative imports — fine under `bundler`, fatal under\nthe function''s `nodenext` at runtime) fails locally and in CI instead.\n\n- tsconfig.server.json: type-checks api/ + src/server/** + src/lib/auth.ts +\n  src/lib/db/** under moduleResolution NodeNext + @types/node (skipLibCheck to\n  avoid third-party export-map noise that Vercel ignores anyway).\n- `typecheck` now runs both passes (app `bundler` + strict server `nodenext`).\n- Fixed the 3 extensionless dynamic imports it flagged in src/server/api.ts.\n- Add @types/node as a direct devDep.\n\nVerified: full typecheck green; dropping any `.js` extension fails the strict\npass with TS2835.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPbHbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAv5AQAC88p8V+ONCkoL/bs9TrBBZ7\nLRm6v6mT0iFEZPY1YW5XtaG+4ImmrpmTu9LAXX9t7iNlPy+zlzNNO2IYrQWakThy\nxatGyDT/MgwOqbmCRkBz0VJpejvaMglEWXOh37BtZzMD7l0oqfK2IzcCsYnT/B+z\nv+kUKUqCMLHZNabx8ptI3bxhuRj64SPsA8egIxEwVOX2Gj0FNQsnhkFOo98MNdj1\nFTiljiyKhBUyEieG2gEdpoVuMtMYu4XUyHSgm/Bz32jNY1IY+3SGe6NFE6UPH1eC\nI6zHXLrN49YkkENEY3FCohwNE7mdAtmzzKePgEq1zAs3TiI6cvjkh42EB4YjYh9c\nMIx9C+BGjLPapirjkB7lEqD6OZfT1H932DgWl/iibRENPtpXtNHpC7/m5RfsUQkA\nu1BZ9c4GA5Vj+ubTc0zPsZvXF6r6l5oPisEs9xWCffsQSpVb9C20kG3+ISdHcM5M\n6Cea30xAGhoAEsG3uJUtfGHDZW0ak02rwMlESI18cV2QjgUm1O