rl":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/a69cd53da9d547675a09f202bbbba911b8693fdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T22:40:34Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T22:40:34Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"message":"Hotfix: .js import extensions so the Vercel function resolves (restore prod)\n\nVercel compiles the api/ function with moduleResolution: nodenext, which\nrequires explicit .js extensions on relative imports. Our extensionless\nimports (fine for Vite/bundler) left the deployed function with unresolvable\nESM specifiers -> ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND -> the function crashed on EVERY route,\ntaking all of prod down after #91 merged. It worked pre-#91 because the\nfunction only pulled in extension-free http-bridge.\n\n- api/index.ts is now self-contained (inlines the Node<->Web bridge, no static\n  ../src import) and dynamically imports the handlers with .js.\n- auth/db/notebooks/providerKey relative imports get .js too.\n\nCompatible across all three toolchains: tsc (bundler maps .js->.ts), Vite dev\n(esbuild does too), and the Vercel function (nodenext). Verified locally:\ntypecheck + biome + build green; dev /api/auth/jwks 200, notebooks/provider-key\n401.","tree":{"sha":"787d799c743c0dfc7a8ae2e80c970fd737c44904","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/787d799c743c0dfc7a8ae2e80c970fd737c44904"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/a69cd53da9d547675a09f202bbbba911b8693fdf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/a69cd53da9d547675a09f202bbbba911b8693fdf","node_id":"C_kwDOSWT-J9oAKGE2OWNkNTNkYTlkNTQ3Njc1YTA5ZjIwMmJiYmJhOTExYjg2OTNmZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/df7437fc854d9648e8dad47ecad0ef22957243d3","sha":"df7437fc854d9648e8dad47ecad0ef22957243d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/df7437fc854d9648e8dad47ecad0ef22957243d3"}],"sha":"a69cd53da9d547675a09f202bbbba911b8693fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/a69cd53da9d547675a09f202bbbba911b8693fdf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/df7437fc854d9648e8dad47ecad0ef22957243d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T22:29:57Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T22:29:57Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"message":"Hotfix: restore prod — inline /api dispatch with dynamic imports\n\nThe merge of #91 took the whole prod function down: api/index.ts statically\nimported ../src/server/api, and that module uses dynamic import() internally,\nwhich Vercel''s function bundler can''t resolve at runtime\n(ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND) — crashing every route, not just /api.\n\nInline the dispatch in api/index.ts using dynamic, string-literal imports of\neach handler (auth / notebooks / provider-key) — the pattern proven on the #59\npreview — so the tracer includes them and SSR routes never load auth/db.\nsrc/server/api.ts stays for the Vite dev middleware.","tree":{"sha":"8e7beebce7e02db9cc697c768dde616e74eac593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/8e7beebce7e02db9cc697c768dde616e74eac593"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/df7437fc854d9648e8dad47ecad0ef22957243d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/df7437fc854d9648e8dad47ecad0ef22957243d3","node_id":"C_kwDOSWT-J9oAKGRmNzQzN2ZjODU0ZDk2NDhlOGRhZDQ3ZWNhZDBlZjIyOTU3MjQzZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/2e662330273d5dafcc4042522c8e60d45cae0d1a","sha":"2e662330273d5dafcc4042522c8e60d45cae0d1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/2e662330273d5dafcc4042522c8e60d45cae0d1a"}],"sha":"df7437fc854d9648e8dad47ecad0ef22957243d3","url":"https://api.gi