_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/2e662330273d5dafcc4042522c8e60d45cae0d1a","node_id":"C_kwDOSWT-J9oAKDJlNjYyMzMwMjczZDVkYWZjYzQwNDI1MjJjOGU2MGQ0NWNhZTBkMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/af1ef3a698478d41f167ed037f6b9e9fdab5a85f","sha":"af1ef3a698478d41f167ed037f6b9e9fdab5a85f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/af1ef3a698478d41f167ed037f6b9e9fdab5a85f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/0f9b3a560e6a7f643038f3f3c65a9c4badd404d3","sha":"0f9b3a560e6a7f643038f3f3c65a9c4badd404d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/0f9b3a560e6a7f643038f3f3c65a9c4badd404d3"}],"sha":"2e662330273d5dafcc4042522c8e60d45cae0d1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/2e662330273d5dafcc4042522c8e60d45cae0d1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/0f9b3a560e6a7f643038f3f3c65a9c4badd404d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T21:39:12Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T21:39:12Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"message":"#62: tenant dimension on the DataBus\n\nNamespace DataBus store keys + parquet spills by tenant alongside the run id\n(#15), so concurrent runs from different users never collide — even when the\nclient-supplied pipeline run id matches.\n- DataBus(tenant=...): keys are (tenant, run_id, node_id, port); spills land in\n  spill_dir/<tenant>/<run_id>/. tenant is the JWT sub, hashed (the raw sub never\n  lands on disk); None -> shared \"_\" namespace, so self-host is unchanged.\n- server.py passes tenant=user_id to the DataBus for both HTTP and WS runs.\n- tests: per-tenant spill namespacing; two tenants with the SAME run id sharing\n  one store stay isolated (read/keys/clear); existing run-id tests updated for\n  the new layout. 222 engine tests green.\n\nIsolates data only; untrusted-code sandboxing is the separate #55 decision.","tree":{"sha":"531b996ef5c25bdb582119ac139929820e2e75aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/531b996ef5c25bdb582119ac139929820e2e75aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/0f9b3a560e6a7f643038f3f3c65a9c4badd404d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/0f9b3a560e6a7f643038f3f3c65a9c4badd404d3","node_id":"C_kwDOSWT-J9oAKDBmOWIzYTU2MGU2YTdmNjQzMDM4ZjNmM2M2NWE5YzRiYWRkNDA0ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/d6cfdc718ee98f0f5d85e63d1f98af5058c1ab39","sha":"d6cfdc718ee98f0f5d85e63d1f98af5058c1ab39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/d6cfdc718ee98f0f5d85e63d1f98af5058c1ab39"}],"sha":"0f9b3a560e6a7f643038f3f3c65a9c4badd404d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/0f9b3a560e6a7f643038f3f3c65a9c4badd404d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/d6cfdc718ee98f0f5d85e63d1f98af5058c1ab39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T20:58:51Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T20:58:51Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"message":"#61: server-side encrypted provider keys\n\nOpt-in per-user BYOK key persisted encrypted-at-rest in Turso, alongside the\nbrowser-only storage from #57 (unchanged).\n- provider_key table (one row per user, cascade-delete) pushed to Turso.\n- src/server/crypto.ts: AES-256-GCM with a 32-byte PROVIDER_KEY_SECRET master.\n- src/server/providerKey.ts: encrypt on save; decrypt only for the owner.\n  /api/provider-key GET/PUT/DELETE, session-gated, registered in the /api\n  dispatcher. The plaintext key is never logged and only ever returned to its\n  owner (so Settings can load it).\n- client lib + Settings: \"Save key to account\" / \"Remove from account\" when\n  signed in; the account key auto-loads on a fresh device without clobbering a\n  locally-entered key.\n\nEngine unchanged — it already takes the key per-request and decrypts only\nin-memory for the LLM call, never logging it.\n\nValidated against Turso: stored ciphertext != plaintext, decrypts for owner,\nupsert keeps one row, cross-user GET is null, GCM tamper rejected, delete\nremoves it. typecheck + biome + build green; /api/provider-key 401s without a\nsession.","tree":{"sha":"1ad016f3701fd44916e5b8c8714384e2412a4a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/1ad016f3701fd44916e5b8c8714384e2412a4a80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/d6cfdc718ee98f0f5d85e63d1f98af5058c1ab39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/d6cfdc718ee98f0f5d85e63d1f98af5058c1ab39","node_id":"C_kwDOSWT-J9oAKGQ2Y2ZkYzcxOGVlOThmMGY1ZDg1ZTYzZDFmOThhZjUwNThjMWFiMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/5925695cfce10a902f6a98af9ac6ee009a160cd6","sha":"5925695cfce10a902f6a98af9ac6ee009a160cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/5925695cfce10a902f6a98af9ac6ee009a160cd6"}],"sha":"d6cfdc718ee98f0f5d85e63d1f98af5058c1ab39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/d6cfdc718ee98f0f5d85e63d1f98af5058c1ab39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/5925695cfce10a902f6a98af9ac6ee009a160cd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T20:37:21Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T20:37:21Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"message":"#70: per-tenant data-file storage\n\nScope the engine''s /files store and the executor''s data_dir to the\nauthenticated user (the JWT sub from #59); self-host keeps the single shared\ndirectory.\n- _data_dir(app, user_id): per-user subdir (sha256 of sub) under the base\n  NOTEBOOKFLOW_DATA_DIR — a persistent volume in prod, so uploads survive\n  restarts; the base dir directly when unauthenticated.\n- /files list/upload/delete + the HTTP and WS runs resolve the requester''s\n  store, so same-named files can''t collide or leak across users.\n- per-user quota (NOTEBOOKFLOW_MAX_DATA_FILES / _BYTES) -> 413 on overflow;\n  overwriting an existing file doesn''t count against it.\n- tests: cross-tenant isolation (list/size/delete), run resolves the owner''s\n  file (the other user''s run errors), quota enforced. 55 engine tests green.\n\nWeb-app needs no change: EngineClient already presents the session JWT on\n/files and runs, so per-user scoping is transparent.","tree":{"sha":"de2f9786e39991600206d9c0baef2779384f1b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/de2f9786e39991600206d9c0baef2779384f1b77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/5925695cfce10a902f6a98af9ac6ee009a160cd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/5925695cfce10a902f6a98af9ac6ee009a160cd6","node_id":"C_kwDOSWT-J9oAKDU5MjU2OTVjZmNlMTBhOTAyZjZhOThhZjlhYzZlZTAwOWExNjBjZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/2afc4b63d842900e04b65e6e492145a3528888da","sha":"2afc4b63d842900e04b65e6e492145a3528888da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/2afc4b63d842900e04b65e6e492145a3528888da"}],"sha":"5925695cfce10a902f6a98af9ac6ee009a160cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/5925695cfce10a902f6a98af9ac6ee009a160cd6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/2afc4b63d842900e04b65e6e492145a3528888da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T20:02:48Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T20:02:48Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"message":"#60: per-user notebook persistence in Turso\n\n- schema: notebook table (user-scoped, cascade-delete) pushed to Turso.\n- src/server/notebooks.ts: user-scoped CRUD store + /api/notebooks handler\n  (resolves the BetterAuth session -> userId, 401 otherwise). Every query is\n  filtered by userId, so no user can read or modify another''s notebooks.\n- src/server/api.ts: one /api/* dispatcher (auth + notebooks), mounted by both\n  the Vercel function and the Vite dev middleware.\n- lib/notebooksApi.ts: client (list/get/create/update/delete) + workspace\n  (de)serialization shared with the zip export.\n- App.tsx: Cloud button (when signed in) + CloudNotebooksDialog — save the\n  current workspace, list/open/delete saved notebooks.\n\nValidated: store + cross-user scoping checked directly against Turso (CRUD,\nlist isolation, cross-user GET/PUT/DELETE all blocked); /api/notebooks 401s\nwithout a session, /api/auth/jwks still serves. typecheck + biome + build green.","tree":{"sha":"49ba604ea9cb781c53d0f851374d143a96a798fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/49ba604ea9cb781c53d0f851374d143a96a798fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/2afc4b63d842900e04b65e6e492145a3528888da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/2afc4b63d842900e04b65e6e492145a3528888da","node_id":"C_kwDOSWT-J9oAKDJhZmM0YjYzZDg0MjkwMGUwNGI2NWU2ZTQ5MjE0NWEzNTI4ODg4ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/1577f6b610b5c74b8620bc24f74db1b294f5ca57","sha":"1577f6b610b5c74b8620bc24f74db1b294f5ca57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/1577f6b610b5c74b8620bc24f74db1b294f5ca57"}],"sha":"2afc4b63d842900e04b65e6e492145a3528888da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/2afc4b63d842900e04b65e6e492145a3528888da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/1577f6b610b5c74b8620bc24f74db1b294f5ca57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T18:53:45Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T18:53:45Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"message":"#59: BetterAuth auth — OAuth + Turso sessions + engine JWT\n\nEngine:\n- notebookflow/auth.py: authenticate a request via the static\n  NOTEBOOKFLOW_AUTH_TOKEN OR a BetterAuth JWT verified against\n  NOTEBOOKFLOW_JWKS_URL (cached JWKS; EdDSA/ES256/RS256), sub -> user id.\n  Open when unconfigured (self-host). require_auth returns the AuthPrincipal;\n  /ws verifies the same. Adds pyjwt[crypto].\n- Tests: JWT accept/expiry/bad-sig, static token unchanged, JWKS-only rejects\n  missing token, static+JWT both work, WS with JWT.\n\nWeb-app (TanStack Start + BetterAuth + Drizzle + Turso):\n- lib/auth.ts (GitHub/Google registered only when configured + jwt plugin),\n  lib/auth-client.ts, lib/db (Drizzle schema from @better-auth/cli; libSQL).\n- /api/auth/* mounted via the Vercel function (api/index.ts) in prod and a Vite\n  dev middleware for parity; shared Node<->Web bridge (preserves multi-cookie).\n- /login route (GitHub/Google sign-in, session, sign-out) + landing Sign-in.\n- EngineClient.setToken; App mints a session JWT and presents it to the engine,\n  falling back to the static self-host token when signed out.\n- Drizzle schema pushed to Turso; db:push/generate/studio scripts; .env docs.\n\nValidated live: Turso tables created; /api/auth/jwks returns real EdDSA keys in\ndev and via the handler directly; engine verification unit-tested. The OAuth\nredirect needs GitHub/Google client ids to complete.","tree":{"sha":"ff47bfb580bea2ea39bfd71b8641c5b89f3d163e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/ff47bfb580bea2ea39bfd71b8641c5b89f3d163e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/1577f6b610b5c74b8620bc24f74db1b294f5ca57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/1577f6b610b5c74b8620bc24f74db1b294f5ca57","node_id":"C_kwDOSWT-J9oAKDE1NzdmNmI2MTBiNWM3NGI4NjIwYmMyNGY3NGRiMWIyOTRmNWNhNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commit/af1ef3a698478d41f167ed037f6b9e9fdab5a85f","sha":"af1ef3a698478d41f167ed037f6b9e9fdab5a85f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/af1ef3a698478d41f167ed037f6b9e9fdab5a85f"}],"sha":"1577f6b610b5c74b8620bc24f74db1b294f5ca57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/1577f6b610b5c74b8620bc24f74db1b294f5ca57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44301196?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/af1ef3a698478d41f167ed037f6b9e9fdab5a85f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T18:01:23Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"Noel Huibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T18:01:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"SSR on Vercel via api/ function bridge (experimental) (#90)\n\n* SSR on Vercel: bridge TanStack Start handler via an api/ function\n\nTanStack Start v1 has no Vercel preset, so SSR needs the server handler\nwrapped in a Vercel serverless function:\n- vite.config back to SSR (drop spa); build emits dist/client (assets) +\n  dist/server/server.js (default export = a Web fetch handler).\n- api/index.ts forwards each request to server.fetch() (Vercel Node\n  runtime supports Web Request/Response).\n- vercel.json: outputDirectory dist/client (static assets) + rewrite every\n  route to /api so the function SSRs all pages.\n\nOn a branch to verify the Vercel preview before touching production.\n\n* Fix SSR function: adapt Node req -> absolute Web Request\n\nVercel invokes the function with the Node (req, res) signature, and req.url\nis path-only (\"/\"), so passing it straight to server.fetch() made TanStack\ndo new URL(\"/\") -> ERR_INVALID_URL (FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED). Reconstruct\nan absolute URL (proto + host + req.url) into a Web Request, run the handler,\nand stream the Web Response back onto the Node response. Errors now return a\nreadable stack instead of an opaque 500.","tree":{"sha":"2081c1f45a0b2c5ec8e2613a2fc61ab1d225f28c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/2081c1f45a0b2c5ec8e2613a2fc61ab1d225f28c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/commits/af1ef3a698478d41f167ed037f6b9e9fdab5a85f","verification":{"payload":"tree 2081c1f45a0b2c5ec8e2613a2fc61ab1d225f28c\nparent d7c742fddd89eb264eda71976ca548dfa896dc15\nauthor Noel Huibers <noel@huibers.io> 1782410483 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782410483 +0200\n\nSSR on Vercel via api/ function bridge (experimental) (#90)\n\n* SSR on Vercel: bridge TanStack Start handler via an api/ function\n\nTanStack Start v1 has no Vercel preset, so SSR needs the server handler\nwrapped in a Vercel serverless function:\n- vite.config back to SSR (drop spa); build emits dist/client (assets) +\n  dist/server/server.js (default export = a Web fetch handler).\n- api/index.ts forwards each request to server.fetch() (Vercel Node\n  runtime supports Web Request/Response).\n- vercel.json: outputDirectory dist/client (static assets) + rewrite every\n  route to /api so the function SSRs all pages.\n\nOn a branch to verify the Vercel preview before touching production.\n\n* Fix SSR function: adapt Node req -> absolute Web Request\n\nVercel invokes the function with the Node (req, res) signature, and req.url\nis path-only (\"/\"), so passing it straight to server.fetch() made TanStack\ndo new URL(\"/\") -> ERR_INVALID_URL (FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED). Reconstruct\nan absolute URL (proto + host + req.url) into a Web Request, run the handler,\nand stream the Web Response back onto the Node response. Errors now return a\nreadable stack instead of an opaque 500.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPWzzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALbkQAEiXhsi45R/kl7pzqE4xJwXr\nmWTC+vkG3dqNrgL6cUqyub9MJ9yCyS1ekOsvneyBqzmKuz36n02UHR6JoLMFVEWw\nQ4E6xCIAeWmUhdGlv0EbSLi1KGtp4f9/PXp7PB/rfWRm7aA3YGa858phJNu/gPXK\nA1YHwhmCjwmK7IGrjgc19e/gTmaONuhtDWUXaOi+n4OIcm7GzjQoYu67lf2hRLy+\nKvbaE/Gr+BF6ioa6DzHslqGuxr1OrmBPMb0Fb088ucpk98tvxvnA6GLTitJsj5Pe\n/14C6Dtk6EmNRwukM7sQh3/KIlDPJ/JzhLCopSD7gXHHQ+KIp2jUNUmRWGhiJ63g\nCBXGsd9K3WINxtxNaWhrEB/Su9gHO+vCN+ziZmDlvNLYAtBM1x4kSkPzYl6LNMT8\ngE8VDdRmrfuwmnQgrWvDo0JoQQ2xZ3JAt6TCwbxiA3vU//dsAyCPrymMjNydYLjm\n43OPtiHAzVLWYRW8TmakT+QYcE6rqb/IZTHS2VeXCWG4oOK8FfpAyi0NaPlKEstA\nIt4626OxQgiWw+fa2hFG6MPLm9vVvUV3anVkHKP3Ts+zUnrhI28LR+eVCvRIS5l0\n3P2sjYDUr