b.com/users/NoelHuibers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NoelHuibers","id":44301196,"login":"NoelHuibers","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzAxMTk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoelHuibers","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/commits/d7c742fddd89eb264eda71976ca548dfa896dc15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T17:39:35Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T17:39:35Z","email":"noel@huibers.io","name":"NoelHuibers"},"message":"Fix Vercel 404: deploy TanStack Start in SPA mode (static)\n\nThe SSR build emits no static index.html, so Vercel''s static serve of\ndist/ 404''d every route. TanStack Start v1 has no built-in Vercel/Nitro\npreset, and SSR isn''t needed yet (the editor is client-only; landing +\nlegal are trivial). Switch to SPA mode: tanstackStart({ spa: { enabled:\ntrue } }) emits dist/client/_shell.html + assets, deployed statically.\n\nvercel.json: framework null, outputDirectory dist/client, and a SPA\nrewrite of every route to /_shell.html (filesystem still wins for real\nassets). The router + all routes (/ , /app, /legal/*) keep working\nclient-side. The server for BetterAuth (#59) re-enables SSR and sorts\nthe Vercel server deploy then.","tree":{"sha":"43705a6db3446319108518a31189ce97b2e1770a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NoelHuibers/notebookflow/git/trees/43705a6db3446319108518a31189ce97b2e1770a"},"url":"https://ap