XeyNoAKDc5OTIwNTExMWU4OTRhYTExYjNjMjY1YzIyZTg0NDY0NmZiNWQ2OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/ff489de883fc0f63f1f4c1f9e6587beec1ab24c8","sha":"ff489de883fc0f63f1f4c1f9e6587beec1ab24c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/ff489de883fc0f63f1f4c1f9e6587beec1ab24c8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/984d39342ff02c5280ef06c652c4f477bc5c46de","sha":"984d39342ff02c5280ef06c652c4f477bc5c46de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/984d39342ff02c5280ef06c652c4f477bc5c46de"}],"sha":"799205111e894aa11b3c265c22e844646fb5d694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/799205111e894aa11b3c265c22e844646fb5d694"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw","id":209685,"login":"addisokw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTY4NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/da16dedeb3da04b0be1dc46ac867359c6ebc5618/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T00:45:07Z","email":"ken@kenaddison.com","name":"Ken Addison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T00:45:07Z","email":"ken@kenaddison.com","name":"Ken Addison"},"message":"Operator macro pad: ''#'' codes on the booth phone arm secret modes (#42 = acquit)\n\nWith the court idle, the operator lifts the handset (normally the Dewey gag)\nand presses ''#'': the line falls silent and keyed codes become operator modes.\nCodes commit on ''#'' or 3s of key silence; ''*'' cancels an entry, or with\nnothing pending clears every armed mode. Accept/reject tones confirm on the\nhandset; the case monitor''s menu bar shows the bare code numbers, dim, for\nup-close verification (armed dimmest, latched slightly brighter).\n\nLifecycle: armed modes latch into the next button-press session (armed ->\nactive, armed cleared) and are spent when that trial returns to Idle, so each\narm-set governs exactly one case. E-stop clears everything. Arming is\nidle-only; a mid-trial ''#'' (a defendant fat-fingering during a consult) gets\na 409 from the orchestrator, a reject buzz, and their lawyer back.\n\nArchitecture: counsel is a dumb transmitter (CodeCollector grammar + tones +\none POST per code); the orchestrator is the authority -- a tiny explicit\nregistry (operator_modes.rs), REST surface (GET /operator/modes, POST\n/operator/modes/arm|clear, curl-testable without the phone), latch/reset in\nthe Runtime, and an operator_modes display event + snapshot resync for the\nkiosk indicator (ordered after the trial-start reset so it survives it).\n\nMode 42 (\"innocent\"): the defendant is found NOT GUILTY no matter what.\nTwo layers: a secret prompt directive steers the whole deliberation toward\nacquittal (coherent monologue), and a hard force flips any guilty verdict at\nthe single point before the spoken word, reveal events, face, capture,\nprint, and squirt gate derive from it -- covering the pre-announced path,\nmock mode, and every fallback path (via a forced_innocent flag threaded\nthrough transitions::step like cross_enabled).\n\nThe kiosk indicator sits in the case-header menu bar, deliberately clear of\nthe attract-screen work on feat/case-attract-screen (which only touches\ncase-main).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"176d0aa41efb845107fe3aa22af9caa89614ee3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/176d0aa41efb845107fe3aa22af9caa89614ee3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/da16dedeb3da04b0be1dc46ac867359c6ebc5618","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw","id":209685,"login":"addisokw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTY4NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/da16dedeb3da04b0be1dc46ac867359c6ebc5618","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKGRhMTZkZWRlYjNkYTA0YjBiZTFkYzQ2YWM4NjczNTljNmViYzU2MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/aa6c21f8f10294087e399ec584b8965423c215ce","sha":"aa6c21f8f10294087e399ec584b8965423c215ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/aa6c21f8f10294087e399ec584b8965423c215ce"}],"sha":"da16dedeb3da04b0be1dc46ac867359c6ebc5618","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/da16dedeb3da04b0be1dc46ac867359c6ebc5618"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw","id":209685,"login":"addisokw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTY4NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/984d39342ff02c5280ef06c652c4f477bc5c46de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T23:48:34Z","email":"ken@kenaddison.com","name":"Ken Addison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T23:48:34Z","email":"ken@kenaddison.com","name":"Ken Addison"},"message":"Cross-exam: don''t ring the lawyer phone over the judge''s question\n\nThe CrossSpeaking watchdog was a fixed question_timeout_secs (12 s), but a\ncross-exam question costs synthesis latency plus its spoken length -- often\nmore than 12 s. On long questions the watchdog fired mid-speech, opening the\nanswer window early, and entering that window is what rings the lawyer\nphone: the call landed on top of the judge''s own question.\n\nScale the watchdog with the question text at a conservative TTS pace\n(~12 chars/sec), same idiom as pronounce_watchdog and the charge-display\nwatchdog. The normal path is unchanged -- TtsFinished (browser drain ack,\nor the TTS self-ack timer) still opens the window the moment the question\naudio ends, so the sequence is: judge asks, phone rings, defendant answers.\nThe watchdog remains a last-resort escape for a dead TTS task only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f8ecf83568de343ca5239d65aaf1d287736859b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/4f8ecf83568de343ca5239d65aaf1d287736859b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/984d39342ff02c5280ef06c652c4f477bc5c46de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw","id":209685,"login":"addisokw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTY4NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/984d39342ff02c5280ef06c652c4f477bc5c46de","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDk4NGQzOTM0MmZmMDJjNTI4MGVmMDZjNjUyYzRmNDc3YmM1YzQ2ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/aa6c21f8f10294087e399ec584b8965423c215ce","sha":"aa6c21f8f10294087e399ec584b8965423c215ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/aa6c21f8f10294087e399ec584b8965423c215ce"}],"sha":"984d39342ff02c5280ef06c652c4f477bc5c46de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/984d39342ff02c5280ef06c652c4f477bc5c46de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw","id":209685,"login":"addisokw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTY4NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/328dbe8e4d2082cd2c41cedba613a5e3b2f235f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T23:23:53Z","email":"ken@kenaddison.com","name":"Ken Addison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T23:23:53Z","email":"ken@kenaddison.com","name":"Ken Addison"},"message":"TTS gain: master gain + limiter on the judge voice, tts_gain on the lawyer line\n\nJudge (kiosk): a master GainNode feeding a DynamicsCompressor limiter now\nsits between the robot chain''s tail/glitch stage and the speakers, so the\nvoice can be boosted up to 3x without hard-clipping at the destination.\nGain is a per-persona robot param like the rest of the voice knobs --\npersisted on the host, validated 0..3, broadcast in robot_params, and\nedited from the Judge Mind persona slider (0-300%).\n\nLawyer (counsel): new [audio] tts_gain config knob, applied to the 24 kHz\nPCM before decimation/u-law so it covers every synthesized utterance\n(agent turns and the IVR hold announcement). Samples soft-clip through a\ntanh knee above ~80% full scale instead of wrapping, so modest boosts\nstay clean on the handset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd6404b5c033a57ec9fa2a392c4cb00b8f649e91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/cd6404b5c033a57ec9fa2a392c4cb00b8f649e91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/328dbe8e4d2082cd2c41cedba613a5e3b2f235f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209685?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw","id":209685,"login":"addisokw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTY4NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/addisokw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/328dbe8e4d2082cd2c41cedba613a5e3b2f235f0","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDMyOGRiZThlNGQyMDgyY2QyYzQxY2VkYmE2MTNhNWUzYjJmMjM1ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/aa6c21f8f10294087e399ec584b8965423c215ce","sha":"aa6c21f8f10294087e399ec584b8965423c215ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/aa6c21f8f10294087e399ec584b8965423c215ce"}],"sha":"328dbe8e4d2082cd2c41cedba613a5e3b2f235f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/328dbe8e4d2082cd2c41cedba613a5e3b2f235f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/ff489de883fc0f63f1f4c1f9e6587beec1ab24c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T18:46:29Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T18:46:29Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Event tuning from the live booth\n\nPulled the tuned configs off the Spark mid-event (read-only; the booth kept\nrunning):\n- crimes: 218 -> 280 (62 new crimes curated live)\n- calibration/gavel: strike 700->600, strikes 1->2, faster settle\n- calibration/vision: boresight [320,240]->[317,297], target_part head->chest\n- personas/wettington: robot voice effect off (intensity 0.63->0.0); the\n  verdict-tuned prompt is unchanged\n- personas/