.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/c17982667a756af409ec443751ebac7616fae6cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T14:49:30Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T14:49:30Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Console toggles: attract (F6), coupon frequency (F4), speaker audio (F5)\n\nMake three of the new features live-switchable from the operator console instead\nof config+restart, following the existing cross-exam toggle pattern:\n- F6 attract: Arc<AtomicBool> read by the Runtime; /operator/attract; checkbox in\n  the Judge''s Mind tab.\n- F4 coupons: Arc<AtomicU8> read fresh per receipt by the print service;\n  /operator/coupons; dropdown (off/rare/sometimes/always) in the Print tab.\n- F5 speaker audio: Arc<AtomicBool> gating the /lawyer/audio handler;\n  /operator/lawyer_speaker; checkbox in the Lawyer tab.\nConfig still seeds the startup value. F7 neck droop left config-only (motion\nsafety). Build + 147 tests + frontend build all green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"6369b0af51bd16538d0b19e405509b4623b305b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/6369b0af51bd16538d0b19e405509b4623b305b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/c17982667a756af409ec443751ebac7616fae6cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","followin