"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/94f8199f4a3de02152f0bb9a8c254f6972442591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T17:31:38Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T17:31:38Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Crimes: per-category draw toggles + full-width Judge Mind editors\n\n- disabled_categories replaces the single draw-only filter, persisted in\n  the crimes file so e.g. creator crimes stay off across booth restarts;\n  POST /operator/crimes/filter -> /operator/crimes/categories (full set)\n- console: category toggle chips with enabled counts, per-chip \"only\" and\n  \"all on\" shortcuts, live draw-pool size, empty-pool warning\n- Judge Mind tab: one full-width editor at a time behind a Persona/Crimes\n  switcher (both stay mounted so edits survive switching), and one\n  page-level scroll instead of the nested 70vh/40vh panel scrollboxes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"5630acda7f30c705d0706945b071982500185c35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/5630acda7f30c705d0706945b071982500185c35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/94f8199f4a3de02152f0bb9a8c254f6972442591","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcj