om/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/6aa550ae1c503a02c32e5722e8e0ae698aeff4f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T04:36:37Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Printer: pre-wrap over-width lines in flip mode\n\nFlip build() reverses whole segments, so a line the printer auto-wrapped\nprinted its halves in reading order inside one segment - flipped, the\nsecond half read first (seen on the verdict remarks). line() now measures\nthe current style''s capacity (font cell x GS ! width magnification) and\ncloses one segment per physical line, wrapping at word boundaries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"76ad36081212b023f41d14a44bab48a754486b21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/76ad36081212b023f41d14a44bab48a754486b21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/6aa550ae1c503a02c32e5722e8e0ae698aeff4f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":