i.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/e8585392a80cbf0bfa3cff01f46a6d841127978d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T04:36:30Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Console: e-stop silences TTS mid-word, plea auto-starts, audio check tab\n\n- E-stop emits CancelSpeech: the inference loop aborts every in-flight\n  task (the detached TTS/verdict streams kept pumping PCM), and the\n  frontend now tracks scheduled buffer sources so reset hard-stops\n  playback on the console and audio viewers alike.\n- The mic opens the moment the plea/answer window does - no Plead press.\n  P still toggles, the button still closes early, reconnect restarts the\n  mic; an auto-start mic failure leaves the window open instead of\n  conceding the plea.\n- New Audio tab: speaker beep + full-path judge-voice test\n  (POST /operator/audio/tts_test, idle-gated), live mic level meter +\n  record-and-transcribe STT round trip (POST /operator/audio/stt_test).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"527094936ec32861d7640fc9ce6f6bfbe7dec3f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/527094936ec32861d7640fc9ce6f6bfbe7dec3f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/e8585392a80cbf0bfa3cff01f46a6d841127978d","verification":{"paylo