tCourt/commit/f879ed7623fe50a79fb004fb9bb73fe4748a246c","sha":"f879ed7623fe50a79fb004fb9bb73fe4748a246c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/f879ed7623fe50a79fb004fb9bb73fe4748a246c"}],"sha":"98c7c03c40fa7afeb4743e357d99373a281df807","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/98c7c03c40fa7afeb4743e357d99373a281df807"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/f879ed7623fe50a79fb004fb9bb73fe4748a246c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T03:44:16Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Neck follow: tunable scale + mirror for the judge''s turret tracking\n\nThe neck followed the turret''s tracking aim 1:1 (and backwards). New\noptional [follow] calibration on judge_neck — per-axis scale (0-2) and\nmirror flags — applied wherever the neck follows the shared aim: the\nlive vision relay, recenter/fallback glides, and the freeze fallback.\nThe FaceAim catchlight fan-out gets the transformed pose. Console-\ntunable from the Judge tab''s calibration editor. Seeded at half scale\nwith pan mirrored so the head turns the way the gun does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"b7c478bf0b605a687403d118ae22496c2729b6be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/b7c478bf0b605a687403d118ae22496c2729b6be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/f879ed7623fe50a79fb004fb9bb73fe4748a246c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/f879ed7623fe50a79fb004fb9bb73fe4748a246c","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKGY4NzllZDc2MjNmZTUwYTc5ZmIwMDRmYjliYjczZmU0NzQ4YTI0NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/1873c42a8e01d4a3b8da300d43b9b29e856251b8","sha":"1873c42a8e01d4a3b8da300d43b9b29e856251b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/1873c42a8e01d4a3b8da300d43b9b29e856251b8"}],"sha":"f879ed7623fe50a79fb004fb9bb73fe4748a246c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/f879ed7623fe50a79fb004fb9bb73fe4748a246c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/1873c42a8e01d4a3b8da300d43b9b29e856251b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T03:10:26Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Bench tuning: neck pan range, squirt pulse, lawyer TTS pace\n\nConsole-saved calibration from bench sessions: judge-neck pan limits\nwidened to ±135°, squirt test-fire pulse 30 → 50 ms, and Dewey Stubb\nslowed to 1.3× so the greeting lands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"d027b85c14dd028e72cb5a11658e173763e3fe35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/d027b85c14dd028e72cb5a11658e173763e3fe35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/1873c42a8e01d4a3b8da300d43b9b29e856251b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/1873c42a8e01d4a3b8da300d43b9b29e856251b8","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDE4NzNjNDJhOGUwMWQ0YTNiOGRhMzAwZDQzYjliMjllODU2MjUxYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/80169d8b79b72c899f882876f977d0ccfe5012ef","sha":"80169d8b79b72c899f882876f977d0ccfe5012ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/80169d8b79b72c899f882876f977d0ccfe5012ef"}],"sha":"1873c42a8e01d4a3b8da300d43b9b29e856251b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/1873c42a8e01d4a3b8da300d43b9b29e856251b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/80169d8b79b72c899f882876f977d0ccfe5012ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T02:28:01Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Discovery: fleet finds the orchestrator via UDP beacon (no hardcoded IPs)\n\nThe orchestrator''s TCP driver broadcasts `WETCOURT <spec> <tcp_port>` every\n~2 s ([hardware] beacon_port, default 8091, 0 disables). Firmware with no\nORCH_HOST configured listens for it — IP from the datagram''s source, TCP\nport from the payload — and re-discovers after repeated dial failures, so\nthe fleet follows the orchestrator across machines and DHCP renumbering\nwith no reflash. An explicit ORCH_HOST stays a hard override that never\nlistens (show rigs; two orchestrators on one LAN).\n\n- wetline.py: blocking ~8 s listen between dial attempts (OTA + the tick\n  hook stay serviced), target cached, 3 consecutive dial failures trigger\n  re-discovery. ORCH_HOST/ORCH_PORT are now optional in secrets.py.\n- judge-face (fw 0.5): non-blocking beacon pump from the render loop''s\n  poll() — a persistent UDP socket drained each frame while disconnected,\n  so discovery never hitches the animation; a beacon from a moved host\n  retargets the next dial immediately. Net-probe now reports against the\n  effective target.\n- Discovery section added to the protocol spec; secrets/settings examples\n  and READMEs updated across the fleet (ORCH_HOST unset = discover).\n\nWire-verified: beacon heard on the LAN, discovered address dialed, HELLO\naccepted — no configured host anywhere in the client.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"8f6f5d641e4df2eff86829d40b2c9737d96674d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/8f6f5d641e4df2eff86829d40b2c9737d96674d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/80169d8b79b72c899f882876f977d0ccfe5012ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/80169d8b79b72c899f882876f977d0ccfe5012ef","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDgwMTY5ZDhiNzliNzJjODk5Zjg4Mjg3NmY5NzdkMGNjZmU1MDEyZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/47d54134824d2f426f2ae51955e804f5d9d70583","sha":"47d54134824d2f426f2ae51955e804f5d9d70583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/47d54134824d2f426f2ae51955e804f5d9d70583"}],"sha":"80169d8b79b72c899f882876f977d0ccfe5012ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/80169d8b79b72c899f882876f977d0ccfe5012ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/47d54134824d2f426f2ae51955e804f5d9d70583/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T01:49:56Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Swear-in: trial integration — press-to-start, done-talking, lamp cues\n\nThe button joins the trial (integration-plan Phase 6 items 28-30, verified\nlive against the real board):\n\n- Event::DefendantButton: the swear-in connection''s BUTTON (any other\n  role''s is dropped). From Idle it starts a trial exactly like\n  OperatorStart; during an open plea/cross-answer window it means \"I''m\n  done talking\" and closes the window early down the existing flush path,\n  ignored while the countdown is paused on the lawyer phone. All other\n  states ignore it.\n- FSM lamp cues on state edges: Idle entry (trial end / e-stop /\n  maintenance exit) blinks the attract cue, trial start + maintenance\n  entry go dark, plea/answer windows pulse, window close darkens. A\n  resync watcher (mirroring the face PERSONA replay) restores the right\n  lamp when the board (re)connects, keyed off the is_idle/maintenance\n  mirrors.\n- LED routes as a cosmetic verb: fire-and-forget, silently skipped when\n  the board is absent, so its ack can never steal gating-ack timing.\n- The casebook draft now opens on the actual Idle->GeneratingCharge edge\n  instead of every OperatorStart, so a mid-trial press (or stray console\n  start) can no longer clobber the live draft.\n- Console simulate-press posts the new /operator/defendant_press, keeping\n  it faithful to a wire BUTTON.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"9098479947049e8fd83887f8bf0df3dacc751027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/9098479947049e8fd83887f8bf0df3dacc751027"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/47d54134824d2f426f2ae51955e804f5d9d70583","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/47d54134824d2f426f2ae51955e804f5d9d70583","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDQ3ZDU0MTM0ODI0ZDJmNDI2ZjJhZTUxOTU1ZTgwNGY1ZDlkNzA1ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/e0521c9bbd5f3c6cc0b46eaeaa6bdd3bb697e87a","sha":"e0521c9bbd5f3c6cc0b46eaeaa6bdd3bb697e87a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/e0521c9bbd5f3c6cc0b46eaeaa6bdd3bb697e87a"}],"sha":"47d54134824d2f426f2ae51955e804f5d9d70583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/47d54134824d2f426f2ae51955e804f5d9d70583"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/e0521c9bbd5f3c6cc0b46eaeaa6bdd3bb697e87a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T01:32:37Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Swear-in: console bringup tab (LED drive + live press indicator)\n\nHost side of the button, wire-verified end-to-end with a scripted fake\ndevice: Role::SwearIn (both HELLO spellings), HardwareCommand::Led with\nthe led CmdSpec (400 on unknown modes), and the mock driver seeding the\nrole. Every wire BUTTON now also broadcasts DisplayEvent::ButtonPressed\nfrom the TCP registry, so the console sees presses even while the FSM\nignores them (maintenance mode) — the bringup signal for switch +\ndebounce.\n\nConsole: a Swear-in hardware tab with lamp mode buttons + ack chips,\nPing, a flashing press counter fed by the broadcast, and a simulate-press\nthat injects the trial-start event.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"16067faa90e2f6fac2aac30047b98b475305812f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/16067faa90e2f6fac2aac30047b98b475305812f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/e0521c9bbd5f3c6cc0b46eaeaa6bdd3bb697e87a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/e0521c9bbd5f3c6cc0b46eaeaa6bdd3bb697e87a","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKGUwNTIxYzliYmQ1ZjNjNmNjMGI0NmVhZWFhNmJkZDNiYjY5N2U4N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/e55529af9909277761827a1e055284cbb6eb6f72","sha":"e55529af9909277761827a1e055284cbb6eb6f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/e55529af9909277761827a1e055284cbb6eb6f72"}],"sha":"e0521c9bbd5f3c6cc0b46eaeaa6bdd3bb697e87a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/e0521c9bbd5f3c6cc0b46eaeaa6bdd3bb697e87a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/e55529af9909277761827a1e055284cbb6eb6f72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T01:32:26Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Swear-in: arcade-button firmware (fw 0.1, hardware-verified)\n\nThe defendant''s one physical control, filling the protocol''s reserved\nswear-in role on a NanoC6: switch on G1 (internal pull-up), the button''s\nlamp on G2 (1 kHz PWM). Emits a debounced BUTTON per press (>=250 ms\napart, dropped while the link is down); owns the new LED verb\n(off|on|blink|pulse) so the host cues when pressing means something. The\nlamp is forced dark offline and every press gets a 150 ms local flash.\n\nwetline.py grows an optional tick(send) hook — called with a live sender\nwhile connected, None while down — so a board can scan inputs, animate\noutputs, and emit unsolicited events without owning the serve loop; the\nswear-in is the first event-emitting device.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"cee07542799c1efc3ec4bde5b50e2b5f661296a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/cee07542799c1efc3ec4bde5b50e2b5f661296a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/e55529af9909277761827a1e055284cbb6eb6f72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/e55529af9909277761827a1e055284cbb6eb6f72","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKGU1NTUyOWFmOTkwOTI3Nzc2MTgyN2ExZTA1NTI4NGNiYjZlYjZmNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/71463872c163b441e71096b718168b86a44c99c3","sha":"71463872c163b441e71096b718168b86a44c99c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/71463872c163b441e71096b718168b86a44c99c3"}],"sha":"e55529af9909277761827a1e055284cbb6eb6f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/e55529af9909277761827a1e055284cbb6eb6f72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/71463872c163b441e71096b718168b86a44c99c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T02:35:22Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Judge-face: port to Matrix Portal S3 (fw 0.4, hardware-verified)\n\nNative wifi/socketpool/mdns replace the AirLift stack — the NINA\ndotted-quad workaround, socknum liveness probes, and hard-reset recovery\nall delete; peer closes now surface as EOF. The board gets a network\nname (judge-face.local + DHCP judge-face.lan) and lib/ shrinks to just\nadafruit_ticks.\n\nCircuitPython''s core hashlib has no named constructors (new(\"sha256\")\nonly) — found on hardware when every push died at OTAFILE and the\nescaping AttributeError tore down the listener into a ~2min TIME_WAIT\nblackout. _sha256() now probes the API shape at import, handler\nexceptions cost one client instead of the listener, and the listener\nbinds with SO_REUSEADDR. Desktop suite gained regressions for both.\n\nOTALOG grows live RSSI, the last OTA server error, and the CPU reset\nreason (boot=) — a surprise brownout reboot is now remotely tellable\nfrom an OTA commit reset. Verified end-to-end on the booth unit: full\n6-file push over WiFi, committed, back on the LAN in 8s, boot=SOFTWARE.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"031098535eae643db95200c10222834d1f68c93f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/031098535eae643db95200c10222834d1f68c93f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/71463872c163b441e71096b718168b86a44c99c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/71463872c163b441e71096b718168b86a44c99c3","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDcxNDYzODcyYzE2M2I0NDFlNzEwOTZiNzE4MTY4Yjg2YTQ0Yzk5YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/5927dcf281f0974bb2d72a8e0c35aa94ab38c1a4","sha":"5927dcf281f0974bb2d72a8e0c35aa94ab38c1a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/5927dcf281f0974bb2d72a8e0c35aa94ab38c1a4"}],"sha":"71463872c163b441e71096b718168b86a44c99c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/71463872c163b441e71096b718168b86a44c99c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/5927dcf281f0974bb2d72a8e0c35aa94ab38c1a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T00:26:17Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Vision: loop recorded footage through the pipeline (--video)\n\n--video <file> / BOOTH_VISION_VIDEO replaces the camera with a looping\nvideo file through the FULL pipeline — detection, the id tracker,\nclick-to-select, the aim servo, the orchestrator aim stream — paced to\nthe file''s native FPS so wall-clock behaviors (track TTL, lock dwell)\nact as they would live. This is the desk rehearsal for the hard event\nscenario: defendant at the mic, people milling behind — verify stable\ntrack ids, that selection sticks to the defendant, and that a\nselected-but-lost track HOLDS the gun rather than migrating. README\nnotes the limit: a recording can''t test closed-loop convergence (the\ncamera doesn''t ride the gun), and documents the fallback-aim behavior\nalongside the tuning-persistence flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"c3e28c6e3dc8759d11b6e717da1884cf401130f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/c3e28c6e3dc8759d11b6e717da1884cf401130f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/5927dcf281f0974bb2d72a8e0c35aa94ab38c1a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/5927dcf281f0974bb2d72a8e0c35aa94ab38c1a4","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDU5MjdkY2YyODFmMDk3NGJiMmQ3MmE4ZTBjMzVhYTk0YWIzOGMxYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/1f0b91381a5c9c32a8425ee4fb341e9de3f1c75e","sha":"1f0b91381a5c9c32a8425ee4fb341e9de3f1c75e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/1f0b91381a5c9c32a8425ee4fb341e9de3f1c75e"}],"sha":"5927dcf281f0974bb2d72a8e0c35aa94ab38c1a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/5927dcf281f0974bb2d72a8e0c35aa94ab38c1a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/1f0b91381a5c9c32a8425ee4fb341e9de3f1c75e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T00:26:02Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Targeting: eased recenter glides + vision-failure fallback aim\n\nReturning to rest used to be a single servo-speed AIM snap — most\nvisibly when leaving maintenance mode (Maintenance → Idle recenters the\nrig). TargetingController now owns a glide engine: it tracks the last\nlogical aim sent per role (vision stream, console AIM, glides) and eases\nto a target with a smoothstep profile at 30°/s peak, streaming turret +\njudge-neck + catchlight in lockstep. Trial idle, maintenance exit, and\nthe console Recenter all glide calmly to center now; any live aim\nsource (vision arming, a console AIM) cancels an in-flight glide via a\ngeneration counter so two sources never fight over the servos.\n\nNew in the saved vision tuning: fallback_aim [pan°, tilt°], sighted just\nabove the defendant mic from the Vision panel (\"aim there\" button,\nmaintenance-gated) and persisted by Save tuning. With it set: vision\ndown at Acquire → the gun and the judge''s gaze glide there and wait\nout the deliberation; still no fresh lock at Freeze → aim it and open\nthe fire gate for that one shot, so a guilty sentence lands on the\nfixed spot instead of being silently held. Unset keeps the fail-safe:\nno lock, no fire.\n\nVerified against the mock driver: maintenance exit and /vision/center\nstream decelerating AIMs into each role''s own calibrated center.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"bec72fa2833dba98b055aad4e76cb03041add8e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/bec72fa2833dba98b055aad4e76cb03041add8e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/1f0b91381a5c9c32a8425ee4fb341e9de3f1c75e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/1f0b91381a5c9c32a8425ee4fb341e9de3f1c75e","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDFmMGI5MTM4MWE1YzljMzJhODQyNWVlNGZiMzQxZTlkZTNmMWM3NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/ffff812f48780e3e5cc570148a61fb24ba9aa108","sha":"ffff812f48780e3e5cc570148a61fb24ba9aa108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/ffff812f48780e3e5cc570148a61fb24ba9aa108"}],"sha":"1f0b91381a5c9c32a8425ee4fb341e9de3f1c75e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/1f0b91381a5c9c32a8425ee4fb341e9de3f1c75e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/ffff812f48780e3e5cc570148a61fb24ba9aa108/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T00:25:45Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Console: ease-in/out for the smooth aim glide\n\nThe smooth mode''s constant-rate linear stepper becomes an acceleration-\nlimited motion profile: accelerate in over ~0.3 s, cruise at the rate-\nslider speed, brake into the target on a √(2a·d) envelope. Velocity-\ncarrying (not a time curve) on purpose — stick input retargets every\nframe, and this stays fluid through retargets where a restarted ease\ncurve would stutter. Glide state integrates unrounded so gentle ease-in\nsteps can''t stall under the wire stream''s tenth-degree rounding.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"c6a2fbf08e55b6abf099a8e634406549879d4126","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/c6a2fbf08e55b6abf099a8e634406549879d4126"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/ffff812f48780e3e5cc570148a61fb24ba9aa108","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/ffff812f48780e3e5cc570148a61fb24ba9aa108","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKGZmZmY4MTJmNDg3ODBlM2U1Y2M1NzAxNDhhNjFmYjI0YmE5YWExMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/9d31e7affd800f865bff6fab3e5bb3da5fb2bac5","sha":"9d31e7affd800f865bff6fab3e5bb3da5fb2bac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/9d31e7affd800f865bff6fab3e5bb3da5fb2bac5"}],"sha":"ffff812f48780e3e5cc570148a61fb24ba9aa108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/ffff812f48780e3e5cc570148a61fb24ba9aa108"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/9d31e7affd800f865bff6fab3e5bb3da5fb2bac5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T20:51:51Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Vision: persist targeting tuning host-side with deliberate Save\n\nGains/tolerance/boresight/target lived only in the vision process''s\nmemory (seeded from CLI flags), so every restart silently reverted the\nconsole''s tuning. Now they persist like the servo calibrations: a new\nVisionCal section under calibration role \"vision\" (vision.toml), tuned\nlive from the Vision panel and written by an explicit Save.\n\nThe orchestrator watches vision /health and re-pushes the saved tuning\n(/gains, /boresight, /target) on every offline→online transition —\norchestrator launch or a vision crash/restart — and never while it stays\nup, so live unsaved experiments aren''t clobbered by a reconcile. The\ntrial Acquire cue now targets the saved part (chest|head; \"none\" is\nrejected — a guilty verdict must always have something to lock onto),\nand the auto-fire dwell seeds from the same file (the enabled flag is\ndeliberately not persisted).\n\nConsole: Save tuning / Re-apply saved buttons with an unsaved-changes\nwarning, mirroring the device panels'' Apply/Save flow. Verified end to\nend against a stub vision process: seed on launch, re-seed after a\nbounce, save via REST, re-seed with the updated values.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"edbfe5b3f10345fd6aff729722cef8976d8bda67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/edbfe5b3f10345fd6aff729722cef8976d8bda67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/9d31e7affd800f865bff6fab3e5bb3da5fb2bac5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/9d31e7affd800f865bff6fab3e5bb3da5fb2bac5","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDlkMzFlN2FmZmQ4MDBmODY1YmZmNmZhYjNlNWJiM2RhNWZiMmJhYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/304d9e86eb3c175882603987cfa186e74246bcd9","sha":"304d9e86eb3c175882603987cfa186e74246bcd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/304d9e86eb3c175882603987cfa186e74246bcd9"}],"sha":"9d31e7affd800f865bff6fab3e5bb3da5fb2bac5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/9d31e7affd800f865bff6fab3e5bb3da5fb2bac5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/304d9e86eb3c175882603987cfa186e74246bcd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T20:51:33Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Judge-face: document the dead-face troubleshooting ladder\n\nFrom the 2026-07-12 incident: panel blank AND absent from the LAN means\ncode.py never ran (safe mode / power / corrupted FAT) — a Python bug\ncan''t produce that combination, so don''t start by reading firmware\ndiffs. One RESET press fixed it (safe mode, likely a brownout from the\nHUB75 panel''s draw). Documents the symptom table (animating-but-\nunregistered vs frozen vs traceback vs blank), the LAN sweep from the\norchestrator host, and the reset → serial console → UP+reset redeploy\nrecovery ladder.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"0ae3526a574470642962f2ab39bd7fd95cac453e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/0ae3526a574470642962f2ab39bd7fd95cac453e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/304d9e86eb3c175882603987cfa186e74246bcd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/304d9e86eb3c175882603987cfa186e74246bcd9","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDMwNGQ5ZTg2ZWIzYzE3NTg4MjYwMzk4N2NmYTE4NmU3NDI0NmJjZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/651efcdce4cbcfdb99cbe132216785b689de194a","sha":"651efcdce4cbcfdb99cbe132216785b689de194a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/651efcdce4cbcfdb99cbe132216785b689de194a"}],"sha":"304d9e86eb3c175882603987cfa186e74246bcd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/304d9e86eb3c175882603987cfa186e74246bcd9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/651efcdce4cbcfdb99cbe132216785b689de194a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T20:51:24Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Printer: rotate every print 180° for the upside-down booth mount\n\nNew [printer] upside_down flag (on in both configs). Builder::with_flip\nrecords content as segments — one per printed line / feed / raster / QR /\nbarcode, each with a full style snapshot — and build() replays them in\nreverse under ESC { 1 (per-line 180° rotation), so the emerging receipt\nreads top-down in the mount. Style snapshots re-emit per segment because\nreordering would otherwise tear apart stateful on/off pairs.\n\nRasters (seal, moment-of-justice photo) are pre-rotated in software:\nGS v 0 is not affected by upside-down mode per the ESC/POS spec — if this\nclone rotates them itself they''ll print flipped relative to text; verify\nwith one keepsake. Native QR is left alone (scans at any rotation). Cuts\nstay physically last via a trailer.\n\nBounded custom strips emit their fill feed FIRST in flip mode — segment\nreversal lands it back in front of the cut, preserving the blade\nclearance that keeps the last printed line on the receipt — and the\nadvance ledger is now summed in a pure pre-pass (advance_of) so the fill\ncan be placed on either side. Console previews bypass the Builder and\nstay right-side up. Non-flip output is byte-identical (tested).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"67fec4f9f055be2c64a6f5374103b2aa8cca6f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/67fec4f9f055be2c64a6f5374103b2aa8cca6f50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/651efcdce4cbcfdb99cbe132216785b689de194a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/651efcdce4cbcfdb99cbe132216785b689de194a","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDY1MWVmY2RjZTRjYmNmZGI5OWNiZTEzMjIxNjc4NWI2ODlkZTE5NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/0f98090616d387c0afcb5753e38d59327fe07c33","sha":"0f98090616d387c0afcb5753e38d59327fe07c33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/0f98090616d387c0afcb5753e38d59327fe07c33"}],"sha":"651efcdce4cbcfdb99cbe132216785b689de194a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/651efcdce4cbcfdb99cbe132216785b689de194a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/0f98090616d387c0afcb5753e38d59327fe07c33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T20:51:07Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Gavel: strike on the verdict reveal, not when deliberation starts\n\nThe FSM pushed GAVEL unconditionally on entering PronouncingVerdict — the\nmoment the deliberation TTS began, a full monologue before the verdict.\nThe eye flip was already deferred to the reveal beat for exactly this\nspoiler; the gavel wasn''t.\n\nNew Event::VerdictRevealed: the pre_announced verdict service fires it at\nits reveal moment (with the FACE flip, as the verdict word starts), and\nthe FSM emits the gavel from PronouncingVerdict — through the hardware\nadapter, so the strike keeps its console-tuned gavel.toml geometry (a\nmaintenance-channel send would bypass that rewrite). The fallback path\nstill strikes immediately; it reveals immediately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"5eef6544e5b023d8ce8f397498b136735026bc78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/5eef6544e5b023d8ce8f397498b136735026bc78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/0f98090616d387c0afcb5753e38d59327fe07c33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/0f98090616d387c0afcb5753e38d59327fe07c33","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDBmOTgwOTA2MTZkMzg3YzBhZmNiNTc1M2UzOGQ1OTMyN2ZlMDdjMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/82be016cc58280facf82a19e5c57827256d3d565","sha":"82be016cc58280facf82a19e5c57827256d3d565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/82be016cc58280facf82a19e5c57827256d3d565"}],"sha":"0f98090616d387c0afcb5753e38d59327fe07c33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/0f98090616d387c0afcb5753e38d59327fe07c33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/82be016cc58280facf82a19e5c57827256d3d565/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T18:44:15Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Printer: calibrate the LAN unit — exact strip lengths and image tone\n\nFixed-length strips printed short (50mm came out 46.1): three measured\nstrips fit actual = 0.06128mm/unit x units + 2.65mm, i.e. this clone''s\nmotion unit is 1/414.5\" (not the Epson 1/360\") and the cutter self-feeds\n~2.65mm before every partial cut. New [printer] cut_advance_dots knob\nshortens the closing fill by the cutter''s own advance; dev config gets\nthe measured constants (414 upi, 127-dot dead zone, 21-dot cut advance).\nConfirmed bang-on at 50mm and 80mm.\n\nImages printed dark with shadows crushed to solid black (thermal dot\ngain). The raster pipeline''s tone controls were stuck at neutral —\nexpose them end to end: per-printer defaults ([printer] image_gamma /\nimage_brightness / image_contrast / image_dither) applied to custom\nprints, console previews, and the keepsake capture photo, plus per-image\noverrides on the Image block (panel inputs; blank = printer default).\nLadder-calibrated winner for this head: atkinson, gamma 0.5, contrast\n0.85.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EQksTYzZa8a3WpQ5Re7rqz","tree":{"sha":"9c10038d8df4b60147f38f352bc02cc65bd3646b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/9c10038d8df4b60147f38f352bc02cc65bd3646b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/82be016cc58280facf82a19e5c57827256d3d565","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/82be016cc58280facf82a19e5c57827256d3d565","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDgyYmUwMTZjYzU4MjgwZmFjZjgyYTE5ZTVjNTc4MjcyNTZkM2Q1NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/030ad6baa6a776573606aa7396f6bdbf50a2d681","sha":"030ad6baa6a776573606aa7396f6bdbf50a2d681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/030ad6baa6a776573606aa7396f6bdbf50a2d681"}],"sha":"82be016cc58280facf82a19e5c57827256d3d565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/82be016cc58280facf82a19e5c57827256d3d565"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/030ad6baa6a776573606aa7396f6bdbf50a2d681/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T04:38:54Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Vision: click-to-aim and click-to-track on the console feed\n\nTwo feed-click modes join set-boresight on the Vision tab. \"Aim here\"\npoints the gun at a clicked pixel: the camera rides the gun, so a static\npixel can''t feed the closed-loop servo — each click is a one-shot\nopen-loop nudge instead (boresight error x the tuned deg/px gains,\nclamped to 20°/click, held aim streamed ~0.8s with fire_ok false; click\nagain to refine). \"Select person\" locks the servo onto an individual.\n\nThat needed identity: detection now runs multi-person (--max-poses,\ndefault 4) through a greedy nearest-centroid tracker with stable ids,\ndrawn as labeled boxes on the feed. Selection hit-tests the click\n(near-misses snap to the nearest person; far misses change nothing); a\nselected-but-lost track HOLDS the gun rather than migrating to a\nbystander, and any fresh /target acquisition — including the trial''s\nAcquire cue — clears a leftover selection so a trial can never inherit\na stale operator target. With no selection the servo now takes the\ntrack nearest the boresight instead of an arbitrary first pose.\n\nPanel: FEED CLICK mode row, selection badge with clear button, arm\nhint; orchestrator grows /vision/aimpoint + /vision/select\npassthroughs. Tracker + endpoint tests in vision/test_click_modes.py;\nverified pixel-exact end-to-end through the proxy with a headless\nbrowser (disarmed throughout).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0692d3391c7b5823b01af06b0d2caf1a826d7e58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/0692d3391c7b5823b01af06b0d2caf1a826d7e58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/030ad6baa6a776573606aa7396f6bdbf50a2d681","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/030ad6baa6a776573606aa7396f6bdbf50a2d681","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDAzMGFkNmJhYTZhNzc2NTczNjA2YWE3Mzk2ZjZiZGJmNTBhMmQ2ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/328830c680f01a8620c97b01b35b54806b52c687","sha":"328830c680f01a8620c97b01b35b54806b52c687","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/328830c680f01a8620c97b01b35b54806b52c687"}],"sha":"030ad6baa6a776573606aa7396f6bdbf50a2d681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/030ad6baa6a776573606aa7396f6bdbf50a2d681"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/328830c680f01a8620c97b01b35b54806b52c687/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T04:10:35Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Console: optional smooth glide for neck/turret aim\n\nA \"smooth\" checkbox on the maintenance aim controls turns slider, stick,\nand Center input into targets: a 30 Hz loop streams intermediate AIMs\ntoward them at an adjustable rate (5-180°/s, default 45) — gentler on\nthe mechanics than servo-speed jumps when testing large moves. The µs\nread-out tracks the sent position so glides are visible in raw units;\nthe stream goes quiet once settled, and unchecking mid-glide finishes\nthe move immediately. Off = direct sends, exactly as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"797abe5bf14a225155003ccf72929db0f03ef25b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/797abe5bf14a225155003ccf72929db0f03ef25b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/328830c680f01a8620c97b01b35b54806b52c687","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/328830c680f01a8620c97b01b35b54806b52c687","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDMyODgzMGM2ODBmMDFhODYyMGM5N2IwMWIzNWI1NDgwNmI1MmM2ODc","parents":[{"html_ur