"tree":{"sha":"0de389ea69900e87f3518fa675b498676ee6ee07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/0de389ea69900e87f3518fa675b498676ee6ee07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/bf4be87a51a426dd49a86693d5b35f6137ffe08d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/bf4be87a51a426dd49a86693d5b35f6137ffe08d","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKGJmNGJlODdhNTFhNDI2ZGQ0OWE4NjY5M2Q1YjM1ZjYxMzdmZmUwOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/106eaac95258297336be49714bfdba2506335ad1","sha":"106eaac95258297336be49714bfdba2506335ad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/106eaac95258297336be49714bfdba2506335ad1"}],"sha":"bf4be87a51a426dd49a86693d5b35f6137ffe08d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/bf4be87a51a426dd49a86693d5b35f6137ffe08d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/106eaac95258297336be49714bfdba2506335ad1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T04:00:51Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Judge-face: fix the orchestrator dial — the link never actually worked\n\nThe vendored esp32spi socketpool mangles a dotted-quad string dest in\nSocket.connect(): the NINA NAKs START_CLIENT_TCP (\"Expected 01 but got\n00\") and no SYN ever leaves the radio. Resolve to 4 IP bytes and connect\nat the esp layer instead (send/recv keep using the Socket wrapper —\nconnection state lives in the NINA, keyed by socknum). Diagnosed and\ndeployed entirely over the new OTA channel: OTALOG surfaced the NAK, the\nlayered net probe proved DNS + raw TCP fine and isolated the wrapper.\n\nAlso: drop the ICMP ping gate (advisory at best, and the orchestrator\nhost may legitimately drop ping); redial after 2 minutes of rx silence —\nwith OTA sharing the radio, NINA''s recycled socket numbers can make a\ndead link look alive to the socket_connected probe forever; and close\nthe socket when a dial fails instead of leaking a NINA socknum per\nattempt. fw 0.2 -> 0.3. Verified live: judge_face registers and stays\nregistered through idle-refresh redials.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98a7fad6d21146ef7b7ac27e09c890d505cdc5bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/98a7fad6d21146ef7b7ac27e09c890d505cdc5bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/106eaac95258297336be49714bfdba2506335ad1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/106eaac95258297336be49714bfdba2506335ad1","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDEwNmVhYWM5NTI1ODI5NzMzNmJlNDk3MTRiZmRiYTI1MDYzMzVhZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/67fc1eb20058151475ad45556843dcd837a05dfa","sha":"67fc1eb20058151475ad45556843dcd837a05dfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/67fc1eb20058151475ad45556843dcd837a05dfa"}],"sha":"106eaac95258297336be49714bfdba2506335ad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/106eaac95258297336be49714bfdba2506335ad1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/67fc1eb20058151475ad45556843dcd837a05dfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T04:00:51Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Judge-face: WiFi OTA updates (CircuitPython port of the fleet OTA)\n\nSame staged/verified protocol and otapush.py client as the NanoC6s:\ntoken-gated listener, chunks staged to *.new, every file''s size + sha256\nverified before an atomic swap, boot.py refused, dropped connections\nclean up. Platform deltas: the listener rides the orchestrator link''s\nAirLift radio and re-arms after a wedge hard-reset (radio_epoch); digests\naccumulate as chunks arrive (M4 builds may lack native hashlib — an\nembedded pure-Python SHA-256 is the fallback) so commits never outlast\nthe pusher''s timeout; and a new boot.py arbitrates the CIRCUITPY drive —\ncode-writable by default so OTA works, host-writable when UP is held at\nreset (deploy.sh probes and says so). OTALOG reports the link''s last\nerror + a one-shot net probe: a remote serial console for a zip-tied\nboard, and how the dial bug in the next commit was found.\n\notapush.py learns settings.toml credentials (no secrets.py on\nCircuitPython boards) and per-board default file sets via otafiles.txt;\npush to the face''s IP (no mDNS on the AirLift). A desktop harness drives\nthe real pusher against the real ota.py over fake AirLift sockets:\nend-to-end push, every failure path, and listener re-arm.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21ca1c35cd11931d03c74027226b12c44887966b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/21ca1c35cd11931d03c74027226b12c44887966b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/67fc1eb20058151475ad45556843dcd837a05dfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/67fc1eb20058151475ad45556843dcd837a05dfa","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDY3ZmMxZWIyMDA1ODE1MTQ3NWFkNDU1NTY4NDNkY2Q4MzdhMDVkZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/adb7489bd3b5c1f6f6d9bbb1f8ea21ff15fe23f6","sha":"adb7489bd3b5c1f6f6d9bbb1f8ea21ff15fe23f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/adb7489bd3b5c1f6f6d9bbb1f8ea21ff15fe23f6"}],"sha":"67fc1eb20058151475ad45556843dcd837a05dfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/67fc1eb20058151475ad45556843dcd837a05dfa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/adb7489bd3b5c1f6f6d9bbb1f8ea21ff15fe23f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T04:00:24Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Neck + turret: widen the firmware pulse backstop; calibrate the neck\n\nThe 1000-2000µs hard clamp was narrower than the servos'' real travel and\ncapped what calibration could reach; widen the backstop to 500-2500µs on\nboth pan/tilt boards (the host still clamps to the per-axis calibrated\nrange). Recalibrate the judge neck against real hardware using the new\nraw µs read-outs: pan spans the full range around a 1583µs center, tilt\nis restricted to 1500-1967µs over 0-30° (no downward gaze).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fad757de0ebbe10a64c5827ada278664d1174a5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/fad757de0ebbe10a64c5827ada278664d1174a5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/adb7489bd3b5c1f6f6d9bbb1f8ea21ff15fe23f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/adb7489bd3b5c1f6f6d9bbb1f8ea21ff15fe23f6","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKGFkYjc0ODliZDNiNWMxZjZmNmQ5YmJiMWY4ZWEyMWZmMTVmZTIzZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/200c302b33c8ff43b9df93f51c687a47f90a3e69","sha":"200c302b33c8ff43b9df93f51c687a47f90a3e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/200c302b33c8ff43b9df93f51c687a47f90a3e69"}],"sha":"adb7489bd3b5c1f6f6d9bbb1f8ea21ff15fe23f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/adb7489bd3b5c1f6f6d9bbb1f8ea21ff15fe23f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/200c302b33c8ff43b9df93f51c687a47f90a3e69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T04:00:24Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Console: show raw servo µs beside the aim sliders\n\nCalibrating meant guessing — the sliders speak logical degrees and the\ndegrees->raw transform lived host-side only. degToRaw() mirrors\nServoCal::to_raw exactly from the calibration data the panel already\nholds, so Judge Body and Turret aim rows now read e.g. \"pan 12° 1600 µs\"\nlive, including immediately after applying edited calibration values.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f74000f866ec31fc26bb328d7c0796632aa80a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/0f74000f866ec31fc26bb328d7c0796632aa80a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/200c302b33c8ff43b9df93f51c687a47f90a3e69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/200c302b33c8ff43b9df93f51c687a47f90a3e69","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDIwMGMzMDJiMzNjOGZmNDNiOWRmOTNmNTFjNjg3YTQ3ZjkwYTNlNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/37785cfca86a91604f8ad09c15e298c51a862df1","sha":"37785cfca86a91604f8ad09c15e298c51a862df1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/37785cfca86a91604f8ad09c15e298c51a862df1"}],"sha":"200c302b33c8ff43b9df93f51c687a47f90a3e69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/200c302b33c8ff43b9df93f51c687a47f90a3e69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/37785cfca86a91604f8ad09c15e298c51a862df1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T04:00:05Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Operator console: custom-print editor for the thermal printer\n\nNew Print tab: compose block documents (text with full ESC/POS styling,\nrules, feeds, QR, barcodes, dithered images), preview them on a dot-scaled\npaper strip, save/load named templates, and print through the existing\nprinter service (mode/transport/preflight reused; trial keepsakes and\noperator prints share one FIFO queue via a new PrintJob enum).\n\nSize-bounded mode guarantees an exact cut-to-cut strip length (e.g. the\n80x50mm plaque insert): a dot-exact height ledger, flex feed spacers that\nabsorb leftover length, optional image shrink-to-fit, and a precise fill\nfeed before a bare partial cut. Calibrated against the real POS-80:\nvertical commands (ESC J / ESC 3) move in Epson-default 1/360\" motion\nunits, not 203-dpi dots (a 50mm strip printed 28.6mm before conversion),\nand the head-to-blade dead zone measured 17.0mm -> 136 dots. Both are\nconfig knobs; a byte-stream-interpreting test pins the cut-to-cut math.\n\nQR codes are rasterized locally so heights are exact and previews are\npixel-true; images round-trip through /operator/print/preview_image for\nexact dithered previews. Templates persist in print_templates.json next\nto the config (gitignored). Print routes carry a 10MB body limit for\nbase64 images; everything else keeps axum''s 2MB default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b4763145f401315c7dc86d9e09ecfd1a8ad6f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/3b4763145f401315c7dc86d9e09ecfd1a8ad6f26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/37785cfca86a91604f8ad09c15e298c51a862df1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/37785cfca86a91604f8ad09c15e298c51a862df1","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKDM3Nzg1Y2ZjYTg2YTkxNjA0ZjhhZDA5YzE1ZTI5OGM1MWE4NjJkZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/ccd4f6144662b00e79adf1e87dabba6e90cdb80d","sha":"ccd4f6144662b00e79adf1e87dabba6e90cdb80d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/ccd4f6144662b00e79adf1e87dabba6e90cdb80d"}],"sha":"37785cfca86a91604f8ad09c15e298c51a862df1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/37785cfca86a91604f8ad09c15e298c51a862df1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/commits/ccd4f6144662b00e79adf1e87dabba6e90cdb80d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T00:45:36Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T22:20:19Z","email":"55170422+lbozz4@users.noreply.github.com","name":"lbozz4"},"message":"Docs: capture the thermal-strip booth backdrop idea\n\nBrainstorm notes (2026-07-10/11) for covering the OpenSauce booth''s\nchain-link rear wall in ~40 floor-length thermal-printer strips printed\non the keepsake printer — rigging, coverage math, fade handling, and\ncontent ideas. Idea stage, not started.","tree":{"sha":"422bc3759fc32cd6313de26e9d5ba15e754f0329","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/trees/422bc3759fc32cd6313de26e9d5ba15e754f0329"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/addisokw/WetCourt/git/commits/ccd4f6144662b00e79adf1e87dabba6e90cdb80d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55170422?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lbozz4","id":55170422,"login":"lbozz4","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTcwNDIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lbozz4","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/ccd4f6144662b00e79adf1e87dabba6e90cdb80d","node_id":"C_kwDOSWXeyNoAKGNjZDRmNjE0NDY2MmIwMGU3OWFkZjFlODdkYWJiYTZlOTBjZGI4MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/addisokw/WetCourt/commit/228a29de7be548db5cc425f70168e529e9947a2e","sha":"228a29de7be548db5cc425f70168e529e9947a2e","u