ogic untouched:\n- #070A12 dark theme with purple-led aurora (AI accent), grain overlay, and\n  Saira/Inter/JetBrains Mono typography\n- Header with crystal-ball ring, \"CLAUDE AI · REAL F1 DATA\" eyebrow, gradient\n  title; tabs converted to segmented glassmorphism control\n- Race banner as glass card with red accent bar and framed stat tiles for\n  safety car / rain chance\n- Contender cards: glass surfaces with team-color top bar, team-color glow on\n  hover, Saira ring numerals, win-chance ring base recolored to subtle white\n- Key Battle (red accent) and Dark Horse (gold accent) cards with mono\n  letter-spaced headers; simulator CTA as full red gradient bar with sliding\n  arrow\n- Simulator: sticky glass controls panel, dark-theme selects and option pills\n  (red gradient active state), predict button matching landing CTA\n- Results: Saira stat numerals (gold expected position, red expected points),\n  purple AI analysis card, green optimal setup card with pill chips, red fun\n  fact card; spinning F1 tire for both loading states\n- Car visual: surface retheme to #0B1020/#111829 glass card, gauge text in\n  Saira/mono, badges as mono pills — all weather/tyre/vibration animation\n  logic preserved\n- Circuit visual: glass card retheme, Saira stat values, mono labels\n- Guest view: themed glass overlay with btn-primary/btn-ghost matching landing\n\nFantasy (fantasy-mfe):\n- Same dark theme, aurora, grain, typography, and header pattern\n- Favourite team integration: welcome card accented in the user''s team color\n  (top bar, tinted border, blurred team-color glow inside the card, and a\n  \"★ <TEAM> FAN\" chip) via new getTeamColor map matching the signup palette\n- Feature cards on glass surfaces that lift and tint on hover; pulsing red\n  \"coming soon\" badge\n- Guest preview: themed budget bar with glowing red fill, dashed glass team\n  slots, driver cards with team-color edge, themed login overlay\n\nBuild config: raised fantasy-mfe anyComponentStyle budget to 8kb/16kb\n(predictor already at 10kb/20kb)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DpYEkv8xBcxAFffMSiuQrX","tree":{"sha":"7c920a56cdcbc783c1014563b2215c3a4357aa42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShivamSahdev8/f1-racelab-ui/git/trees/7c920a56cdcbc783c1014563b2215c3a4357aa42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShivamSahdev8/f1-racelab-ui/git/commits/862ef1b37e440120bc9cc36736c65f1e52718bc4","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c920a56cdcbc783c1014563b2215c3a4357aa42\nparent 054518551c1c2e9b88f731ddb14d3ca9999acf86\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781195754 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781195754 +0000\n\nredesign fantasy-mfe and predictor-mfe to match platform theme\n\nPredictor (predictor-mfe) — all prediction/simulation logic untouched:\n- #070A12 dark theme with purple-led aurora (AI accent), grain overlay, and\n  Saira/Inter/JetBrains Mono typography\n- Header with crystal-ball ring, \"CLAUDE AI · REAL F1 DATA\" eyebrow, gradient\n  title; tabs converted to segmented glassmorphism control\n- Race banner as glass card with red accent bar and framed stat tiles for\n  safety car / rain chance\n- Contender cards: glass surfaces with team-color top bar, team-color glow on\n  hover, Saira ring numerals, win-chance ring base recolored to subtle white\n- Key Battle (red accent) and Dark Horse (gold accent) cards with mono\n  letter-spaced headers; simulator CTA as full red gradient bar with sliding\n  arrow\n- Simulator: sticky glass controls panel, dark-theme selects and option pills\n  (red gradient active state), predict button matching landing CTA\n- Results: Saira stat numerals (gold expected position, red expected points),\n  purple AI analysis card, green optimal setup card with pill chips, red fun\n  fact card; spinning F1 tire for both loading states\n- Car visual: surface retheme to #0B1020/#111829 glass card, gauge text in\n  Saira/mono, badges as mono pills — all weather/tyre/vibration animation\n  logic preserved\n- Circuit visual: glass card retheme, Saira stat values, mono labels\n- Guest view: themed glass overlay with btn-primary/btn-ghost matching landing\n\nFantasy (fantasy-mfe):\n- Same dark theme, aurora, grain, typography, and header pattern\n- Favourite team integration: welcome card accented in the user''s team color\n  (top bar, tinted border, blurred team-color glow inside the card, and a\n  \"★ <TEAM> FAN\" chip) via new getTeamColor map matching the signup palette\n- Feature cards on glass surfaces that lift and tint on hover; pulsing red\n  \"coming soon\" badge\n- Guest preview: themed budget bar with glowing red fill, dashed glass team\n  slots, driver cards with team-color edge, themed login overlay\n\nBuild config: raised fantasy-mfe anyComponentStyle budget to 8kb/16kb\n(predictor already at 10kb/20kb)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DpYEkv8xBcxAFffMSiuQrX\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPF3xWr+\nEHpQ4N8jsrlvv4ScmS1iLFs2j56KySGgMudj5Tp6m+cWufmZutNpZAf9CSS8GFgblrHk1S2z4OTv\nZgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-11T16:36:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/ow