"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShivamSahdev8/f1-racelab-ui/commits/054518551c1c2e9b88f731ddb14d3ca9999acf86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T15:46:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T15:46:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"redesign stats-mfe and news-mfe to match landing/live theme\n\nStandings (stats-mfe):\n- #070A12 dark theme with aurora glows, grain overlay, Saira/Inter/JetBrains\n  Mono typography matching the rest of the platform\n- Segmented glassmorphism tab control (Drivers / Constructors) with red\n  gradient active state matching landing CTA\n- Team-color left border + team color dot per row; gold/silver/bronze podium\n  position styling with subtle row tints\n- Points progress bar per row visualising the gap to the championship leader,\n  filled with the team color and animated on load\n- Favourite team integration: rows matching the user''s signup favourite team\n  (via shared AuthStateService) get a team-tinted highlight, star marker on\n  drivers, \"YOUR TEAM\" badge on constructors, and a header chip\n- Wins shown as gold chips; spinning F1 tire loading state\n\nNews (news-mfe):\n- Same dark theme, aurora, grain, and typography\n- Glassmorphism article cards with thumbnail zoom-on-hover, bottom gradient\n  fade, and lift + red glow hover\n- First article rendered as a featured \"TOP STORY\" hero spanning two columns\n- \"NEW\" pulsing green badge for articles published within 6 hours\n- Favourite team integration: articles mentioning the user''s favourite team\n  get a team-color edge, glow, and a starred team tag in the card footer;\n  header shows a \"FOLLOWING <team>\" chip in team color\n- Live ticker dot in header; \"READ ARTICLE\" footer link slides on hover\n- Spinning F1 tire loading state consistent with live-mfe\n\nBuild config:\n- Raised anyComponentStyle budgets (8kb warn / 16kb error) for live, stats,\n  and news MFEs to accommodate the richer component styling\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DpYEkv8xBcxAFffMSiuQrX","tree":{"sha":"e5ed527ee511b9cb6412b9e8b6fc338920c3dba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShivamSahdev8/f1-racelab-ui/git/trees/e5ed527ee511b9cb6412b9e8b6fc338920c3dba3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShivamSahdev8/f1-racelab-ui/git/commits/054518551c1c2e9b88f731ddb14d3ca9999acf86","verification":{"payload":"tree e5ed527ee511b9cb6412b9e8b6fc338920c3dba3\nparent 6c7cce9a9f57d7884445fa1eda2ab64409b4e326\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781192782 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781192782 +0000\n\nredesign stats-mfe and news-mfe to match landing/live theme\n\nStandings (stats-mfe):\n- #070A12 dark theme with aurora glows, grain overlay, Saira/Inter/JetBrains\n  Mono typography matching the rest of the platform\n- Segmented glassmorphism tab control (Drivers / Constructors) with red\n  gradient active state matching landing CTA\n- Team-color left border + team color dot per row; gold/silver/bronze podium\n  position styling with subtle row tints\n- Points progress bar per row visualising the gap to the championship leader,\n  filled with the team color and animated on load\n- Favourite team integration: rows matching the user''s signup favourite team\n  (via shared AuthStateService) get a team-tinted highlight, star marker on\n  drivers, \"YOUR TEAM\" badge on constructors, and a header chip\n- Wins shown as gold chips; spinning F1 tire loading state\n\nNews (news-mfe):\n- Same dark theme, aurora, grain, and typography\n- Glassmorphism article cards with thumbnail zoom-on-hover, bottom gradient\n  fade, and lift + red glow hover\n- First article rendered as a featured \"TOP STORY\" hero spanning two columns\n- \"NEW\" pulsing green badge for articles published within 6 hours\n- Favourite team integration: articles mentioning the user''s favourite team\n  get a team-color edge, glow, and a starred team tag in the card footer;\n  header shows a \"FOLLOWING <team>\" chip in team color\n- Live ticker dot in header; \"READ ARTICLE\" footer link slides on hover\n- Spinning F1 tire loading state consistent with live-mfe\n\nBuild config:\n- Raised anyComponentStyle budgets (8kb warn / 16kb error) for live, stats,\n  and news MFEs to accommodate the richer component styling\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01DpYEkv8xBcxAFffMSiuQrX\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBKoqsW3\nw2i9nt6yvNUdBeNHrcBey06Gy5A4VkIOoxbICUP8zZv9msi2IErbOE3Pi1T01NtC0olqC2+zJtGD\nAw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-11T15:46:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:/