tml_url":"https://github.com/paulaardila-c","id":277835310,"login":"paulaardila-c","node_id":"U_kgDOEI9uLg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/commits/c4db4c58e4890133d00dbccaa96d7d3c2b807235/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T03:12:51Z","email":"mariapaula.ardila@bia.app","name":"Paula Ardila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T03:12:51Z","email":"mariapaula.ardila@bia.app","name":"Paula Ardila"},"message":"feat: puntos extra del Reto 3 (loading + errores + mobile + flair)\n\nLOADING\n- Linear progress bar fija arriba durante refetch\n- ClienteCardSkeleton imita la estructura real para evitar layout shift\n- Mensaje \"Cargando clientes...\" con spinner inline\n- Skeletons con stagger delay\n\nERROR HANDLING\n- ErrorState diferencia \"backend caido\" (network) de errores genericos\n- Backend caido: muestra ilustracion + comando exacto para levantar la API\n- Snackbar para errores de mutaciones individuales (delete / update)\n\nMOBILE\n- useMediaQuery para detectar breakpoint\n- FAB flotante (Floating Action Button) en lugar del boton \"Nuevo cliente\"\n- Header con padding reducido en mobile\n- Toolbar con stack vertical en mobile, horizontal en desktop\n- Filtros por estado wrap automatico\n- Snackbar reposicionado para no taparse con el FAB\n\nFLAIR (toques visuales)\n- Hook useAnimatedCount: stats cuentan de 0 a su valor con easeOutCubic\n- Header con gradiente animado (shift de colores cada 12s)\n- Indicador \"live\" con pulse cuando la API responde, gris cuando esta caida\n- Stagger fade-in en las cards (delay incremental por indice)\n- Barra de distribucion visual mostrando % activos/prospectos/inactivos\n- Hover effects con translateY en cards y stat boxes\n- Confeti emoji en snackbar de creacion\n- Empty state mejorado con \"Crear primer cliente\" CTA","tree":{"sha":"37b85e90fdc36125122dd3217bcd2d81238e40d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/git/trees/37b85e90fdc36125122dd3217bcd2d81238e40d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/git/commits/c4db4c58e4890133d00dbccaa96d7d3c2b807235","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277835310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paulaardila-c","id":277835310,"login":"paulaardila-c","node_id":"U_kgDOEI9uLg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/commit/c4db4c58e4890133d00dbccaa96d7d3c2b807235","node_id":"C_kwDOSWeEJdoAKGM0ZGI0YzU4ZTQ4OTAxMzNkMDBkYmNjYWE5NmQ3ZDNjMmI4MDcyMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/commit/1fb90fe916fccd80f4ff669d04d7a3df2a849569","sha":"1fb90fe916fccd80f4ff669d04d7a3df2a849569","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/commits/1fb90fe916fccd80f4ff669d04d7a3df2a849569"}],"sha":"c4db4c58e4890133d00dbccaa96d7d3c2b807235","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/commits/c4db4c58e4890133d00dbccaa96d7d3c2b807235"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277835310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paulaardila-c","id":277835310,"login":"paulaardila-c","node_id":"U_kgDOEI9uLg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/commits/1fb90fe916fccd80f4ff669d04d7a3df2a849569/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T03:08:21Z","email":"mariapaula.ardila@bia.app","name":"Paula Ardila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T03:08:21Z","email":"mariapaula.ardila@bia.app","name":"Paula Ardila"},"message":"refactor: cambiar Productos por Gestion de Clientes (CRM)\n\nMas alineado con casos de uso reales de la empresa.\n\n- Nuevos types: Cliente, NuevoCliente, EstadoCliente (activo/prospecto/inactivo)\n- apiClient consume /api/clientes (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)\n- Hooks: useClientes, useCrearCliente, useActualizarEstadoCliente, useEliminarCliente\n- ClienteCard con avatar generado (iniciales + color por hash), datos de contacto,\n  menu para cambiar estado y boton eliminar\n- NuevoClienteDialog con validacion de email y campos: nombre, email, telefono,\n  empresa, ciudad, estado, notas\n- Pagina rediseniada: header con 4 stats (total/activos/prospectos/inactivos),\n  toolbar con busqueda + toggle por estado + crear, grid responsive de cards","tree":{"sha":"fe4b997f1cb850c5ba83b6ad4a8f6c41b1a16a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/git/trees/fe4b997f1cb850c5ba83b6ad4a8f6c41b1a16a20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/git/commits/1fb90fe916fccd80f4ff669d04d7a3df2a849569","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277835310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paulaardila-c","id":277835310,"login":"paulaardila-c","node_id":"U_kgDOEI9uLg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paulaardila-c/reto3-