 productos consumiendo API REST (Reto 3)\n\n- Modulo Notifications con CRUD de productos\n- Cliente API tipado (fetch wrapper) + types compartidos con backend\n- React Query: useProductos, useCategorias, useCrearProducto, useEliminarProducto\n- Pagina con header gradient + stats, toolbar con busqueda y filtro por categoria\n- ProductoCard responsive con hover effects, chips de stock y categoria\n- NuevoProductoDialog con validacion y loading state\n- Skeleton loading + manejo de errores con boton de reintento\n- Snackbar para feedback de acciones\n- Endpoints consumidos: GET productos, GET categorias, POST productos, DELETE productos/:id","tree":{"sha":"db7e58192f69f46b9ac1f507cc24c17655284bf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/git/trees/db7e58192f69f46b9ac1f507cc24c17655284bf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paulaardila-c/reto3-clientes-crm/git/commits/e13b9a58450086f93766904690f6d699a744fce0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277835310?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/paulaardila-c","id":277835310,"login":"paulaardila-c","node_id":"U_kgDOEI9uLg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulaardila-c/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gith